<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EXO" style="id">- Mbembe Adun [MFNAdun]</book>
  <para style="h">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga</para>
  <para style="toc1">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga</para>
  <para style="toc2">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EXO 1" />
  <para style="s1">Anọng p'Israẹl p'achin z'Ijip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 1:1" />Ma wọ ode ache p'ajinọngva p'Israẹl kw'obir okpena Jekọb p'uwa machin z'Ijip, ọnọng-ọnọng ọttara ẹsọhmmọr chẹ: <verse eid="EXO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 1:2" />Reubẹn ọmaana Simeọn, ọmaana Lẹvi, ọttara Juda, <verse eid="EXO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 1:3" />Isaka ọmaana Zẹbulun, ọttara Bẹnjamin, <verse eid="EXO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 1:4" />Dan ọttara Naphtali, Gad ọttara Asha. <verse eid="EXO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 1:5" />Efonamma ch'Jekọb kibungọ-kibungọ wa ede anọng arọbh attaan okwuma ijobh. Wa Josẹph okkikken oninga z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 1:6" />Wa Josẹph ọmaana ivotte pẹ mape maphyir. Eyokinọng-kaan ndo ch'iwa etor-ẹ ny'ogbe nwo ebira epe maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 1:7" />Okenaka, wa anọng p'Israẹl makwu asaabh, mabir abhakẹ abhon ayok, manyaamẹ, mafu izek.<verse eid="EXO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Phero ọnang anọng p'Israẹl irem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 1:8" />Ny'ogbe nwo, ẹkọma ch'Ijip ekwu eyena ọvaarnọng ọbhakwẹ kw'ina Josẹph ozong. <verse eid="EXO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 1:9" />Ọvaarnọng nwo oben anọng pẹ bẹ́, “Nkk'aza ose kw'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'asaabha, mabira agaangẹ ọtam ayọhnga mina. <verse eid="EXO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 1:10" />Màkwu motima ekkoji ọkpọka ọsaabh mva fabẹ. Ó̱de nna minna osi, égbong étto, bẹ mm'ator awawunanọng pamina marima mina ábẹ̀, pira marọbh arik ẹkọma chamina.”<verse eid="EXO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 1:11" />Ofona nya, anọng p'Ijip anang anọng p'Israẹl akker-atọhmnọng p'mad-atima atọhm-gbọhka anang bẹ irem. Masi ibhondim z'Pitọm ọmaana Rameses mach'ibhon s'mad-asok ekpo py'Phero. <verse eid="EXO 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 1:12" />Okenaka, k'ose kw'manang bẹ irem, minna kw'ọsaabh fabẹ odo ọttar-ọttara. Anọng p'Ijip makwu aninga k'ojora f'anọng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 1:13" />Nya wọ kw'nna ado anọng p'Israẹl irem anang mawuriji. <verse eid="EXO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 1:14" />Mabir asi akpen agbẹrẹ bẹ, okurọ k'atọhm-gbọhka p'isọhm oyiyika, ọmaana ata p'isọhm orirọbha, ọttara agbugbuna k'akira k'akira z'iwonọ. Ny'atọhm-gbọhka mbo pabẹ maphyir, wa anọng p'Ijip mad-asi bẹ ẹyaaka mach'abira.<verse eid="EXO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 1:15" />Nya o, ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip oyerẹ panọng p'ad-akkerẹ aHiburu-panọng ọmaan, p'akpen Shiphra ọmaana Pua. Oben bẹ bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 1:16" />“Ogbe kw'makkerẹ aHiburu-panọng ọmaan, óde maze bẹ́, ọmaanẹ ojinọngnwa, màfhẹ-ẹ. Okenaka, óde ọmaanẹ kwanọngnwa, m'ikẹ kàfhọ.” <verse eid="EXO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 1:17" />Okenaka, akker-panọng-ọmaan mbo m'ntọhna s'ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip ọnang bẹ katọk okurọ ch'mayen ojora f'Ibinọkpaabyi. Wa mad-atte ajinọngva ọbọhk maruk. <verse eid="EXO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 1:18" />Ofona nya, ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip oyerẹ akker-panọng-ọmaan mbo, ọbọbh bẹ bẹ́, “Kayen kw'masi minna? Osempira matte ajinọngva ọbọhk maruk?”<verse eid="EXO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 1:19" />Akker-panọng-ọmaan mbo mapọhna Phero bẹ́, “AHiburu-panọng mach'panọng p'Ijip kade e. Bẹ mad-agaangẹ ettem amaan iva pabẹ, pira akker-anọng-ọmaan napyirẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 1:20" />Minna wọ kw'Ibinọkpaabyi osi akker-anọng-ọmaan mbo ejibha, anọng p'Israẹl akwu asaabh mawuriji, mabira ayena ẹfa. <verse eid="EXO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 1:21" />Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang akker-anọng-ọmaan mbo isọhmmọr sabẹ oyenẹ okurọ ch'mayen ojora fẹ.<verse eid="EXO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 1:22" />Nya o, Phero ọnang anọng pẹ maphyir ọsana bẹ́, “Ojinọngnwa kpenamkpen kw'oHiburu-kwanọng im'ọmaan, màtọk-ẹ bharẹ z'ọraanga kw'Nile, màtte panọngva ọbọhk maruk.”<verse eid="EXO 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EXO 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹmmaana ch'Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 2:1" />Ny'ogbe nwo, wa ojinọng wanẹ kw'ofon k'efona ch'Lẹvi ọtọk kwanọng kw'obir ofona ny'efona ndo. <verse eid="EXO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 2:2" />Kwanọng nwo okwu otima ibhọr, ọmaan ojinọngnwa. Ch'oze bẹ́, nnwa nwo ojibh-ojibh, ọtọk-ẹ odubh k'aphe attaan. <verse eid="EXO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 2:3" />Ch'okwu oze bẹ́, ọdọk kẹ mokpo odubh, ọtọk-ẹ oyika k'ikariba s'matim ettimma ayok, matima ibaar akpa amma p'ikariba njo maphyir, pira notinẹ sẹ, od-osok z'agwagwa p'araangakonga. <verse eid="EXO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 2:4" />Ọgbaanọkka kw'nnwa nwo k'ẹpanọng, obe z'ororo okker-ẹ bẹ́, oze odik kw'im'oyin ọmaana nnwa nwo.<verse eid="EXO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 2:5" />Ny'ogbe nwo, ominanwa kw'Phero obina, oyin esigbobha z'ọraanga. Aminava p'ad-ator-ẹ, matọn azenga ny'araangakonga. Ominanwa kw'Phero oze ikariba njo ny'ottem kw'agwagwa mbo. Ọtọhm ominanwa wanẹ kwẹ bẹ́, od-odunga ochen-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 2:6" />K'ose kw'owong ikariba njo, oze ọbhanwa kw'od-obhom ẹmọng z'ẹtaanga. Okwo ọsẹ-ẹ z'ettem maa, oben bẹ́, “Nnwa nwoma ode oHiburu-nwa wanẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 2:7" />Nya o, ọgbaanọkka kw'nnwa nwo k'ẹpanọng ọbọbh ominanwa kw'Phero bẹ́, “Ma, nd-nyerẹ oHiburu-kwanọng wanẹ okwu ọrọk nnwa nwoma ọnang-ọ yirẹ?”<verse eid="EXO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 2:8" />Ominanwa kw'Phero ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Iye e, zọhng yerẹ!” Minna kw'ofon od-oyerẹ ọkka kw'ọbhanwa nwo. <verse eid="EXO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 2:9" />Ominanwa kw'Phero oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tọka ọbhanwa nwoma, zọhng rọk-ẹ nang-m. Kaam m'mkpọ-ọ akpuka.” Minna kw'kwanọng nwo ọtọk ọbhanwa nwo ọd-ọrọk. <verse eid="EXO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 2:10" />K'ogbe kw'nnwa nwo ikk'okwura, ọtọk-ẹ ochena ominanwa kw'Phero mach'nnwa kwẹ. Ọkpẹ-ẹ, Mosẹs<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mosẹs </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'eHiburu oyinẹ ọttọhk mach'ewonga k'asi.</char></note>, oben bẹ́, “Nwong-ẹ z'asi.”<verse eid="EXO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosẹs ọrọbhọ ozeng z'Midiyan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 2:11" />Otum k'ewu danẹ, ch'Mosẹs ikk'obenga k'odik, obina bẹ́, od-omyinga anọng pẹ, p'ade anọng p'Israẹl. Oze irem s'anọng pẹ mad-aze k'atọhm-gbọhka p'mad-asi. Nya kw'oze oJipnọng ch'od-ottema oHiburu-nọng wanẹ kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 2:12" />Minna kw'okke ọkọbha, ọnọng koze. Ọbọka oJipnọng nwo ọfhọ, ọnọhng-ẹ ny'oyiyeng. <verse eid="EXO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 2:13" />Ewu esobh nya, Mosẹs obira oyin k'iyaan, od-okebha aHiburu-jinọng afa ch'mad-asi erima. Oben oyok kw'opin-opinẹ bẹ́, “Ode yen kw'ad-attema oyok oHiburu-nọng minna?”<verse eid="EXO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 2:14" />Ojinọng nwo ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Anyi wọ ọsọ-ọ oso, ọmaana ọkpaar-aponga kwamina? Ma, ad-akam bẹ́, afhọ-m mach'wendo afhọ oJipnọng?” Nya o, Mosẹs ojor-ẹ, ochibhẹ bẹ́, “Ńnòsi odik nwo kw'wendo nsi, kk'ọyaaka k'odik ọkkọkka.”<verse eid="EXO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 2:15" />K'ogbe kw'odik nwo otto Phero k'itọhng, oror Mosẹs bẹ́, ọfhẹ-ẹ. Ofona nya, Mosẹs ọrọbh nya ch'Phero oning, od-oruk z'ẹkọma ch'Midiyan, od-oninga ẹwọr ọnyọma esipe danẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 2:16" />Wa ọfọhn-nja kw'Midiyan kw'obhonọ panọngva achenọmfa, oning nya. Panọngva mbo mad-akwu akaabha asi ake k'akkora p'mm'anang etirakpo py'otte kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 2:17" />Akker-arọkimaan banẹ makwu akwubh bẹ. Okenaka, Mosẹs obina <char style="it">bẹ́ bik </char> okwu ọkkaana bẹ, obir ọkaabha asi ọnang etirakpo pyabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 2:18" />K'ogbe kw'aminava mbo makwun akebha Reuẹl kw'ode otte kwabẹ, ọbọbh bẹ bẹ́, “Ode yen kw'masẹrẹ minna menda?”<verse eid="EXO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 2:19" />Mapọhna otte bẹ́, “OJipnọng wanẹ wọ ọkkaan mina z'mbọhk s'akkerẹ-arọkimaan e. Kẹ wọ ọkaabha asi ọnang mina, obira ọkaabha ọnang etirakpo pyamina.”<verse eid="EXO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 2:20" />Otte ọbọbh aminava pẹ bẹ́, “Ojinọng oyenẹ kẹ? Kayen kw'mafon arik-ẹ za? Màzọhng yer-ẹ okwu ochi ọttọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 2:21" />Ofona nya, Mosẹs okwu ochera bẹ́, m'oruk ọmaana Reuẹl. Reuẹl ọtọka Zipọra kw'ode nnwa kwẹ, ọnang Mosẹs k'ọbada. <verse eid="EXO 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 2:22" />Zipọra ọmaan Mosẹs ojinọngnwa. Mosẹs ọkpẹ-ẹ Gẹrshọm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gẹrshọm </char><char style="ft" closed="false">k'eHiburu oyinẹ bẹ́, okikennọng.</char></note>, oben bẹ́, “Kaam n'nde okikennọng m'anọng k'izek.”<verse eid="EXO 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ẹmọng ch'anọng p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 2:23" />Ch'iwa ocho k'ẹkaan kk'ọkpana, ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip okwu ope. Anọng p'Israẹl achinẹ ebira chabẹ, mabir abhom aror ẹkkaana. Ẹmọng chabẹ ed-etto Ibinọkpaabyi k'itọhng. <verse eid="EXO 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 2:24" />Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhaang ichichinẹ sabẹ nya o, ojima echekẹ ch'osi ọmaana Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb. <verse eid="EXO 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 2:25" />Minna kw'Ibinọkpaabyi oze anọng p'Israẹl okwo, obir osi achibhẹ p'amaan k'ejibha chabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EXO 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ibinọkpaabyi oyerẹ Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 3:1" />K'ewu danẹ, Mosẹs od-okkerẹ arọkimaan p'Jẹtro kw'ode ọnyẹ kwẹ, obir ode ọfọhn-nja kw'ẹkọma ch'Midiyan. Otima arọkimaan mbo ozenga ochina z'ibyi s'ikem ebhira, za ch'anọng nna arukọ, z'Horẹb kw'ode egbe ch'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 3:2" />Ny'ekpondaak ch'eyinẹ ny'ottem kw'echi ch'ẹwọm-ọwọma, nya kw'ozeng-eden kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oyinẹ okebha Mosẹs. Mosẹs oze bẹ́, echi ndo ening nya ẹwọm ekpon, okenaka, ọttọhk kẹkwọmọ. <verse eid="EXO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 3:3" />Minna kw'Mosẹs obenẹ bẹ́, “Kaam m'nzenga nyọma za, ọfha nze okkonọ-kkonọdikse nwoma mawuriji. Kayen kw'echi m'ẹwọma ekpon, ening ọttọhk ẹkwọmọ?”<verse eid="EXO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 3:4" />K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oze ch'Mosẹs kk'ozenga ọnyọma za bẹ́, od-odo oze, Ibinọkpaabyi oninga ny'ottem kw'echi ndo, oyer-ẹ bẹ́, “Mosẹs! Mosẹs!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 3:4">Mosẹs ochera bẹ́, “Ttatta, kirẹ kaam ma.”<verse eid="EXO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 3:5" />Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọdọk kidaam kanyọma, wọra ntọkọ sọ z'mmo, kirẹ ibyi s'abe nya, ide izek s'awuriji.” <verse eid="EXO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 3:6" />Obir oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam wọ nde Ibinọkpaabyi kw'atte kwọ, mbir nde Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Abraham, ọmaana kw'Isaak, ọttara kw'Jekọb.” Mosẹs otubha ititika sẹ, okurọ ojora bẹ́, oning Ibinọkpaabyi oze.<verse eid="EXO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 3:7" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “K'odik ọkkọkka, kaam kk'irem s'anọng paam p'aning z'Ijip nza. Kk'bẹ mmaanga ch'mad-abhom ẹmọng okurọ irem s'akker-atọhmnọng mad-anang bẹ. Irem sabẹ kk'aam itwa. <verse eid="EXO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 3:8" />Ofona nya, kaam kk'nkwa bẹ́, nkwu nrọbha bẹ z'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip, mbira nrọbha bẹ ny'izek njo, ntima bẹ nchina z'izek s'ijibh-ojibh, ibir iwen-owen, izek s'abasi ọmaana ọkọhn elor-olorọ, izek s'anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana s'anọng p'Het, ọmaana s'anọng p'Amọr, ọmaana anọng p'Periz, ọmaana s'anọng p'Hiv ọttara s'anọng p'Jebus. <verse eid="EXO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 3:9" />Ẹmọng ch'anọng p'Israẹl abhomọ kk'aam ẹtta k'itọhng, mbira nze irem s'anọng p'Ijip mad-anang bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 3:10" />Ofona nya, kaam m'ntọhm-ọ z'Phero bẹ́, ad-atọka anọng paam p'Israẹl atima abina ny'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 3:11" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Kaam nde anyi, kw'im'nta z'Phero bẹ́, nd-ntọka anọng p'Israẹl ntima mbina z'Ijip o?”<verse eid="EXO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 3:12" />Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Kaam m'nninga mmaan-ọ. Ẹkọhka ch'im'atima azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ ntọhm-ọ ede bẹ́: k'ogbe kw'ikk'anọng mbo atima abina z'Ijip, bọnga mm'akpobh-m m'egbe nda.”<verse eid="EXO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 3:13" />Mosẹs ọpọhna Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ó̱de nd-mben anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ibinọkpaabyi kw'abatte makpobh wọ ọtọhm-m k'abọnga,’ óde mabọbh-m bẹ́, ‘Kẹ okpen yen?’ kaam m'ntek bẹ yen o?”<verse eid="EXO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 3:14" />Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “KAAM WỌ NDE NWO KW'NDE.” Obir oben bẹ́, “Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, KAAM WỌ NDE, wọ ọtọhm-m k'abọnga.”<verse eid="EXO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 3:15" />Ibinọkpaabyi obir oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'abatte makpobh, Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Abraham ọmaana kw'Isaak, ọttara kw'Jekọb, kẹ wọ ọtọhm-m bẹ́ nkebha bọnga.’ Eche chaam ch'mm'nad-atima ajim-m k'ipemaanitor, dọ ma.<verse eid="EXO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 3:16" />“Zọhng, ad-atobha asogbọhkọnọng p'Israẹl, aben bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'abatte pabọnga, Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Abraham, ọmaana kw'Isaak, ọttara kw'Jekọb, kk'oyina okebh-m, oben-m bẹ́: Kaam kk'bọnga otum nka, mbira nze k'ose kw'mad-asi bọnga ny'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 3:17" />Kaam kk'ncheka bẹ́, m'nrọhbha bọnga ny'irem njo s'mad-aze ny'Ijip, ntima bọnga nzeng z'izek ọkkọkka s'ide izek s'abasi, ọmaana ọkọhn malor-olorọ, izek s'anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana s'anọng p'Het, ọmaana s'anọng p'Amọr, ọmaana s'anọng p'Periz, ọmaana s'anọng p'Hiv, ọttara s'anọng p'Jebus.’<verse eid="EXO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 3:18" />“Asogbọhkọnọng p'Israẹl mm'ayong-ọ itọhng. Kọ ọmaana bẹ mm'ata z'ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip mad-aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu, kk'ottema ọmaana mina. Tte mina ọbọhk mọta ozenga kw'iwu ittaan z'izek s'owora, mfha mọd-ọfọhnọ nja ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina.’ <verse eid="EXO 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 3:19" />Okenaka, kaam kk'nzonga bẹ́, ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip bọnga ọbọhk motte mafona, oye bẹ́, ẹfa chiden dọ im'ẹgwẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 3:20" />Minna kw'kaam m'ntima ẹfa chaam nsi anọng p'Ijip itama, mbir nsi ikkonọ-kkonọdik saabhada ny'abẹ k'ikpakaana. K'okpongannamgbe, kẹ m'otte bọnga ọbọhk, mafona.<verse eid="EXO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 3:21" />“Kaam m'nsi anọng p'Ijip m'ayena nttem ọkkọkka amaana anọng mba, mfha k'ogbe kw'mm'abina, màning mbọhk-mbọhk azeng. <verse eid="EXO 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 3:22" />Tte kwanọng kpenamkpen ọbọbh oyok-oter, ọmaana kwanọng kw'matọn aruk, ekpo mach'asilva, ọmaana agol, ọttara ẹfọrakpo, py'mm'afọra aminava, ọmaana ajinọngva pabọnga. Minna wọ kw'mm'atima ana anọng p'Ijip ekpo.”<verse eid="EXO 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EXO 4" />
  <para style="s">Nkọhka s'Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 4:1" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọpọhna Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “M'nsi yen, óde bẹ nna kaam itọhng ayong, m'odik kwaam kabir achera? Wanẹma, maben-m bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kọ koyinẹ okebha.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 4:2" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọbọbh-ẹ bẹ́, “Bọng-ọttọhk f'atim ny'ọbọhk kwọ?” Kẹ ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ochikwura e.”<verse eid="EXO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 4:3" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bharẹ ny'izek.” K'ose kw'ọbharẹ ochikwura nwo ny'izek, ochikwura nwo ọbhakẹ ozeng ijọhk, Mosẹs ọrọbh, ọzọkọ nnam-nnam. <verse eid="EXO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 4:4" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nemẹ ọbọhk kwọ bọk-ẹ ny'ẹsara.” K'ose kw'Mosẹs onemẹ ọbọhk ọbọka ijọhk njo, minna kw'ibir ibhakẹ izeng ochikwura ny'ikẹ k'ọbọhk. <verse eid="EXO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 4:5" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Si minna mfha bẹ machera bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ab'atte pabẹ: Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb, kẹ kk'oyina okebh-ọ.”<verse eid="EXO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 4:6" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obir oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Yika ọbọhk ny'ọnọhma-baba kwọ ẹtaanga.” K'ose kw'Mosẹs oyik ọbọhk kwẹ nya, m'okwu ọrọbha, ọbọhk kwẹ node okpokora, owur <char style="it">bẹ́ faan</char>. <verse eid="EXO 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 4:7" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi noben-ẹ bẹ́, “Bir yika ọbọhk nwo ny'ọnọhma-baba kwọ.” Minna kw'Mosẹs oyik ọbọhk nwo. Nọrọbh o, oze bẹ́, okpokora nwo kk'ọsa, ọbọhk nwo nobir ode mbengana mach'ifor sẹ ide.<verse eid="EXO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 4:8" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Ó̱de bẹ nna odik kwọ acher, m'kọ itọhng k'echeden-kọhka kabir ayonga, bẹ makpokpo achera amaana ẹkọhka ttong mfa. <verse eid="EXO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 4:9" />Okenaka, óde bẹ nna nkọhka njoma mfa acher amaana, m'ikọ itọhng kabir ayonga, kaabha asi ny'ọraanga kw'Nile, abyenga ny'ogbin. Asi mbo p'nkk'akkaabha ny'ọraanga, mm'abhakẹ azeng izẹ ny'ogbin.”<verse eid="EXO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 4:10" />Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, tọma za maa, pyirẹ ma ch'ad-agbaak odik anang kaam ọtọhmnọng kwọ, kọ azong ma bẹ́, kaam nd-mgbaak ẹdẹngẹ, mbir nyekẹ odik.”<verse eid="EXO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 4:11" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Anyi wọ ọnang ọnọng ẹmma ch'od-otima ọgbaak odik o? Anyi wọ ọsẹ-ẹ ọkpa itọhng, wanẹma, ọkpa ẹmma o? Anyi wọ ọsẹ-ẹ oze iyaan, wanẹma, ọkpa achen o? Ma, kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi azang yirẹ? <verse eid="EXO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 4:12" />Nya o, zọhng madidanma. Kaam m'nkkaan-ọ k'obenadik, mbir mkpebh-ọ ose kw'im'agbaak.”<verse eid="EXO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 4:13" />Okenaka, Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ototo, tọhm ọnọng ọdọk-ọdọk.”<verse eid="EXO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 4:14" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obhem ettem ọmaana Mosẹs, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Aarọn kw'ode agbaanakka kw'ofon ẹkọma ch'Lẹvi, oning za. Kaam nzong bẹ́, kẹ okpo ọgbaakadik mawuriji. Kẹ oter okwuma z'eden bẹ́, okwu okebh-ọ. Ettem m'elebh-ẹ ọkpan bẹ́, ọzọ-ọ. <verse eid="EXO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 4:15" />Kọ m'ad-agbaak odik anang-ẹ, abir akẹ-ẹ idik s'im'ọgbaak ny'ẹmma; kaam m'nkkaana bọnga anọng afa k'ọgbaakadik, mbira mgbaak bọnga ose kw'mm'asi. <verse eid="EXO 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 4:16" />Aarọn m'ọd-ọgbaak odik ọnang anọng mba k'ikọ k'eso. Kẹ mọd-ọgbaak idik mach'ode kọ oyenẹ wọ agbaakẹ, obir ode mach'ikọ ade Ibinọkpaabyi anang-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 4:17" />Do ochikwura nwoma tima z'ọbọhk, ọfha ad-atima asi nkọhka s'ipe anọng ifor.”<verse eid="EXO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosẹs ọkpa nnam z'Ijip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 4:18" />Minna kw'Mosẹs od-okebha ọnyẹ kwẹ Jẹtro, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Tte mkpa nnam z'Ijip, nd-nze óde anọng paam atim arukọ akpen za.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 4:18">Jẹtro oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Zọhng k'ọdaam.”<verse eid="EXO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 4:19" />Wa ch'Mosẹs otim oning z'Midiyan, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ obena bẹ́, “Kpa nnam z'Ijip, kirẹ anọng mbo p'makamẹ bẹ́, mafhọ-ọ, nkk'apa-kpo.” <verse eid="EXO 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 4:20" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọtọka kwanọng kwẹ, ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ, ọnana k'ẹnyanya, okwu ọtọka ochikwura kw'Ibinọkpaabyi otima. Makpa nnam z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 4:21" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ó̱de apyirẹ z'Ijip, si ikkonọ-kkonọdik s'nnang-ọ ẹfa bẹ́, asi akọhka Phero. Okenaka, kaam m'nsẹ-ẹ ọgaangẹ ettem, obhum bẹ́, otte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona. <verse eid="EXO 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 4:22" />Nya o, ben Phero bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, Israẹl wọ ode ocheden-jinọngnwa kwaam. <verse eid="EXO 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 4:23" />Kaam kk'ọ mbena bẹ́, “Tte nnwa kwaam ọbọhk od-okpobh-m. Okenaka, ch'ikk'abhuma bẹ́, attẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona, kaam m'mfhọ ocheden-jinọngnwa kwọ.” ’ ”<verse eid="EXO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 4:24" />Nya ch'iwa Mosẹs otim oning ny'ozenga nwo, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oyin okebh-ẹ ch'mabhingẹ ny'eden, ọkam bẹ́, ọfhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 4:25" />Okenaka, Zipọra kw'ode kwanọng kw'Mosẹs otima ẹta ch'ẹjaabhẹ mach'imaana, obhirẹ ọnọm f'ojinọngnwa kwẹ, ọtọka otwu Mosẹs ny'mmokpatọkọ, oben bẹ́, “Fona m'izẹ nja, kọ ọttara kaam nkk'ọgba k'ọbada.” <verse eid="EXO 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 4:26" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otte Mosẹs ọbọhk oruk. Ofona ny'ẹnọhmbhirẹ ndo, Zipọra oben bẹ́, “Fona m'izẹ nja kọ ọttara kaam nkk'ọgba k'ọbada.”<verse eid="EXO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 4:27" />Ny'ogbe nwo, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Aarọn bẹ́, “Zọhng za ch'anọng nna arukọ, akebha Mosẹs za.” Minna kw'Aarọn ofon od-okebha Mosẹs z'egbe ch'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọbaak-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 4:28" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọgbaak Aarọn idik njo maphyir s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena bẹ́, ọgbaak, ọttara nkọhka s'im'ipe ọnọng ifor s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, osi.<verse eid="EXO 4:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 4:29" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn mad-ayerẹ ọkwa kw'asogbọhkọnọng p'Israẹl maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 4:30" />Aarọn otek bẹ idik njo maphyir s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs ọgbaaka, obir osi nkọhka ny'abẹ k'ikpakaana. <verse eid="EXO 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 4:31" />Wa anọng mbo macher amaana Mosẹs. Ch'mabhaang bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'bẹ okwo ọza k'irem s'mad-atọka, maraka nso akpobha Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 4:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EXO 5" />
  <para style="s">Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn mattem ọmaana Phero</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 5:1" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn mad-akebha Phero, matek-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl, obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Tte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, ọfha mad-asi odidaama kw'ikpukpobha anang-m, z'ibyi s'owora.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 5:2" />Phero oben bẹ́, “Anyi wọ ode Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi nwo kw'kaam m'mkpobha maa, ntte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mafona? Kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi nwo kinzong. Anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mìntte mafona.”<verse eid="EXO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 5:3" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu kk'ottema ọmaana mina. Ototo, tte mina ọbọhk mosi ozenga k'iwu ittaan ochina z'ibyi s'owora, mọd-ọfọhnọ nja ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina, ọfha oning ikọhmaanatama, wanẹma, ọkkangkkang otim osi mina itama.”<verse eid="EXO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 5:4" />Ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip oben Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn bẹ́, “Kayen kw'mawọhkọ anọng akpọka ọtọhm fabẹ osisi? Màkpa nnam z'abọnga k'itọhm!” <verse eid="EXO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 5:5" />Phero obir oben bẹ́, “Kirẹ ose kw'anọng p'izek nja nkk'asaabha, makkerẹ nya makpọka bẹ ọtọhm osisi.”<verse eid="EXO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 5:6" />Ny'ewu ndo madanẹ-danẹ, Phero ọnang akker-abira ọmaana akker-itọhm p'Israẹl ẹfa bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 5:7" />“Màkpọka anọng mba azizaarẹ-bukọ p'nd-atima arọhbha ata p'ọsọhm, oninang. Màtte mad-azeng mmo aror. <verse eid="EXO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 5:8" />Okenaka, si bẹ marọhbha ọta-bhik kw'mad-akkikken arọhbha, mawanẹ, oning ẹmma obekẹ. Ọkpọhra vọ f'mad-azeng ábẹ̀ mabhom akpẹk-m bẹ́, ‘Tte mina ọbọhk mofona, mọd-ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnang Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 5:9" />Nang ajinọng mbo atọhmgbọhka masi, mfha maning ogbe ayen ayonga itọhng k'afọra.”<verse eid="EXO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 5:10" />Nya o, akker-abira ọttara akker-itọhm p'Israẹl mafona mad-atek anọng mbo bẹ́, “Phero obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Kaam ọdọk bọnga azizaarẹ-bukọ p'nd-atima arọhbha ata minang. <verse eid="EXO 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 5:11" />Màzọhng ror azizaarẹ-bukọ p'nd-atima arọhbha ata k'ibyi s'mm'akpo aze. Ọtọhm fabọnga m'ottonga obhik mach'od-okkikken ode.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 5:12" />Minna kw'anọng p'Israẹl makpaang k'ibyi kpenamkpen ny'Ijip, maror azizaarẹ-bukọ p'nd-atima arọhbha ata. <verse eid="EXO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 5:13" />Akker-abira mbo mawọkọ bẹ. Maben bẹ bẹ́, “Màchera itọhm sabọnga si k'ose kw'nd-akkikken asi k'ogbe kw'mad-anang bọnga azizaarẹ-bukọ p'ata orirọhbha.” <verse eid="EXO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 5:14" />Akker-abira p'Phero mabọka akker-itọhm p'Israẹl p'bẹ matek, mattema bẹ nkwur, mabir abọbh bẹ bẹ́, “Kayen kw'ata p'marọhbh chena ọmaana menda nna obhik attong, k'ose kw'mad-akkikken arọhbha?”<verse eid="EXO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 5:15" />Nya o, akker-atọhmnọng mbo p'Israẹl mad-abhom akpẹkẹ Phero, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ttatta, ode yen kw'ad-asi atọhmnọng pọ minna o? <verse eid="EXO 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 5:16" />M'ọdọk atọhmnọng pọ azizaarẹ-bukọ kanangẹ bẹ́, motima ọrọhbha ata. Mad-atera achina ororo agwa mina bẹ́, ‘Màrọhbha ata!’ Bẹ mad-attema mina nkwur, chibhẹ ch'epinẹ ede chabẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 5:17" />Phero ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Ọkpọhra vọ! Ọkpọhra f'masi ẹkpẹkpa f'nd-azeng ábẹ̀ maben-m bẹ́, ‘Tte mina ọbọhk mofona mọd-ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.’ <verse eid="EXO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 5:18" />Màkpa nnam z'abọnga k'itọhm. M'ọdọk bọnga azizaarẹ p'ata orirọbha manang. Okenaka, bọnga mm'arọhbha ọta-bhik kw'mad-akkikken arọbha.”<verse eid="EXO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 5:19" />Akker-itọhm mbo p'Israẹl makwu atin bẹ́, odik kk'bẹ oyina ch'matek bẹ bẹ́, “Bọnga mm'achina ororo arọhbha ọta-bhik kw'mad-akkikken arọbha k'ewu k'ewu.” <verse eid="EXO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 5:20" />K'ose kw'mabin arik Phero nya, mad-akebha Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn ch'mabe nya atik bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 5:21" />Maben bẹ bẹ́, “Tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkpaara aponga ọnang bọnga otor k'osisi kwabọnga! Bọnga nkk'mina asa mopyibh z'ititika s'Phero ọmaana atọhmnọng pẹ, mabira atọka ọkkangkkang ake bẹ z'mbọhk bẹ́, matima afhọ mina.”<verse eid="EXO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibinọkpaabyi ochekẹ bẹ́, m'ọrọhbha anọng p'Israẹl k'ebira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 5:22" />Ofona nya o, Mosẹs ọkpa nnam z'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, od-oben-ẹ bẹ́, “O Ttatta, kayen kw'ake anọng pọ k'odik kw'obeng ma o? Ma, kẹ kw'azeng ábẹ̀ atọhm-m o? <verse eid="EXO 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 5:23" />Ch'mbe-be ntima eche chọ nd-mgbaak odik nnang Phero, kẹ kk'anọng mboma ẹkọhr ọka. Chibhẹ nya, kọ anọng pọ kabir akkaana maphyir-phyir.”<verse eid="EXO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EXO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 6:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kọ m'aze ọttọhk f'm'nsi Phero. Kaam m'ntima ẹfa chaam nsẹ-ẹ otte anọng paam ọbọhk, mafona. Ẹfa ndo chaam m'ẹsẹ-ẹ okwubh bẹ ny'ẹkọma chẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 6:2" />Ibinọkpaabyi obir oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 6:3" />Wa kaam kk'nyina nkebha Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb mach'Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa maphyir. Okenaka, kaam eche chaam ch'ede Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kinyaakẹ nnang bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 6:4" />Wa kaam mbir nchekẹ bẹ́, m'nnang bẹ izek njo s'Kenaan s'iwa marukọ mach'akikennọng. <verse eid="EXO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 6:5" />Kaam kk'ichichinẹ s'anọng p'Israẹl mmaanga k'ebira ch'maning k'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip. Kk'echekẹ chaam mbir njima.<verse eid="EXO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 6:6" />“Ofona nya, gbaak anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Kaam m'nrọhbha bẹ k'ebira ch'anọng p'ijip. Kaam m'nsi bẹ manaanga, maning ọdọk abira ade anang bẹ. Kaam m'ntima ẹfa chiden, ọttara adik-dim p'm'nsi, nnang bọnga ẹkkaana. <verse eid="EXO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 6:7" />Kaam m'ntọka bọnga mach'anọng paam oyenẹ, mbir nde Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga. M'ofona nya, mm'azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, kw'ọrọhbh bọnga k'irem s'anọng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 6:8" />Kaam m'ntima bọnga nchina z'izek njo s'nyaangẹ ọbọhk, nchekẹ bẹ́, m'nnang Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb. M'nnang bọnga izek njo mayena. Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 6:9" />Mosẹs ọd-ọgbaak anọng p'Israẹl ẹkkaabha nda. Okenaka, m'ikẹ itọhng kayong okurọ ch'ifor imọmọ bẹ, ọttara z'atọhmgbọhka p'mad-asi.<verse eid="EXO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 6:10" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 6:11" />“Zọhng tek Phero kw'ode ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip bẹ́, tte otte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mabina ny'ikẹ k'izek.”<verse eid="EXO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 6:12" />Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Anọng p'Israẹl kaam itọhng kacher ayonga, Phero wọ im'otera oyong-m itọhng o? Kọ azong za bẹ́, ọgbaakadik ọd-ọkaar-m ọkaara.”<verse eid="EXO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 6:13" />Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọgbaak odik ọnang Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn kw'ọmaan anọng p'Israẹl ọttara ọvaar Phero kw'Ijip. Ọnang bẹ ẹfa bẹ́, matima anọng p'Israẹl mabina ny'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efonamma ch'Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn</para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 6:14" />Ma wọ ode aso p'mfona sabẹ:</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:14">Wa ajinọngva p'Reubẹn kw'ode ocheden-jinọngnwa kw'Israẹl made, Hanọk, ọmaana Palu, ọmaana Hẹzrọn, ọttara Karmi. Minna kw'uwa efona ch'Reubẹn ede.<verse eid="EXO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 6:15" />Ajinọngva p'Simeọn made, Jemuyẹl, ọmaana Jamin, ọmaana Ọhad, ọmaana Jakin, ọmaana Zoha, ọttara Shaul kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'oKenaan-kwanọng ọmaanẹ. Minna kw'uwa efona ch'Simeọn ede.<verse eid="EXO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 6:16" />Ajinọngva p'Lẹvi obhonọ, atorọ k'ose kw'mammaan, made, Gershon, ọmaana Kohat, ọttara Mẹrari. Wa Lẹvi orukọ k'icho arọbh achadanẹ okwuma ichikkamfa.<verse eid="EXO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 6:17" />Ajinọngva p'Gershon, atorọ k'nnọmma sabẹ, wa made, Libni ọttara Shimei.<verse eid="EXO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 6:18" />Ajinọngva p'Kohat made, Amram, ọmaana Izha, ọmaana Hẹbrọn ọttara Uziyẹl. Kohat wa orukọ k'icho arọbh achadanẹ okwuma ijobh kanttaan.<verse eid="EXO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 6:19" />Ajinọngva p'Mẹrari made, Mali ọttara Mushi.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:19">Minna kw'nnọmma s'Lẹvi ide, atorọ k'ose kw'uwa mammaan.<verse eid="EXO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 6:20" />Wa Amram ọtọk Jokẹbẹd, kw'ode ọgbaanọkka kw'otte kwẹ k'ọbada. Jokẹbẹd ọmaan-ẹ Aarọn ọttara Mosẹs. Amram wa orukọ k'icho arọbh achadanẹ okwuma ichikkamfa.<verse eid="EXO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 6:21" />Wa ajinọngva p'Izha made, Kọra ọmaana Nẹphẹg, ọttara Zikiri.<verse eid="EXO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 6:22" />Wa ajinọngva p'Uziyẹl made, Mishayẹl, ọmaana Ẹlzaphan, ọttara Sitri.<verse eid="EXO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 6:23" />Aarọn ọtọk Elisheba, ominanwa kw'Aminadab obhonọ, k'ọbada, kw'obir ode ọgbaanọkka kw'Nashọn. Wa ọmaan-ẹ Nadab, ọmaana Abihu, ọmaana Eleaza, ọttara nkwurọr.<verse eid="EXO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 6:24" />Ajinọngva p'Kọra made, Asir, ọmaana Ẹlkana ọttara Abiyasaph. Ma wọ iwa ode nnọmma s'Kọra.<verse eid="EXO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 6:25" />Eleaza kw'Aarọn obhonọ, ọtọka ominanwa wanẹ kw'Putiyẹl obhonọ k'ọbada, ọmaan-ẹ Phinẹhas.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EXO 6:25" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EXO 6:25">Minna kw'asonọng p'isọhmmọr s'Lẹvi iwa ide k'ẹnọmma k'ẹnọmma.<verse eid="EXO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 6:26" />Aarọn nwoma ọmaana Mosẹs bọ p'uwa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, “Màtima anọng p'Israẹl k'ọsaabh fabẹ, mabina z'izek s'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 6:27" />Bẹ anọng mbo afa, p'ade Aarọn ọmaana Mosẹs bọ iwa agbaak odik anang Phero kw'ode ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip, kw'ọmaan ebina ch'anọng p'Israẹl k'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aarọn ọgbaak odik k'eso ch'Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 6:28" />K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọgbaak odik ọnang Mosẹs z'Ijip, <verse eid="EXO 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 6:29" />oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Tek Phero kw'ode ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip odik kpenamkpen kw'mgbaak-ọ.”<verse eid="EXO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 6:30" />Okenaka, Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ch'ọgbaakadik ọkaar-m minna, ina Phero oyong-m itọhng o?”<verse eid="EXO 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EXO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 7:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Zonga bẹ́, kaam kk'ọ nsa bẹ́, ade mach'Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika s'Phero. Aarọn kw'ode agbaanakka, kẹ wọ im'ọd-ọgbaak ettem chọ. <verse eid="EXO 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 7:2" />Kọ m'agbaak odik kpenamkpen kw'mben-ọ bẹ́, agbaak. Aarọn wọ im'otek Phero bẹ́, otte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mabina ny'ẹkọma chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 7:3" />Okenaka, kaam m'nsi Phero ọgaangẹ ettem. Zaabẹ́ nsi ikkonọ-kkonọdik kk'ọsaabha ny'Ijip, ọmaana idik s'ipe anọng ifor, <verse eid="EXO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 7:4" />Phero bọnga itọhng moyonga. Minna kw'kaam m'ntima ẹfa ch'ọbọhk kwaam nsi Ijip itama, mbir nsi bẹ adik-dim, pira ntima nkaana s'anọng paam p'ade Israẹl, nyin k'iyaan. <verse eid="EXO 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 7:5" />Nya kw'anọng p'Ijip m'azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ch'm'ntima ẹfa chaam nrọhbha anọng p'Israẹl ny'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 7:6" />Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn masi mbengana k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtọhnọ bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 7:7" />Wa Mosẹs ode icho arọbh anna, Aarọn ode icho arọbh anna okwuma icho ittaan, k'ogbe kw'magbaakẹ odik anang Phero.<verse eid="EXO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ochikwura kw'Aarọn ọbhakẹ ozeng ijọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 7:8" />Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 7:9" />“K'ogbe kw'Phero obenẹ bọnga bẹ́, ‘Màsi okkonọ-kkonọttọhk kọhk-m,’ nya kw'im'aben Aarọn bẹ́, ‘Tọka ochikwura kwọ bharẹ ny'izek, ny'ititika s'Phero,’ ochikwura nwo m'ọbhakẹ ozeng ijọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 7:10" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn machin z'Phero, mad-asi mbengana k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ. Aarọn ọbharẹ ochikwura kwẹ ny'izek ny'ititika s'Phero ọmaana adukwa pẹ. Ochikwura nwo ọbhakẹ ozeng ijọhk. <verse eid="EXO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 7:11" />Nya o, Phero oyerẹ adikzonganọng, ọmaana abọhnganọng ọttara anọng p'Ijip p'ad-asi mbọn, bẹ mabir atima nchiranga asi minna ọdọk. <verse eid="EXO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 7:12" />K'ose kw'ọnọng-ọnọng ọbharẹ ochikwura kwẹ ny'izek, minna kw'achikwura mbo mabhakẹ azeng ọjọhk. Ochikwura kw'Aarọn omyi achikwura pabẹ maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 7:13" />Chibhẹ nya, ettem ch'Phero kẹ <char style="it">kpuk-kpuk</char> kesi. Bẹ itọhng kobir oyonga, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena.<verse eid="EXO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwurọ s'izẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 7:14" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Phero ettem kocher ọbhakẹ. Kẹ otim obhum-obhum bẹ́, otte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mafona. <verse eid="EXO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 7:15" />Zọhng kebha Phero k'ogbe kw'im'ochina z'ọraanga ny'ekpebha. Tima ochikwura nwo kw'wendo ọbhakẹ ozeng ijọhk, be ny'araangakonga p'Nile atik-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 7:16" />Ben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu, ọtọhm-m bẹ́, nkwu mben-ọ bẹ́, atte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobh-m z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ. Okenaka, itọhng kacher ayonga. <verse eid="EXO 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 7:17" />Ma wọ ode odik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọgbaakẹ: M'eden nda ch'mm'atima azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi: M'ntima ochikwura nwoma kw'ntim m'ọbọhk mbin ny'ọraanga kw'Nile, ọraanga nwo m'ọbhakẹ ozeng izẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 7:18" />Nten s'ining ny'Nile m'ipe, ọraanga nwo m'obir osom eruk maa, anọng p'Ijip m'ọdọk asi mbo màkpo agwo.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 7:19" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tek Aarọn bẹ́, ọtọka ochikwura kw'otim ny'ọbọhk, otena z'nkeka s'Ijip, ọmaana z'araangava, ọmaana z'nsipe, ọttara z'asi p'maye-oye, mfha mabhakẹ azeng izẹ. Izẹ m'ininga k'ibyi kpenamkpen ny'Ijip, ozeng k'akkora p'matim nchi, ọttara ata masi.”<verse eid="EXO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 7:20" />Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn masi k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ. Aarọn ọyaangẹ ochikwura kwẹ ny'ititika s'Phero, ọmaana adukwa pẹ, pira nobinẹ wẹ ny'asi p'Nile. Asi mbo maphyir mabhakẹ azeng izẹ. <verse eid="EXO 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 7:21" />Nten s'ining z'Nile ipe, ọraanga osom <char style="it">ma tamatama, </char>anọng p'Ijip mọdọk asi pẹ kakpo agwo. Ibyi kpenamkpen ny'Ijip ikwu ide izizẹ.<verse eid="EXO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 7:22" />Okenaka, anọng p'Ijip p'ad-asi mbọn, matima nchiranga sabẹ abir asi ekpose mbyo ọdọk. Nya o, ettem ch'Phero, ẹgaangẹ mach'ẹgaangẹ nya, Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn itọhng kocher oyonga, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena. <verse eid="EXO 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 7:23" />Phero otera ọkpa nnam z'ikẹ k'odimpa, ettem kẹ odik-odik kesi. <verse eid="EXO 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 7:24" />Anọng p'Ijip maphyir matum ape z'akonga p'Nile, mfha mayena asi p'ẹgwa, okurọ ch'bẹ nna ọdọk asi p'ọraanga akpo agwo.<verse eid="EXO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'abhurubọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 7:25" />Iwu ichenọmfa ikwu ikpan, s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhakẹ ọraanga kw'Nile ozeng izẹ.<verse eid="EXO 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EXO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 8:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “China z'Phero, gbaak-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mbenẹ bẹ́, atte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona makwu akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 8:2" />Ó̱de ina acher, kaam m'ntọhm abhurubọhk k'ọsaabh ny'ẹkọma chọ kibungọ. <verse eid="EXO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 8:3" />Abhurubọhk mbo m'afu ny'ọraanga kw'Nile <char style="it">bẹ́ taap</char>. Mm'akwu adim z'odimpa kwọ, ọmaana z'idongọ sọ, ọttara z'eyima chọ. Mm'abir adim z'isọhm s'atọhmnọng pọ, ọmaana s'anọng pọ, ọmaana z'ibyi s'mad-asi brẹd ọttara z'ophe f'mad-atima asi brẹd. <verse eid="EXO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 8:4" />Abhurubọhk mbo mm'avura kọ ọttara adukwa pọ ny'ifor.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 8:5" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obir oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tek Aarọn bẹ́, onemẹ ọbọhk nwo kw'otim ochikwura otena z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'araanga, ọmaana nkeka, ọmaana ape, mfha abhurubọhk ayin afu izek s'Ijip <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing</char>.”<verse eid="EXO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 8:6" />Ofona nya, Aarọn onemẹ ọbọhk kwẹ otena z'asi p'Ijip maphyir, abhurubọhk mayin z'asi makwu afu izek <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing</char>. <verse eid="EXO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 8:7" />Anọng p'Ijip p'ad-asi mbọn, masi mach'Aarọn osi, abhurubọhk abir ayin maa, mabubha izek maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 8:8" />Phero o, oyerẹ Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màze njọm nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, ọrọhbha abhurubọhk mba m'kaam k'ifor, ọmaana z'anọng paam k'ifor, ọfha ntte anọng pẹ ọbọhk mafona, mad-afọhnọ nja anang kẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 8:9" />Mosẹs ọpọhna Phero bẹ́, “K'ẹvaar chọ, kọ m'ake ogbe anang-m kw'im'nze njọm nnang kọ ọmaana adukwa pọ, ọttara anọng pọ maphyir, ọfha abhurubọhk mbo atte bọnga ọbọhk, marik mbo p'ọraanga kw'Nile bẹ-bẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 8:10" />Phero oben bẹ́, “Ze njọm njo ophyinẹ.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 8:10">Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “M'ode mach'abenẹ, ọfha atima azonga bẹ́, ọnọng za kode kw'ode mach'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina. <verse eid="EXO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 8:11" />Abhurubọhk mbo m'atte kọ ọbọhk, ọmaana isọhm sọ, ọmaana adukwa pọ, ọttara anọng pọ. Mbo p'aning z'ọraanga kw'Nile bẹ-bẹ bọ mm'aninga.”<verse eid="EXO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 8:12" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn mabin Phero ny'ititika, Mosẹs oze njọm ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, ọrọhbha abhurubọhk mbo p'ikk'ọtọhma ọnang Phero. <verse eid="EXO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 8:13" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi mach'Mosẹs ophyem-ẹ. Abhurubọhk p'maning z'isọhm, ọmaana z'nttemttem, ọttara z'iwonọ, mape maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 8:14" />Anọng p'Ijip matobha abhurubọhk mbo k'akkin-k'akkin. Ophyok kw'abhurubọhk mbo ẹtọka ibyi maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 8:15" />Phero okwu oze bẹ́, abhurubọhk mbo kk'apa-kpo, kẹ odo ettem ọgaangẹ. Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn itọhng koyong, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena.<verse eid="EXO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'abinbinọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 8:16" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tek Aarọn bẹ́, onemẹ ochikwura kwẹ obin ny'izek, ọfha ebonọ ch'ẹkọma ch'Ijip maphyir, ẹbhakẹ ezeng abinbinọ.” <verse eid="EXO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 8:17" />Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn masi minna. Aarọn obin ochikwura kwẹ ny'izek, pira ebonọ ch'ẹkọma ch'Ijip maphyir, ẹbhakẹ ezeng abinbinọ. Abinbinọ mbo machi oyokinọng kpenamkpen, ọttara eten kpenamkpen ny'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 8:18" />Anọng p'Ijip p'ad-asi mbọn akonga k'ose kw'matima mfa sabẹ abir asi abinbinọ ayin, nkakpo. Abinbinọ achina ororo abubha ayokinọng ọmaana nten.<verse eid="EXO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 8:19" />Anọng p'Ijip p'ad-asi mbọn aben Phero bẹ́, “Odik nwa ọjaakadik azang o. Ọbọhk kw'Ibinọkpaabyi oyik ma e.” Okenaka, Phero ochina ororo ọgaangẹ ettem, itọhng ny'idik njo koyong, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena.<verse eid="EXO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'azizang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 8:20" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Bina k'ekpikpebha, ad-agwunga Phero ọmma ch'im'oyin asi z'ọraanga, aben-ẹ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Tte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 8:21" />Ó̱de ina anọng paam ọbọhk atte mafona, kaam m'ntọhm azizang k'ọsaabh makwu abubha adukwa pọ, ọmaana anọng pọ, ọttara isọhm sọ. Azizang atọka isọhm s'anọng p'Ijip maphyir, ozeng k'izek s'maning. <verse eid="EXO 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 8:22" />Okenaka, ny'ewu ndo, kaam m'nsi nkọmẹ z'ẹkọma ch'Goshẹn ch'anọng paam arukọ. Azizang za mìntọhm, mfha matima azonga bẹ́, kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi nning m'izek nja. <verse eid="EXO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 8:23" />Kaam m'nsi anọng paam made nkọmẹ z'anọng pọ. Ophyinẹ kw'ẹkọhka nda im'eyin.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 8:24" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi mach'obenẹ. Ọtọhm azizang k'ọsaabh z'odimpa kw'Phero, ọmaana z'isọhm s'adukwa pẹ. Wa azizang akibhẹ ẹkọma ch'Ijip kibung-kibungọ.<verse eid="EXO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 8:25" />Ofona nya o, Phero oyerẹ Mosẹs, ọmaana Aarọn, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màzọhng, mad-afọhnọ nja anang Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga m'izek nja.”<verse eid="EXO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 8:26" />Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “Minna mòjibh. Nja s'mina mm'ọfọhnọ ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina, anọng p'Ijip nttem mìlebh. Ó̱de m'ọfọhnọ nja s'ina bẹ idaakẹ, bẹ mm'atọka ata atọhbh mina. <verse eid="EXO 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 8:27" />Mm'ọtọma ozenga kw'iwu ittaan ochina z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'anọng nna arukọ, ọfha m'oninga za ọfọhnọ nja ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina, k'ose kw'ikk'mina ọtọhma.”<verse eid="EXO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 8:28" />Phero oben bẹ́, “Kaam m'ntte bọnga ọbọhk mad-afọhnọ nja anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ. Okenaka, m'ibyi s'ibhir-obhir kàta. Màze-m njọm.”<verse eid="EXO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 8:29" />Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de mfon ma, kaam m'nze njọm nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ophyinẹ, azizang m'atte kọ Phero, ọmaana adukwa pọ, ọttara anọng pọ, ọbọhk. Okenaka, tte Phero oning obir otuna bẹ́, otte anọng mba ọbọhk mafona, mad-afọhnọ nja anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 8:30" />Mosẹs obina orik Phero, od-oze njọm ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 8:31" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi mach'Mosẹs ophyem-ẹ. Azizang mbo matte Phero, ọmaana adukwa pẹ, ọttara anọng pẹ, ọbọhk. Ezizang madan-danẹ kerikẹ. <verse eid="EXO 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 8:32" />Okenaka, Phero obir ochina ororo ọgaangẹ ettem, anọng mbo ọbọhk kocher otte mafona.<verse eid="EXO 8:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EXO 9" />
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'obo kw'etirakpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 9:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Zọhng kebha Phero, aben-ẹ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Tte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 9:2" />Ó̱de achin ororo abhum bẹ́, bẹ ọbọhk matte mafona, <verse eid="EXO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 9:3" />kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'nkọhka nkwurọ k'etirakpo pyọ, ọmaana k'nnyanya sọ, ọmaana k'abhaam pọ, ọmaana k'akamẹl, ọmaana k'adamogbodo, ọmaana k'arọkimaan, ọttara k'avu pọ. <verse eid="EXO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 9:4" />Okenaka, ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi im'osi etirakpo py'Israẹl m'ode nkọmẹ k'ose kw'im'osi etirakpo py'Ijip, ọfha otirattọhk minna vanẹ f'Israẹl, oning ope.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 9:5" />Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oke ogbe, oben bẹ́, “Ophyinẹ wọ kw'kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'nsi odik nwa m'izek nja.” <verse eid="EXO 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 9:6" />Ewu esobh nya, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi minna k'odik ọkkọkka. Etirakpo py'Ijip epe maphyir, okenaka, otirattọhk mavanẹ f'Israẹl kope. <verse eid="EXO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 9:7" />Phero ọtọhm ajinọng banẹ bẹ́, mad-abaana. Mapyirẹ za, maze bẹ́, otirattọhk mavanẹ f'Israẹl f'ikk'ọpa, kode. Chibhẹ nya, Phero ochina ororo ọgaangẹ ettem, anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk kotte mafona.<verse eid="EXO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkwurọ s'aphyi</para>
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 9:8" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn bẹ́, “Màtọka ititọhngkọma z'itakwuka. Tte Mosẹs ọnyaanẹ sẹ z'iwokọ, ny'ititika s'Phero. <verse eid="EXO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 9:9" />Ititọhng njo m'ibhakẹ izeng ebonọ ny'ẹkọma ch'Ijip maphyir. M'ofona nya, aphyi p'atim ibhan m'asi ayokinọng ọmaana nten ny'ẹkọma ndo maphyir.”<verse eid="EXO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 9:10" />Nya o, makpokọ ititọhngkọma z'nkwuka, matima ad-akebha Phero. Mosẹs o, ọnyaanẹ ititọhngkọma njo z'iwokọ. Minna kw'aphyi p'matim ibhan ayinẹ ayokinọng ọttara nten k'ifor. <verse eid="EXO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 9:11" />Wa anọng p'ad-asi mbọn ọdọk Mosẹs k'ititika kakpo abe, okurọ ch'aphyi asi bẹ ọmaana anọng p'Ijip k'ifor maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 9:12" />Okenaka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ettem ch'Phero ẹgaangẹ, Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn itọhng koyong, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena.<verse eid="EXO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'ẹrọng-ch'atava</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 9:13" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Bina zọhng gwunga Phero ọmma k'ekpikpebha, aben-ẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu obenẹ bẹ́, Tte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 9:14" />Ó̱de ina acher m'ogbe nwa, kaam m'nkọhka kọ, ọmaana adukwa pọ, ọttara anọng pọ, nkwurọ siden, mfha mazonga bẹ́, ọnọng kw'ode mach'kaam m'iyagbin maphyir, kode. <verse eid="EXO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 9:15" />M'ogbe nwa, wura k'ọbọhk kwaam nnema, nkọhka bọnga nkwurọ s'iwura ifhọ kọ ọmaana anọng pọ maphyir m'iyagbin. <verse eid="EXO 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 9:16" />Okenaka, ntte bọnga ọbọhk bẹ́, maruk akpen, mfha nkọhka ẹfa chaam, anọng abir akpobha eche chaam m'iyagbin maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 9:17" />Chibhẹ nya, kọ atim age-oge bẹ́, anọng paam ọbọhk matte mafona. <verse eid="EXO 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 9:18" />Ofona nya, ophyinẹ ogbese nwa, kaam m'ntebh arọngta, ekira ch'anọng p'Ijip nna atima ad-aza, ch'iwa mabe-be ammaana maa, pyirẹ ma. <verse eid="EXO 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 9:19" />Tọhm ẹkkaabha ẹbhar-ẹbhar bẹ́, matima etirakpo pyọ, ọttara ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ode fọ z'owonọ, madim z'ikkira, okurọ bẹ́, óde árọngta mba matebh ọnọng, ọmaana otirattọhk f'ina k'ikkira oning, m'epe-ope.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 9:20" />Adukwa mbo p'Phero p'ayen ojora kw'ọgbaakadik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, masẹr-ọsẹr, mad-atọka abira pabẹ, ọmaana etirakpo pyabẹ atima adim z'ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 9:21" />Ayok mbo p'nna ọgbaakadik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'ọttọhk atọk, matte abira pabẹ, ọmaana etirakpo pyabẹ ọbọhk z'iwonọ.<verse eid="EXO 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 9:22" />Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ Mosẹs bẹ́, “Nemẹ ọbọhk kwọ tena z'ọrọngkpakpa, ọfha arọngta mbo matebh ayokinọng, ọmaana etirakpo, ọttara ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'matubh-otubh k'iwonọ s'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 9:23" />K'ose kw'Mosẹs onemẹ ochikwura kwẹ otena z'ọrọngkpakpa, minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtọhmọ ẹbhaangkpon, ọmaana arọngta. Ẹbhaangkpon ẹmaanẹ z'izek. Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otebhẹ arọngta ny'izek s'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 9:24" />Arọngta mbo matebh, mmangkpon imanẹ ẹwọr mach'imaanẹ nya. Tọma z'ogbe kw'Ijip obobe ode obhon, ẹrọng ch'etim epyibhẹ minna, kede. <verse eid="EXO 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 9:25" />Arọngta mbo mafhọ ayokinọng, ọttara etirakpo ny'Ijip, ọmaana nchi, ọttara eborakpo py'ening z'iwonọ s'anọng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 9:26" />Ibyi bungọ-bungọ s'iwa arọngta nna atebhẹ, ode Goshẹn, kw'ode ibyi s'anọng p'Israẹl marukọ.<verse eid="EXO 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 9:27" />Nya o, Phero oyerẹ Mosẹs, ọmaana Aarọn oben bẹ bẹ́, “Kaam kk'epyibha nsa m'ogbe nwa. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ otor-otor. Kaam ọmaana anọng paam, nkk'opina. <verse eid="EXO 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 9:28" />Màze njọm nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi o, kirẹ mmaangkpon ọmaana arọngta mba, kk'asaabha ọkpan o! Kaam m'ntte bọnga ọbọhk otte, mafona. M'ọdọk ma kàninga maphyir-phyir.”<verse eid="EXO 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 9:29" />Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de kaam kk'mbina nrik obhon nwa, kaam m'mmaama mbọhk saam, nze njọm nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Mmaangkpon ọmaana arọngta m'ettik-ottika, mfha matima azonga bẹ́, iyagbin nja, ining k'mbọhk s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 9:30" />Kaam nzong za bẹ́, kọ ọmaana adukwa pọ, m'ojora f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi atima ayena e.”<verse eid="EXO 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 9:31" />(Wa owu, ọmaana abarli makibhẹ maphyir, okurọ ch'abarli nkk'akora, owu obir osi agbok. <verse eid="EXO 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 9:32" />Okenaka, wa awit kakibhẹ, okurọ ch'nna atima akora ny'ogbe nwo.)<verse eid="EXO 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 9:33" />Minna kw'Mosẹs obin orik Phero nya, otte obhon ọbọhk, ọd-ọmmaama mbọhk sẹ, oze njọm ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Mmaangkpon, ọmaana arọngta, ettika, ẹrọng ebir ettika otitebh ny'izek. <verse eid="EXO 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 9:34" />K'ogbe kw'Phero oze bẹ́, ẹrọng, ọmaana arọngta, ọttara mmaangkpon kk'ettika, minna kw'kẹ, ọmaana adukwa pẹ mabir apinẹ, machina ororo agaangẹ nttem. <verse eid="EXO 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 9:35" />Nya o, Phero ọgaangẹ ettem bẹ́, anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk motte mafona, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ozenga kk'Mosẹs, oben.<verse eid="EXO 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EXO 10" />
  <para style="s1">Nkwurọ s'agurubhebhe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 10:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Zọhng kebha Phero. Kaam kk'ettem chẹ ọttara ch'adukwa pẹ nsa ẹgaangẹ mawuriji. Minna kw'im'ntima nsi ikkonọ-kkonọdik nja saam, ny'abẹ k'ikpakaana. <verse eid="EXO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 10:2" />Ikkonọ-kkonọdik nja s'im'nsi ny'abẹ k'ikpakaana, jẹ s'ikwuna im'ad-agbaak iva pọ, ọmaana iva p'iva pọ, ose kw'uwa nyak ọbọhk, nnang anọng p'Ijip irem, ọmaana nkọhka saabhada s'bọnga mm'atima azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 10:3" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn mad-akebh Phero, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'aHiburu, obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Ma, ogbe m'obhir otuma yen, pira asaka ifor sọ anang-m? Tte anọng paam ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 10:4" />Ó̱de ina bẹ ọbọhk atte mafona, ophyinẹ kaam m'ntọhm agurubhebhe ny'ẹkọma chọ. <verse eid="EXO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 10:5" />Agurubhebhe mbo m'afu izek <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing</char>, ọnọng ọdọk izek mòze. Mm'achi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'orikẹ ny'ogbe kw'arọngta etebhẹ, ozeng k'echi kpenamkpen ch'ening z'abọnga k'iwonọ. <verse eid="EXO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 10:6" />Mm'afu ny'isọhm sọ, ọmaana z'isọhm s'adukwa pọ, ọttara z'isọhm s'anọng p'Ijip maphyir. M'ode ọttọhk f'ab'atte, ọttara ab'atte p'atte pọ, nna atima ad-aza k'akpen, ch'iwa mabe-be ammaana m'izek nja.’ ” Nya o, Mosẹs obina orik Phero.<verse eid="EXO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 10:7" />Adukwa p'Phero maben Phero bẹ́, “Ojinọng nwa m'oke mina eso otuma yen o? Tte anọng mbo ọbọhk mafona, mfha mad-akpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabẹ. Ma, kọ atim azonga bẹ́, anọng p'Ijip nnaning k'irem o?”<verse eid="EXO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 10:8" />Nya o, Phero oyerẹ Mosẹs ọttara Aarọn makpa nnam, oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màzọhng kpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga. Matek-m, bọng-anọng bọ mm'afon-ofona?”<verse eid="EXO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 10:9" />Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Mina maphyir bọ mm'ofona, acham-ọchamẹ, abar-ọbar, iva pamina k'ejinọng, ọmaana k'ẹpanọng, ọttara etirakpo pyamina, okurọ bẹ́, mm'od-osi odidaama ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 10:10" />Phero oben bẹ bẹ́, “Kk'nza bẹ́, bọnga makamẹ itama. Ma, bọnga machibhẹ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oning ọmaana bọnga k'odik ọkkọkka? Eden kede ch'im'ntte bọnga ọbọhk matima panọng pabọnga, ọttara iva pabọnga, mafona! <verse eid="EXO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 10:11" />Mma e! Tìma ajinọng bẹ-bẹ zọhng kpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ọttọhk f'mad-atọma za aphyem-m vọ nya.” Ofona nya, makwubh Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn z'Phero k'ititika.<verse eid="EXO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 10:12" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Nemẹ ọbọhk kwọ tena z'Ijip, ọfha agurubhebhe ayin akibhẹ eborakpo kpenamkpen py'arọngta ikk'ekibha erik.”<verse eid="EXO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 10:13" />Minna kw'Mosẹs onemẹ ochikwura otena z'Ijip, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ofum obina z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-eyin, ogwuma ny'obhon, ny'ewu ndo kibungọ, ọmaana ny'erungọ. Ewu esobh nya o, ofum nwo kk'agurubhebhe otima ofu ibyi <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing</char>. <verse eid="EXO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 10:14" />Agurubhebhe mbo manyaamẹ k'ibyi kpenamkpen ny'Ijip, mabak obhon maphyir k'ọsaabh. Ch'obobe ode, nkwurọse njo s'agurubhebhe itima id-iyina. Zaabẹ́ z'ogbe ororo wọ, kwuna ọdọk minna mòde. <verse eid="EXO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 10:15" />Agurubhebhe mbo mafu ny'izek <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing</char> maa, izek ipyi ewu <char style="it">bẹ́ kkang</char>. Machi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'arọngta nkk'akibha arik, ọmaana ekpo py'emenẹ z'iwonọ, ọttara achiduk. Wa ọttọhk-kikebhẹ kpenamkpen ọdọk ny'Ijip maphyir, korikẹ, ode echi, obir ode ozizaarẹ kw'osen-osenẹ.<verse eid="EXO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 10:16" />Phero ọsẹr-ọsẹr oyerẹ Mosẹs, ọmaana Aarọn, oben bẹ́, “Kaam kk'epyibha nsa mmaana Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, ọttara bọnga oyenẹ. <verse eid="EXO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 10:17" />Ototo, màbir abina nang-m, akwukọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga bẹ́, ọrọhbha nkwurọ nja m'kaam k'ifor, ọbharẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 10:18" />Mosẹs obina orik Phero, od-oze njọm ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 10:19" />Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọbhakẹ ofum nwo, nobina ẹfa-ẹfa z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ, okwu ogwuma agurubhebhe mbo maphyir ọbharẹ z'Ẹraanga-kora. Ofona nya o, wa ogurubhebhe mawanẹ-wanẹ ọdọk ny'Ijip, korikẹ. <verse eid="EXO 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 10:20" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi Phero ochina ororo ọgaangẹ ettem, anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk kotte mafona.<verse eid="EXO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nkwurọ s'orungibanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 10:21" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Yaangẹ ọbọhk kwọ tena z'ọrọngkpakpa, ọfha orungibanga obubha Ijip maphyir, k'ose kw'im'otwu ọnọng z'ifor.” <verse eid="EXO 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 10:22" />Ofona nya o, Mosẹs ọyaangẹ ọbọhk kwẹ otena z'ọrọngkpakpa, orungibanga kw'opyi ewu <char style="it">bẹ́ kkang</char>, obubha ny'Ijip maphyir k'iwu minna ittaan. <verse eid="EXO 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 10:23" />Ọnọng kw'okpo oyok oze, obir obina orik ibyi sẹ, kode. Chibhẹ ch'ode minna, wa anọng p'Israẹl maphyir, mayen ọyaanttaana k'ibyi kpenamkpen s'bẹ marukọ.<verse eid="EXO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 10:24" />Nya o, Phero oyerẹ Mosẹs oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Màtima panọng, ọttara iva pabọnga zọhng kpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga. Okenaka, màtte etirakpo pyabọnga ọbọhk eninga ka.”<verse eid="EXO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 10:25" />Okenaka, Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Màtte mina ọbọhk mọd-ọfọhnọ nja ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwamina, mobir ọfọhnọ nja s'ẹkwọmọ ọnang-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 10:26" />Mina mm'otima etirakpo pyamina maphyir, mofona, mavanẹ-vanẹ mòrik. Mm'otima janẹ okpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ó̱de nkk'opyira za, nya kw'mm'ozonga otenkira kw'mm'otima okpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 10:27" />Okenaka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi Phero ochina ororo ọgaangẹ ettem, kocher bẹ́, otte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mafona. <verse eid="EXO 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 10:28" />Phero o, oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Bina m'kaam k'ititika! Kwuna nning-ọ ọdọk nze m'ikaam k'ititika o! Ewu ch'abir aze ititika saam, m'ape-ope e.”<verse eid="EXO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 10:29" />Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ode k'ose kw'abenẹ nya. Kwuna ọdọk kaam ma, màze.”<verse eid="EXO 10:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EXO 11" />
  <para style="s1">Nkwurọ s'obo kw'acheden-jinọngva p'Ijip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 11:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam m'mbir nkọhka Phero, ọmaana anọng p'Ijip nkwurọ janẹ ọdọk. Íkk'nsa minna maphyir, kẹ m'otte bọnga ọbọhk mafona, obir okwubh bọnga kibungọ-kibungọ. <verse eid="EXO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 11:2" />Tek anọng p'Israẹl k'ejinọng ọttara k'ẹpanọng bẹ́, maphyem anọng p'Ijip ekpo py'matim gol, ọmaana silva, asi.” <verse eid="EXO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 11:3" />(Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi anọng p'Israẹl madaak anọng p'Ijip idik maa, atọhmnọng p'Phero, ọmaana anọng p'Ijip maphyir, makpobha Mosẹs mawuriji.)<verse eid="EXO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 11:4" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben Phero bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Za k'orungittem, m'nzenga nkọbha Ijip maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 11:5" />Ocheden-jinọngnwa kpenamkpen ny'Ijip, m'ope, tọma z'ocheden-jinọngnwa kw'Phero kw'oning z'ẹvaarkkọhbhọ, pyirẹ z'ocheden-jinọngnwa kw'obira-kwanọng kw'od-okok bẹ ekpo, ọmaana achedenva p'adamogbodo maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 11:6" />Mm'abhom ẹmọng ẹkpa-ẹkpa ny'Ijip, ekira ch'nna atima ad-abhoma, ọttara ch'ikwuna nna màbir abhom. <verse eid="EXO 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 11:7" />Ṉ́nòde anọng p'Israẹl, zaabẹ́ ode ẹffa, oyokinọng mẹ̀gbọ, eten kpenamkpen mèbir ẹgbọ.’ Nya kw'mm'atima azonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'ẹbhaangẹ ọka ny'njeka kw'anọng p'Ijip, ọmaana p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 11:8" />Asonọng mba pọ maphyir, mm'akwu attima ndudungọ anang-m, maben-m bẹ́, ‘Kọ ọmaana anọng maphyir p'ator-ọ, màzọhng!’ Ńkk'asa minna, kaam m'mfon-ofona.” Nya o, ettem epyibh Mosẹs, ofona orik Phero nya.<verse eid="EXO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 11:9" />Ode ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena bẹ́, “Phero bọnga itọhng mòyonga, ọfha nsi ikkonọ-kkonọdik saam inyaamẹ ny'Ijip maphyir.” <verse eid="EXO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 11:10" />Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn masi ikkonọ-kkonọdik akọhka Phero, okenaka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ettem ch'Phero ẹgaangẹ echina ororo, kocher bẹ́, anọng p'Israẹl mabina arik ẹkọma chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EXO 12" />
  <para style="s1">Odidaama kw'Pasova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 12:1" />K'ogbe kw'Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn matim aning z'Ijip, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 12:2" />“Ophe nwa wọ im'ode ocheden-phe kw'icho ọnang bọnga. <verse eid="EXO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 12:3" />Tek anọng p'Israẹl maphyir bẹ́, k'ewu ch'ettong ijobh s'ophe nwoma, ojinọng kpenamkpen m'otima ọrọkimaannwa k'eso ch'ẹsọhmmọr chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 12:4" />Ó̱de ẹsọhmmọr ẹchamẹ kidaam k'ose kw'ina ọrọkimaannwa kibungọ mèkpo echi, tte ebhuna mbọhk ọmaana ẹsọhmmọr ch'ening ẹnyọm-ẹ, matọn achi. M'ode k'ogbe kw'nkk'obhik f'anọng p'aninga nya atọka, mfha mazonga f'ọnọng-ọnọng im'ochi. <verse eid="EXO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 12:5" />Eten ndo ch'mm'ateka m'ede odimkwẹ kw'otim ode icho mawanẹ, ekebh kebir eyena. Okpo-okpo ode ọrọkimaannwa, wanẹma, ovunwa. <verse eid="EXO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 12:6" />Màkkerẹ arọkimaanva mbo maa, opyirẹ iwu osowanẹ kw'ichi, s'ophe nwo. Ny'ẹsọhka ndo wọ kw'ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'obin ẹkọma ch'Israẹl im'ọfhọ ọrọkimaanwa kwẹ. <verse eid="EXO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 12:7" />Màyekẹ izẹ s'arọkimaanva mbo màfoka z'ammakwukchi, ọmaana z'ammakwuksọ p'isọhm s'mm'aninga achi nten njo. <verse eid="EXO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 12:8" />Ny'erungọ ndo, ọnọng kpenamkpen m'ochi eten ch'm'abhaabh-ọbhaabh, ọmaana akwongitọhng p'ajobh-ojobhọ, ọttara brẹd kw'ina yist ake. <verse eid="EXO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 12:9" />M'eten ndo ekikebhẹ kachi, nkàbir awọhn. Màbhaabh-ẹ ttara eso, ttara mmo, ọttara abhọrọ maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 12:10" />M'ẹyaara kpenamkpen karik maa, ewu esobha. Ó̱de ẹ́yaara kpenamkpen erikẹ, màkwọmọ chẹ maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 12:11" />Eden ch'mm'azenga achi ede bẹ́, màtima odikpa abọka nwurọ sabọnga, màke ntọkọ s'adikpa z'mmo, màtima achikwura z'mbọhk. Màchi ọchattọhk mvo ẹbhar-ẹbhar, okurọ bẹ́, Pasova kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ.<verse eid="EXO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 12:12" />“Ny'erungọ ndo, kaam m'nzenga ny'ẹkọma ch'Ijip, mfhọ acheden-jinọngva maphyir, ọmaana adimpẹ p'nten maphyir s'ichi eden imaana. Kaam m'mbir mpyibh aka p'anọng p'Ijip maphyir aponga. Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 12:13" />Izẹ s'mm'afoka ny'ammakwuk pabọnga, jẹ jọ im'ikọhk-m isọhm s'bọnga maning. Ny'ogbe kw'im'nze izẹ njo, kaam m'nkwur bọnga njeka. Nkwurọ njo s'obo, bọnga mìkpẹkẹ k'ogbe kw'im'nsi anọng p'Ijip itama.<verse eid="EXO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 12:14" />“Bọnga mm'ad-ajima ewu nda ttattampe, m'abir atima dẹ mach'edidaamawu ch'mm'atima anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikpukpobha k'icho kpenamkpen. <verse eid="EXO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 12:15" />K'iwu ichenọmfa, bọnga mm'achi brẹd kw'nna yist ake. Ny'echedenwu, bọnga mm'arọhbha yist z'isọhm sabọnga maphyir. Tọma ny'echedenwu ndo maa, pyirẹ iwu ichenọmfa, ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ochi brẹd kw'make yist, mm'akpaar-ẹ z'ẹkaan ch'anọng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 12:16" />K'echedenwu, ọttara ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, mm'attonga k'ibyi majanẹ, m'asi odidaama kw'mm'atima akpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. M'ọtọhm kpenamkpen ny'iwu njo kàsi, kw'ọkpanẹ ọchattọhk f'mm'awọhn anang anọng maphyir machi.<verse eid="EXO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 12:17" />“Màsi Odidaama nwa kw'brẹd kw'nna yist ake, okurọ bẹ́, m'ewu nda dọ ch'ntim bọnga k'ọsaabh fabọnga, ọmaana k'nkaan sabọnga, mbina z'Ijip. Màsi odidaama kw'ewu ndoma mach'odidaama kw'im'oninga k'epemaanitor. <verse eid="EXO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 12:18" />Ny'ochedenphe kw'icho, tọma ny'ẹsọhka ch'iwu osowanẹ kw'ichi maa, pyirẹ k'ẹsọhka ch'iwu ẹrọbh okwuma madanẹ, màchi brẹd kw'nna yist ake. <verse eid="EXO 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 12:19" />K'iwu ichenọmfa, tte yist kpenamkpen oning z'abọnga k'isọhm oning. Ó̱de ọ́nọng kpenamkpen ochi brẹd kw'make yist, màkpaar-ẹ z'ẹkaan ch'anọng p'Israẹl, zaabẹ́ ode okikennọng, obir ode ọmmaana. <verse eid="EXO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 12:20" />K'ibyi kpenamkpen s'marukọ, m'brẹd kw'make yist kàchi. Màchi brẹd kw'ina yist ake kẹ-kẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 12:21" />Nya o, Mosẹs oyerẹ asogbọhkọnọng p'Israẹl maphyir mattonga. Oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màzọhng <char style="it">bẹ́ kpaar </char> màteka arọkimaanva p'isọhmmọr sabọnga, màfhọ, matima asi odidaama kw'Pasova. <verse eid="EXO 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 12:22" />Màyekẹ izẹ s'eten kpenamkpen ch'mafhọ, ke k'ọgbangbang. Màtọka eke ch'azizaarẹ p'hisop, manọhma ny'izẹ njo, màfoka z'ammakwuksọ, ọmaana z'ammakwukchi. Tte ọnọng kpenamkpen oning k'iyaan oyinẹ maa, ewu esobha. <verse eid="EXO 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 12:23" />K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi im'ozenga ny'izek njo ọfhọ anọng p'Ijip, óde oze izẹ njo ny'abọnga k'isọhm, m'okwur ojeka. Ozeng-eden kw'obo ọbọhk mòtte bẹ́, odim z'abọnga k'isọhm, ọfhọ bọnga.<verse eid="EXO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 12:24" />“Bọnga, ọmaana iva p'iva pabọnga mm'akpobha apaanga mba, ttattampe. <verse eid="EXO 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 12:25" />Ó̱de mapyirẹ z'izek njo s'Ibinọkpaabyi ọnwọhngọ bẹ́, m'ọnang bọnga, màchina ororo si odidaama nwa kw'Pasova. <verse eid="EXO 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 12:26" />Íkwuna iva pabọnga mabọbhọ bọnga bẹ́, ‘Odidaama nwa oyinẹ yen?’ <verse eid="EXO 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 12:27" />Bọnga mm'apọhna bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ode odidaama kw'motim ọfọhnọ ẹja ch'Pasova ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ch'iwa ojek isọhm s'anọng p'Israẹl ny'Ijip, ọkkaana isọhmmọr samina, osi anọng p'Ijip itama.’ ” Nya o, anọng p'Israẹl maphyir, maraka nso makpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 12:28" />Mabina, masi k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs, ọmaana Aarọn obena.<verse eid="EXO 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 12:29" />Opyirẹ ny'orungittem, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọfhọ acheden-jinọngva p'anọng p'Ijip, tọma z'ochedenwa kw'Phero, kw'oning z'ẹvaarkkọhbhọ, tto z'acheden-jinọngva p'ayim mgbakkọhbhọ. Wa obir ọfhọ acheden p'etirakpo py'anọng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 12:30" />Ny'erungọ, Phero ọmaana adukwa pẹ, ọttara anọng p'Ijip maphyir, mabina k'erungọ, matima amọng p'mabhomọ k'ẹrọng maphyabha ny'ẹkọma ch'Ijip. Wa ọsọhm kode kw'ọnọng ina ope.<verse eid="EXO 12:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozenga kw'anọng p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 12:31" />Ny'erungọ, Phero oyerẹ Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn oben bẹ bẹ́, “Bọnga maphyir, màbina! Bọnga ọttara anọng p'Israẹl màtte anọng paam ọbọhk, màzọhng kpobha Ibinọkpaabyi mach'nkk'aphyema. <verse eid="EXO 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 12:32" />Màtọka etirakpo pyabọnga maphyir, mazọhng afona k'ose kw'nkk'aphyema. Màbir si-m ittabọhng.”<verse eid="EXO 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 12:33" />Anọng p'Ijip mawọkọ anọng p'Israẹl, maben bẹ bẹ́, “Màbina ẹbhar-ẹbhar rik ẹkọma nda, mfha moning maphyir ope!” <verse eid="EXO 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 12:34" />Ofona nya o, anọng p'Israẹl mabina, matinẹ abuma p'nna yist atima aka, make k'agbangbangva p'nd-atima asi brẹd, mabhọrọ k'ọbara fabẹ, manana z'mbubaang. <verse eid="EXO 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 12:35" />Mabir asi k'ose kw'Mosẹs ọtọhnọ bẹ, mabọbh anọng p'Ijip bẹ́, manang bẹ ekpo py'matim silva ọmaana gol asi, ọttara ọbara. <verse eid="EXO 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 12:36" />Ode ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'anọng p'Ijip ọtwa bẹ́, masi ọphyaam anang anọng p'Israẹl. Ofona nya o, anọng p'Israẹl macha ekpo py'anọng p'Ijip atima afona.<verse eid="EXO 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 12:37" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl abin ozenga z'Rameses, machina z'Sukọt. Anọng p'uwa masi ozenga nwo mazengẹ anọng ẹnọhna nnọhna arọbh anna, ágbaarẹ panọng ọmaana ivava abharẹ. <verse eid="EXO 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 12:38" />Wa anọng ọdọk-ọdọk k'ọsaabh, mabir ator anọng p'Israẹl ny'ozenga nwo, ttara abhaam, ọmaana arọkimaan, ọttara avu k'ẹkaan. <verse eid="EXO 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 12:39" />K'ogbe kw'anọng p'Israẹl mabin, matte Ijip ọbọhk, m'ogbe kayen mawọhn ọchattọhk anang ifor sabẹ, okurọ ch'anọng p'Ijip makwubh bẹ okwubh. Minna kw'matim abuma mbo masi brẹd kw'ina obibir obirẹ.<verse eid="EXO 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 12:40" />Kibungọ-kibungọ, wa anọng p'Israẹl arukọ ny'Ijip k'icho ẹnọhna okwuma icho ẹrọbh okwuma ijobh. <verse eid="EXO 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 12:41" />Ny'ekpongannamwu ch'icho njo ẹnọhna okwuma icho ẹrọbh okwuma ijobh, nya wọ kw'uwa anọng p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, matte Ijip ọbọhk, k'nkaana sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 12:42" />Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi okkerẹ erungọ bẹ́, ọrọhbha anọng p'Israẹl z'Ijip. Nya wọ osi, anọng p'Israẹl maphyir, mm'ad-atim ọda, matima akpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'epemaanitor.<verse eid="EXO 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apaanga p'Odidaama kw'Pasova</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 12:43" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn bẹ́, “Apaanga p'amaan Odidaama kw'Pasova made bẹ́: tte okikennọng kpenamkpen oning ọchattọhk mvo ochi. <verse eid="EXO 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 12:44" />Obira kpenamkpen kw'nkk'adebha, mabir abhir-ẹ ọnọm, m'ochi. <verse eid="EXO 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 12:45" />Ṉ́nòde akikennọng p'arukọ amaana bọnga, ọmaana atọhmnọng p'mad-akpe akpuka k'ọtọhm fabẹ, tte maning achi.<verse eid="EXO 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 12:46" />“Mm'aninga z'ọsọhm ẹtaanga achi eten ndo, ẹyaara ening k'iyaan eyinẹ. M'ọkọbhọ kpenamkpen kw'eten ndo kabir avọhkọ. <verse eid="EXO 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EXO 12:47" />Tte anọng p'Israẹl maphyir, masi odidaama nwa.<verse eid="EXO 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EXO 12:48" />“Ó̱de okikennọng kw'orukọ ọmaana bọnga ororọ bẹ́, osi Odidaama nwa kw'Pasova ọmaana bọnga, tte ajinọngva p'ẹsọhmmọr chẹ maphyir abhirẹ inọm sabẹ, mfha matọk-ẹ mach'ọmmaana wanẹ kwabọnga. M'ọnọng kw'ina ọnọm obhirẹ ọbọhk kàtte ochi. <verse eid="EXO 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EXO 12:49" />Ozeng k'ammaana, ọmaana akikennọng, apaanga mba, mabaabh bẹ ọttara.”<verse eid="EXO 12:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="EXO 12:50" />Minna kw'uwa anọng p'Israẹl maphyir masi k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn obena. <verse eid="EXO 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EXO 12:51" />Ny'ewu ndo madanẹ-danẹ, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otima anọng p'Israẹl k'nkaana sabẹ, mabina z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 12:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EXO 13" />
  <para style="s1">Acheden-jinọngva odidibha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 13:1" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 13:2" />“Kọ m'atte ojinọng kpenamkpen kw'ochi eden ọmmaana ọbọhk anang-m. Ochedennwa kpenamkpen kw'ọmmaan ny'Israẹl, zaabẹ́ ode ojinọng, wanẹma, eten, kaam wọ nyen.”<verse eid="EXO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 13:3" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Màjima ewu nda, ewu ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim ẹfa ch'ọbọhk kwẹ, ọrọhbha bọnga k'ebira z'Ijip. M'ọchattọhk f'make yist, kàchi. <verse eid="EXO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 13:4" />Menda, m'ophe kw'Abib wọ kw'bọnga mm'abina. <verse eid="EXO 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 13:5" />K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'otima bọnga opyirẹ z'izek s'anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana s'anọng p'Het, ọmaana s'anọng p'Amọr, ọmaana s'anọng p'Hiv, ọttara s'anọng p'Jebus, izek njo s'iwa ochekẹ ọnang ab'ttatta pabọnga, izek s'abasi, ọmaana ọkọhn olor-olorọ, bọnga mm'ad-asi odidaama nwa m'ewu nda ch'ophe nwa. <verse eid="EXO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 13:6" />K'iwu ichenọmfa, màchi brẹd kw'nna yist ake. Ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, màsi odidaama nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 13:7" />Màchi brẹd kw'nna yist ake ny'iwu njo ichenọmfa. Ny'ogbe nwo, tte yist kpenamkpen oning ny'abọnga k'njeka oning, tte oning ny'abọnga k'ẹkọma maphyir-phyir obir oninga. <verse eid="EXO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 13:8" />Ny'ewu ndo, màtek iva pabọnga bẹ́, ‘Nsi minna okurọ ọttọhk f'uwa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọnang mina k'ogbe kw'otim mina obina z'Ijip.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 13:9" />Odidaama nwa m'ode mach'ẹkọhka ch'mm'ake k'mbọhk sabọnga, màbir akpa k'ititika sabọnga mach'ejima bẹ́, ọpaanga kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oning k'ẹmma chabọnga, okurọ bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ otim ẹfa chẹ chiden, ọrọhbha bọnga z'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 13:10" />K'icho k'icho, bọnga min'ad-akpobha ọpaanga nwa, k'ogbe kwẹ.<verse eid="EXO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 13:11" />“K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'ọnang bọnga izek njo s'aKenaan k'ose kw'uwa ochekẹ ọnang bọnga ọmaana ab'atte pabọnga, <verse eid="EXO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 13:12" />bọnga mm'atọka achedenva p'ibhọr kpenamkpen, adibha anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Achedenva p'etirakpo pyabọnga maphyir k'ejinọng, mm'abir ade paam. <verse eid="EXO 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 13:13" />Màtima ọrọkimaannwa bhek achedenva p'ẹnyanya kpenamkpen. Ó̱de mabenẹ bẹ́, m'ọnyanyanwa nwo màbhek, phyak-ẹ ẹdọngọ. Bọnga mm'abhek achedenva kpenamkpen pabọnga k'ejinọng.<verse eid="EXO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 13:14" />“Íkwuna ájinọngva pabọnga mabọbhọ bọnga bẹ́, ‘Mvoma oyinẹ yen?’ Màpọhna bẹ́, ‘Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim ẹfa chẹ chiden, otima mina obina z'Ijip, ọrọhbha mina z'izek s'moning k'ebira. <verse eid="EXO 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 13:15" />K'ogbe kw'uwa Phero ọgaang ettem obhum bẹ́, otte mina ọbọhk mofona, wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọfhọ acheden-jinọngva, ọmaana achedenva p'etirakpo maphyir k'ejinọng z'Ijip. Nya wọ osi, ntima achedenva p'etirakpo k'ejinọng maphyir, mfọhnọ ẹja nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mfha ntima mbhek achedenva paam k'ejinọng.’ <verse eid="EXO 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 13:16" />M'ode mach'ẹkọhka ny'ọbọhk kwọ, obir ode ejima bẹ́, wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ otim ẹfa chẹ chiden ọrọhbha mina z'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ejeka ch'Ẹraanga-kora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 13:17" />K'ogbe kw'uwa Phero notte anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk mafona, Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ ọbọhk kotte bẹ́, mazenga z'ẹkọma ch'aPhilistiya, chibhẹ ch'iwa ode bẹ́, eden ndo dọ ekpumọ ọtam. Wa Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de anọng p'Israẹl makebh egbong z'eden, makpokpo abhona achibhẹ pabẹ makpa nnam z'Ijip.” <verse eid="EXO 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 13:18" />Ofona nya, Ibinọkpaabyi otima bẹ ọkọbha z'eden ch'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, za ch'echin z'Ẹraanga-kora. Wa ch'anọng p'Israẹl mabin z'Ijip, mado ifor s'egbong mawuriji.<verse eid="EXO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 13:19" />Ny'ozenga nwo, wa Mosẹs otim akọbhọ p'Josẹph obina, okurọ ch'iwa Josẹph ikk'anọng p'Israẹl ọsa machekẹ, ch'obenẹ bẹ bẹ́, “K'odik ọkkọkka, Ibinọkpaabyi m'ọkkaana bọnga. Ógbe íkk'obenga, màtima akọbhọ paam bina m'ibyi nja.”<verse eid="EXO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 13:20" />Ch'iwa nkk'abina z'Sukọt, makwu abhing z'Ẹtam, ny'okikaan kw'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ. <verse eid="EXO 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 13:21" />Wa ny'ozenga nwo, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim ebonọ ch'ebe odudum ochi bẹ eden k'ẹya. K'erungọ, otima ekpon ch'ebe odudum ọnang bẹ ọyaanttaana k'erungọ. <verse eid="EXO 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 13:22" />Ebonọ ndo ch'ebe odudum k'ẹya, ọmaana ekpon ndo ch'ebe odudum k'erungọ, ibyi sabẹ kebin erik. Ening ny'ititika s'anọng mbo mach'ening nya.<verse eid="EXO 13:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EXO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 14:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 14:2" />“Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, makpa nnam mad-abhing z'ẹkọma ch'Pi-Hahirọt, ny'njeka kw'Migdọl, ọmaana ọraanga kwiden. Tte mabhing anyọma ọraanga kwiden, za ch'okkerẹ Baal-Zẹphọn ititika. <verse eid="EXO 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 14:3" />Phero m'ochibhẹ bẹ́, damadama kk'anọng p'Israẹl ọsa mattena achina z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ. <verse eid="EXO 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 14:4" />Kaam m'nsi Phero ọgaangẹ ettem ochina ororo okwubh bẹ. Okenaka, kaam m'ntima Phero ọmaana agbongnọng pẹ, ntọka abarada nnang ifor saam, mfha anọng p'Ijip atima azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.” Anọng p'Israẹl masi mach'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ.<verse eid="EXO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 14:5" />Ch'matek Phero kw'ode ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip bẹ́, anọng p'Israẹl kk'afona, kẹ ọmaana adukwa pẹ mabhona achibhẹ, maben bẹ́, “Bọng-odik kw'mosi ma o? Nkk'anọng p'Israẹl ọbọhk ọtta mafona. Nkk'itọhm s'mad-asi anang mina ọgwaana.” <verse eid="EXO 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 14:6" />Ofona nya o, Phero ọtọka ọkpaar kwẹ kw'nnyanya id-itọr, ọmaana agbongnọng pẹ, otima bẹ okwubh anọng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 14:7" />Wa obira otima ijaar ọkkọkka s'ide ẹnọhna okwuma arọbh ijobh s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọmaana ijaar njoza s'Ijip maphyir s'nnyanya id-itọr, ttara asonọng p'atim bẹ eden. <verse eid="EXO 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 14:8" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ettem ch'Phero kw'ode ọvaarnọng kw'Ijip, edinẹ, obina okwubh anọng p'Israẹl. Anọng p'Israẹl atima ottembara mazenga afona. <verse eid="EXO 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 14:9" />Anọng p'Ijip maphyir, ọmaana nnyanya s'Phero, ọmaana ijaar sẹ s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọmaana ayaar-ọyaar, ọttara agbongnọng pẹ, makwubh anọng p'Israẹl maa, makebha bẹ. Wa makebh bẹ za ch'mabhingẹ atuma ẹraangadim, za ch'ọnyọm Pi-Hahirọt kw'okkerẹ Baal-Zẹphọn ititika.<verse eid="EXO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 14:10" />K'ose kw'Phero ozeng ọnyọma bẹ, anọng p'Israẹl atinẹ achen akkerẹ, maze anọng p'Ijip ch'mad-azenga anyọma bẹ z'ifor. Ojora osi be mawuriji. Mabhom akpẹkẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 14:11" />Maben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ozeng z'Ijip, wa apekwuk aning za. Osempira atima minna akwu m'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ bẹ́, mokwu ope ma? Bọng-ọttọhk f'azeng ábẹ̀ atima mina abina z'Ijip? <verse eid="EXO 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 14:12" />Wa mina nkk'ọ obena bẹ́, ‘Tte mina ọbọhk mosi agbugbuna ọnang anọng p'Ijip’. Wura ojibh ọtam bẹ́, mope z'Ijip, ọyọhnga bẹ́, mokwu ope m'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ.”<verse eid="EXO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 14:13" />Mosẹs ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Tte oning bọnga ojor. Màninga <char style="it">bẹ́ sẹẹbh</char>. Menda mm'aze ẹkkaana ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Anọng mba p'Ijip p'maze ma menda, kwuna m'ọdọk bẹ maze. <verse eid="EXO 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 14:14" />Màninga <char style="it">bẹ́ sẹẹbh</char>. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ im'osi erima chabọnga.”<verse eid="EXO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 14:15" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Osempira mad-abhom ẹmọng akpẹk-m? Ben anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, machina ororo k'ozenga kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 14:16" />Yaangẹ ochikwura kwọ k'ẹrọng atena z'ẹraangadim, ọfha asi abhaangẹ k'ibyi ifa. M'ofona nya, eden m'eninga ch'anọng p'Israẹl mm'azenga k'izek s'igw-ogwu, ajeka. <verse eid="EXO 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 14:17" />Kaam m'nsi anọng p'Ijip madinẹ nttem, mfha mado anọng p'Israẹl akwubh. Kaam m'nzenga ny'Phero, ọmaana agbongnọng pẹ maphyir, ọmaana ijaar sẹ s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọttara ayaar-ọyaar pẹ, nyena abarada. <verse eid="EXO 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 14:18" />Anọng p'Ijip mazonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, k'ogbe kw'im'nzenga ny'Phero, ọmaana agbongnọng pẹ, ọmaana ijaar sẹ s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọttara ayaar-ọyaar pẹ, nyena abarada.”<verse eid="EXO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 14:19" />Nya o, ozeng-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ọtọm za ochi agbongnọng p'Israẹl eden, nokwu okponga bẹ nnam. Ebonọ ch'ebe odudum, ebira ebina z'ititika ekwu ekponga bẹ nnam, <verse eid="EXO 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 14:20" />eninga ny'njeka kw'agbongnọng p'Ijip, ọmaana p'Israẹl. Minna kw'ebunọ ndo etim orungibanga ekwu k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ, ẹnang ọyaanttaana k'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza. Ofona nya, bẹ nnam mfa, m'ayok kanyọm ny'orungiwu nwo maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 14:21" />Nya o, Mosẹs onemẹ ọbọhk kwẹ otena z'ẹraangadim ndo. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otima ebum ch'ẹgaang-ọgaangẹ ch'ebin za ch'ewuchen ed-eyin, osi ẹraangadim ndo ẹbhaangẹ k'ibyi ifa. Izek s'igw-ogwu iyin. <verse eid="EXO 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 14:22" />Minna kw'anọng p'Israẹl mazeng ny'ọgbaarẹ kw'ogw-ogwu kw'ẹraangadim ndo, asi mbo p'nkk'abhaanga, mabe mach'etumọ z'abẹ k'odimbọhk, ọmaana z'obhurubọhk.<verse eid="EXO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 14:23" />Anọng p'Ijip matima nnyanya, ọmaana ijaar s'Phero s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọttara ayaar-ọyaar pẹ, makwubh bẹ maa, madim z'ẹraangadim ndo. <verse eid="EXO 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 14:24" />Otum k'ekpikpebha, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ozenga ny'ekpon ch'ebe odudum ọmaana ny'ebonọ ch'ebe odudum, oze agbongnọng p'Ijip, oke bẹ k'damadama. <verse eid="EXO 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 14:25" />Pira ọgbaka mmo s'ijaar s'Phero. Ofona nya, ọyaara nọkaar bẹ ọkaara. Anọng p'Ijip aben bẹ́, “Abayi, matte mobina orik anọng mba p'Israẹl o! Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ od-orima ọmaana mina ma, k'abẹ k'nso.”<verse eid="EXO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 14:26" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Nemẹ ọbọhk kwọ tena z'ẹraangadim ndo, ọfha asi mbo mabir akpa nnam mabhọrọ anọng p'Ijip, ọmaana ijaar sabẹ, ọttara ayaar-ọyaar pabẹ.” <verse eid="EXO 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 14:27" />Mosẹs onemẹ ọbọhk kwẹ otena z'ẹraangadim ndo. Ny'owusobh, ẹraangadim ndo ẹkpa nnam z'eninga chẹ. Anọng p'Ijip makonga k'ose kw'mm'arọbh. Okenaka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi onyunọ bẹ maphyir oke z'ẹraangadim ndo. <verse eid="EXO 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 14:28" />Asi mbo mabhobh akpa nnam, mabhọrọ ijaar njo s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọmaana ayaar-ọyaar, ọttara agbongnọng p'Phero maphyir p'makwubhọ anọng p'Israẹl maa, madim z'ẹraangadim ndo. Ọnọng mawanẹ-wanẹ kw'ọnaang kode.<verse eid="EXO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 14:29" />Ńnòde anọng p'Israẹl, bẹ mazenga ny'ọgbaarẹ kw'ogwu-ogwu ny'ẹraangadim ndo majeka, asi mabe mach'etumọ z'odimbọhk kwabẹ, ọmaana z'obhurubọhk. <verse eid="EXO 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 14:30" />Ny'ewu ndo, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọrọhbha anọng p'Israẹl z'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip. Anọng p'Israẹl maze ose kw'anọng p'Ijip mape ayima ny'araangakonga. <verse eid="EXO 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 14:31" />Ch'anọng p'Israẹl maze ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọkọhk edidenfa chẹ ch'otim osi anọng p'Ijip itama, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ojora bẹ, mabir aphe nnam k'ikẹ, ọmaana k'Mosẹs kw'ode ọtọhmnọng kwẹ.<verse eid="EXO 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EXO 15" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹmọng ch'Mosẹs ọmaana Miriyam makkọhnọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 15:1" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl makkọhn ẹmọng ndoma anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">“Kaam m'nkkọhn ẹmọng nnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">okurọ abarada pẹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:1">Kk'nnyanya ọttara ayaar-ọyaar</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:1">onyuna ọbharẹ z'ẹraangadim.<verse eid="EXO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 15:2" />“Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ ode ẹfa chaam, obir ode ẹmọng ch'nkkọhnọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">kẹ wọ ode ẹnaanga chaam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:2">Kẹ wọ ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwaam, kaam m'ntọhng-ẹ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:2">Kaam m'ntinẹ eche ch'Ibinọkpaabyi kw'atte kwaam okpobh k'ẹrọng.<verse eid="EXO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 15:3" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ode okkikkaama;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:3">Eche chẹ ede, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 15:4" />Kẹ kk'ijaar s'Phero s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọmaana agbongnọng pẹ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">onyuna ọbharẹ z'ẹraangadim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:4">Obira osi agbongsonọng ọkkọkka p'Phero</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:4">madimẹ z'Ẹraanga-kora.<verse eid="EXO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 15:5" />Asi p'adong-odong nkk'bẹ abhọra maphyir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:5">mattem z'esiwọr mach'ẹtakpa.<verse eid="EXO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 15:6" />O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">odimbọhk kwọ oyen ẹfa chiden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:6">O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, atim odimbọhk kwọ asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:6">awawunanọng ma e.<verse eid="EXO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 15:7" />“K'ediden ch'ẹvaar chọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">kk'anọng p'akaang-ọ odik anyuna abharẹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:7">Kọ atte ottempyibha kwọ ọbọhk,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:7">ọkwọmọ bẹ mach'azizaarẹ-bukọ.<verse eid="EXO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 15:8" />Agwum iwọhng sọ ny'asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">asi atobha, mabe <char style="it">bẹ́ pyir</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:8">asi p'abhobh-obhobh makwu abe mach'etumọ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:8">Asi mbo p'akem edonga, mabhakẹ adan-ọdan ny'ettem kw'ọraanga.<verse eid="EXO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 15:9" />Ọwawunanọng osi ẹmma, oben bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">‘Kaam m'nkwubh bẹ, mbọka bẹ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Kaam m'nna bẹ ekpo pyabẹ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">nchi ẹgwọhr-ẹgwọhra.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:9">Kaam m'ntima ọkkangkkang kwaam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:9">mfhọ bẹ maphyir.’<verse eid="EXO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 15:10" />Okenaka, iwọhng sọ jẹ-jẹ s'agwum,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">ẹraangadim ẹbhọrọ bẹ maphyir.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:10">Minna kw'matemẹ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:10">z'esiwọr mach'opo.<verse eid="EXO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 15:11" />“O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ny'ekpo py'anọng akpobh maphyir, bọng-ọttọhk vọ ode mach'ikọ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:11">Anyi wọ ode mach'ikọ?</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">Kọ ade Ọvaarnọng kw'awuriji,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">abarada pọ major-ojora,</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="EXO 15:11">abir ad-asi idik s'ipe anọng ifor.<verse eid="EXO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 15:12" />“Kọ anemẹ odimbọhk kwọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:12">izek imyi awawunanọng pọ maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 15:13" />Ọdaakẹ kwọ kw'ina ẹkpọka oyen, kẹ kw'atim</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">achi anọng p'ikk'arọbha k'ebira eden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:13">Kọ kk'ẹfa chọ atima akkerẹ bẹ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:13">maa, mapyirẹ z'iruk-byi sọ s'awuriji.<verse eid="EXO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 15:14" />Ifufọnọ m'ibọka nkọma njoza ch'im'ibhaanga idik nja.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:14">Anọng p'Philistiya m'aninga k'ojora.<verse eid="EXO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 15:15" />Ojora m'ọbọka avaar p'obhon kw'Edom,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:15">ifufọnọ m'ibọka asonọng p'Moab,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:15">anọng p'abaabh Kenaan m'ape k'ifor maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 15:16" />Bẹ mm'aninga k'ojora ọmaana k'opoma fiden.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, k'ẹfa chọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">bẹ mm'aninga mach'ẹtakpa <char style="it">bẹ́ sẹẹbh</char>,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:16">maa anọng p'ikk'akkaana, makpan afona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:16">anọng mbo p'arọbh k'ebira makpan afona.<verse eid="EXO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 15:17" />Kọ m'atima bẹ achina z'ogbeso kwọ kw'awuriji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:17">ammin bẹ ny'ibyi s'ikọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi asi iruk-byi sọ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">iruk-byi sọ s'awuriji, s'ikọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:17">atim mbọhk sọ, asi.<verse eid="EXO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 15:18" />“Ẹbaabha ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'eninga maa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:18">ttattampe.”<verse eid="EXO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 15:19" />K'ogbe kw'nnyanya s'Phero, ọmaana ijaar sẹ s'nnyanya id-itọr, ọttara ayaar-ọyaar pẹ masak z'ẹraangadim, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi asi p'ọraanga nwo mabhọrọ bẹ. Okenaka, anọng p'Israẹl mazenga ny'ettem ch'ọraanga nwo kw'ogwu-ogwu, ajeka. <verse eid="EXO 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 15:20" />Nya o, Miriyam kw'ode ọgbaak-ettem ch'Ibinọkpaabyi, obir ode ọgbaanọkka kw'Aarọn, ọtọka ogim-ogim okir. Panọng maphyir mabira akir agim-agim, matubh ator-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 15:21" />Miriyam ọkkọhn ẹmọng ọnang bẹ bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">“Màkkọhn ẹmọng nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">kirẹ ediden chẹ ẹyọhng-ọyọhnga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 15:21">Kẹ kk'ẹnyanya, ọmaana ọyaar-ọyaar onyuna maphyir</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 15:21">ọbharẹ z'ẹraangadim.”<verse eid="EXO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi p'Mara ọmaana Elim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 15:22" />Nya o, Mosẹs otima anọng p'Israẹl eden obina z'Ẹraanga-kora, machina z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, z'Shur. Mazenga ny'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ k'iwu ittaan, m'asi kaze. <verse eid="EXO 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 15:23" />Ch'nnapyirẹ z'Mara, m'asi p'ibyi njo kakpo agwo, okurọ ch'majobh-ojobhọ. Nya wọ osi mayerẹ ibyi njo bẹ́, Mara<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mara </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oyinẹ bẹ́, ajobhiji.</char></note>. <verse eid="EXO 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 15:24" />Ofona nya, anọng mbo manwọhnọ, maben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Mm'ogwo mbọng o?”<verse eid="EXO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 15:25" />Minna kw'Mosẹs obhomọ ọkpẹkẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, pira Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otibh-ẹ ochinwa. Mosẹs o, ọtọka ochinwa nwo ọbharẹ z'asi, asi mbo makwu alebh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 15:25">Nya wọ kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang ọsana, obira ọnang anọng p'Israẹl eyoma. <verse eid="EXO 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 15:26" />Oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de bọnga mm'atọka ogbe, mayonga itọhng k'ọgbaakadik kw'kaam Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, mabira asi idik s'itor-otor k'kaam k'achen, mabira akpobha ọgbaakadik kwaam, ọmaana asana paam maphyir, kaam bọnga ikọhmaana s'nnang anọng p'Ijip mìnang. Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'od-obina bọnga k'ikọhmaana.”<verse eid="EXO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 15:27" />Nya o, mabina, makwu apyirẹ z'Elim, za ch'nkeka ijobh kkamfa ining, arọhngaji arọbh attaan okwuma ijobh mabir aninga nya. Minna kw'mabhingẹ nya ch'ọnyọm nkeka njo.<verse eid="EXO 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EXO 16" />
  <para style="s1">Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang anọng p'Israẹl ọchattọhk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 16:1" />K'iwu ichi s'ophe kw'ottong afa, k'ogbe kw'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'abina z'Ijip, bẹ maphyir mabina ozenga z'Elim, makwu apyirẹ z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, z'Sin kw'oning k'njeka kw'Elim ọmaana Sinai. <verse eid="EXO 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 16:2" />Ny'ibyi njo, anọng p'Israẹl maphyir maninga nya anwọhnọ anang Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn. <verse eid="EXO 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 16:3" />Maben bẹ bẹ́, “Wura ojibh ọtam bẹ́, mope k'mbọhk s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi z'Ijip. Z'Ijip, mod-oninga ẹwọr ọkọbha ọzọhka f'nten, mochi ekpo py'ẹdaakẹ minna maa, mọdọhbh. Okenaka, bọnga nkk'mina atima ayin k'iyaan akwu m'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ bẹ́, okwo ọfhọ anọng mba maphyir.”<verse eid="EXO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 16:4" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam m'ntọhm brẹd kw'im'otebh mach'ẹrọng, nnang bọnga. K'ewu kpenamkpen, anọng màd-ayin k'iyaan, màd-akpokọ k'ose kw'im'obenga bẹ k'ewu. Minna kw'im'ntima nyoma bẹ, ọfha nzonga óde mm'ator ntọhna saam, mbir nzonga óde mm'abhum-obhum. <verse eid="EXO 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 16:5" />Ó̱ttong iwu ichadanẹ, màkpokọ brẹd nwo igbedim ifa, ọsaabh ọyọhnga nwo kw'mad-akkikken akpokọ z'iwu njoza.”<verse eid="EXO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 16:6" />Ofona nya, Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn maben anọng p'Israẹl maphyir bẹ́, “Za k'ẹsọhka, bọnga mm'azonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ otim bọnga obina z'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 16:7" />Ó̱tum k'ekpebha, mm'aze abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, okurọ bẹ́, kẹ kk'bọnga ọbhaanga ch'mad-anwọhnọ anang-ẹ. Mina mode mbọng kw'bọnga mad-anwọhnọ anang mina?” <verse eid="EXO 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 16:8" />Mosẹs obira oben bẹ bẹ́, “Bọnga mm'azonga bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ ọnang bọnga eten ch'machi k'ẹsọhka, ọmaana brẹd maphyir kw'marorọ k'ekpebha, okurọ bẹ́, kẹ kk'bọnga ọbhaanga ch'mad-anwọhnọ anang-ẹ. Mina mode mbọng? Mina azang p'bọnga mad-anwọhnọ, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'mad-anwọhnọ.”<verse eid="EXO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 16:9" />Nya o, Mosẹs, oben Aarọn bẹ́, “Tek anọng p'Israẹl maphyir bẹ́, makwu abe k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, okurọ bẹ́, kẹ kk'ẹnwọhnọ chabọnga, ọbhaanga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 16:10" />Nya ch'Aarọn otim ọgbaak odik ọnang anọng p'Israẹl maphyir, minna kw'mabin ichen akkerẹ z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, maze abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ch'mad-ayin ny'ebonọ.<verse eid="EXO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 16:11" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 16:12" />“Kaam kk'ẹnwọhnọ ch'anọng p'Israẹl mmaanga. Tek bẹ bẹ́, k'ẹsọhka, mm'ayena nten s'mm'achi, k'ekpebha mabira ayena brẹd kw'mm'achi maa, madọhbh. Nya kw'mm'azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 16:13" />Ny'ẹsọhka, ọnọhn f'ẹgba ọsaka maa, ofu ibhinga-byi sabẹ. Opyirẹ k'ekpebha, ifọhng isaka, ibhọrọ ibyi s'mabhingẹ. <verse eid="EXO 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 16:14" />K'ogbe kw'ifọhng njo ikk'isa o, ekpo mach'mfhọfhọ, eyin ebubha izek njo s'anọng nna arukọ. <verse eid="EXO 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 16:15" />Anọng p'Israẹl maze nya o, ch'ọttọhk mvo ina bẹ ọttaanẹ, mabọbh ayok bẹ́, “Bọng-ọttọhk vọ nya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 16:15">Mosẹs ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Ọchattọhk f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang bọnga bẹ́, machi vọ nya e. <verse eid="EXO 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 16:16" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'ẹfa ọnanga bẹ́, ọnọng-ọnọng okpokọ k'ose kw'im'obeng-ẹ. K'ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oning ny'ikkira sọ, m'akpokọ fẹ k'ogbobhmbọhk.”<verse eid="EXO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 16:17" />Anọng p'Israẹl masi k'ose kw'matekẹ bẹ. Wa ayok banẹ akpokọ k'ọsaabh, banẹ akpokọ makarẹ. <verse eid="EXO 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 16:18" />K'ogbe kw'mayom ekpo mbyo k'ogbobhmbọhk, ọnọng kw'okpokọ k'ọsaabh koyen ọyọhng-ọyọhnga. Oyok kw'okpokọ makarẹ obira oyena py'ebeng-ẹ. Ọnọng-ọnọng okpokọ k'ose kw'ebeng-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 16:19" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọnọng kpenamkpen oning ọchattọhk mvo oye maa, ewu esobha.”<verse eid="EXO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 16:20" />Okenaka, wa ayok banẹ m'Mosẹs itọhng kayong. Matọk byanẹ asok maa, ewu esobha. Minna kw'ezeng etto nzirẹ, ẹtọma eruk osisom. Ofona nya, wa ọdọkọ Mosẹs otima otor bẹ.<verse eid="EXO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 16:21" />K'ekpebha kpenamkpen, ọnọng-ọnọng od-okpokọ k'ose kw'obeng-ẹ. K'ogbe kw'echekira ẹgaangẹ nya, ẹyaana maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 16:22" />Ny'ewu ch'ettong ichadanẹ, mad-akpokọ agbobhmbọhk afa, kw'ode ọchattọhk f'iwu ifa. Asonọng p'Israẹl mabina, makwu atek Mosẹs odik nwo. <verse eid="EXO 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 16:23" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang ẹfa bẹ́, ‘Ophyinẹ m'ode ẹwọhngkwokawu, ewu ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ch'ewur-owur. Ofona nya, màbhaabh f'mm'abhaabh, mabira awọhn f'mm'awọhn. Okpenamkpen f'obekẹ, màtọka ye maa, opyirẹ k'ekpebha.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 16:24" />Minna kw'masi k'ose kw'Mosẹs obenẹ bẹ, maye py'erikẹ maa, ewu esobha, eruk kesomọ, nzirẹ kebir etto. <verse eid="EXO 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 16:25" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màchi fẹ menda, okurọ bẹ́, menda ode ẹwọhngkwokawu ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Menda m'ọchattọhk mvo ny'izek, maze. <verse eid="EXO 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 16:26" />Bọnga mm'atima iwu ichadanẹ akpokọ ọchattọhk mvo. Ó̱ttong íwu ichenọmfa, kw'ode ẹwọhngkwokawu, ọchattọhk mvo mòninga.”<verse eid="EXO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 16:27" />Chibhẹ nya, wa ayok banẹ ayinẹ k'iyaan ny'ewu ndo ch'ettong ichenọmfa, mad-aror ọchattọhk mvo. Okenaka, m'ọttọhk kaze. <verse eid="EXO 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 16:28" />Nya kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi nobenẹ Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ogbe mòbhir otuma yen pira bọnga makpobha asana paam, ọttara ntọhna saam? <verse eid="EXO 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 16:29" />Màjima bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'bọnga ẹwọngkwokawu ọnanga. Kẹ wọ osi ọnang bọnga brẹd k'iwu ifa ny'ewu ndo ch'ettong ichadanẹ. Kọbaan bẹ́ ọnọng kpenamkpen ọta ibyi ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa.” <verse eid="EXO 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 16:30" />Nya o, anọng mbo makwoka ọwọhng ny'ewu ndo ch'ettong ichenọmfa.<verse eid="EXO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 16:31" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl mayerẹ brẹd nwo bẹ́, manna. Wa manna nwo owur-owur mach'achimọma p'korianda, obir ode z'ẹdaak mach'ayokpa p'matim akọhnsi asi. <verse eid="EXO 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 16:32" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'mina obena bẹ́, ‘Màtọka ogbobhmbọhk wanẹ kw'manna màye, mfha kwuna matọka akọhka epemaanitor bẹ́, brẹdkira nwoma kw'uwa nnang bọnga z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ k'ogbe kw'ntim bọnga mbina z'Ijip.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 16:33" />Mosẹs o, oben Aarọn bẹ́, “Tọka ẹsẹbin awona manna kw'ofu ogbobhmbọhk nya. Tọka bera ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, asok epemaanitor.”<verse eid="EXO 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 16:34" />Aarọn osi k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena. Ọtọka manna nwo osok ny'ititika s'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, oye nya. <verse eid="EXO 16:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 16:35" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl machi manna nwo k'icho arọbh afa, maa mapyirẹ z'izek s'anọng arukọ. Machi manna nwo maa, mapyirẹ ny'enem ch'Kenaan.<verse eid="EXO 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 16:36" />Omer ode ogbobhmbọhk mawanẹ k'agbobhmbọhk ijobh p'asi ẹpha madanẹ.<verse eid="EXO 16:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EXO 17" />
  <para style="s1">Asi ayinẹ k'ẹtakpa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 17:1" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl maphyir mabin ozenga z'Sin, z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, mazenga k'ibyi k'ibyi, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'bẹ obena. Mapyirẹ ny'Rẹphidim, mabhing nya. Wa m'asi kaze p'mm'agwo. <verse eid="EXO 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 17:2" />Minna kw'masi ẹtta anang Mosẹs, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Nang mina asi p'mm'ogwo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 17:2">Mosẹs ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Osempira mad-asi ẹtta amaan-m o? Mad-asi yen ake Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'eyoma o?”<verse eid="EXO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 17:3" />Ny'ogbe nwo, wa asi kk'anọng adaaka ny'ibyi njo maa, manwọhnọ anang Mosẹs, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Osempira atima mina abina z'Ijip, ọmaana iva pamina, ọttara etirakpo pyamina bẹ́, mokwu ope k'osi-daakẹ o?”<verse eid="EXO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 17:4" />Nya o, Mosẹs obhom ọkpẹkẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam m'nsi yen mmaana anọng mba? Bẹ nkk'ifor ada bẹ́, matọbh-m ata.”<verse eid="EXO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 17:5" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Zenga zọhng chi anọng mbo eden. Tima adidennọng banẹ p'Israẹl fona, abira atima ochikwura nwo kw'atim abin ọraanga kw'Nile. <verse eid="EXO 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 17:6" />Kaam m'mbọ-ọ ny'ititika ny'ẹtakpa ch'Horẹb. Á̱pyirẹ nya, tọka ochikwura nwo kwọ bin ny'ẹtakpa ndo. Asi m'ayin nya k'ose kw'anọng m'agwo.” Mosẹs osi minna ny'ititika s'adidennọng p'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 17:7" />Mosẹs okpe ibyi njo bẹ́, Masa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Masa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oyinẹ bẹ́, eyoma.</char></note> ọmaana Mẹriba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mẹriba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oyinẹ bẹ́, ẹtta.</char></note>, okurọ ch'anọng p'Israẹl masi ẹtta anang Mosẹs, mabira ayoma Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, maben bẹ́, “Ma, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oning ma ọmaana mina k'odik ọkkọkka yirẹ?”<verse eid="EXO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Israẹl okem egbong ch'orim ọmaana ab'Amalẹk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 17:8" />Ny'ogbe nwo, anọng p'Amalẹk makwu arima egbong amaana anọng p'Israẹl z'Rẹphidim. <verse eid="EXO 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 17:9" />Mosẹs oben Joshua bẹ́, “Rọbha ajinọng banẹ, mad-arima egbong amaana anọng p'Amalẹk. Ophyinẹ kaam m'ntima ochikwura kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ny'ọbọhk nd-mbe z'ogbe-so.”<verse eid="EXO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 17:10" />Minna kw'Joshua orim anọng p'Amalẹk ábè k'ose kw'Mosẹs kk'obena. Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn, ọttara Hur mavura z'ogbe-so. <verse eid="EXO 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 17:11" />Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'Mosẹs ọyaangẹ mbọhk sẹ k'ẹrọng, minna kw'anọng p'Israẹl makem. Ogbe kw'ọsak mbọhk sẹ k'izek, anọng p'Amalẹk akema. <verse eid="EXO 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 17:12" />K'ogbe kw'mbọhk ikwok Mosẹs, Aarọn ọmaana Hur, matọka ẹta achen-ẹ oninga ẹwọr. Pira nnabẹ-ẹ k'okwubha k'okwubha, mabọka mbọhk njo asok ny'iwokọ <char style="it">bẹ sẹẹbh</char> maa, ewu ẹsa. <verse eid="EXO 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 17:13" />Minna kw'Joshua otim ọkkangkkang orima anọng p'Amalẹk maa, okema agbongnọng pabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 17:14" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹr idik nja k'nnwẹr, ọfha kwuna anọng matima ajima ekema nda. Yerẹ idik njo k'ose kw'Joshua m'ọbhaanga, okurọ bẹ́, kaam m'ndimẹ anọng p'Amalẹk eche m'iyagbin.”<verse eid="EXO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 17:15" />Mosẹs ottima ija-byi, oyerẹ sẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi wọ ode Okem kwaam.” <verse eid="EXO 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 17:16" />Oben bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'ọttaangẹ anọng p'Amalẹk k'epemaanitor, okurọ ch'matinẹ mbọhk atena ẹvaarkkọhbhọ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EXO 18" />
  <para style="s1">Jẹtro odibhẹ Mosẹs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 18:1" />Wa Jẹtro kw'ode otte kw'kwanọng kw'Mosẹs, obir ode ọfọhn-nja kw'Midiyan, ọbhaang idik njo maphyir s'Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ọsa ọnang Mosẹs, ọttara anọng pẹ Israẹl. Obira ọbhaanga ose kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ozeng otima anọng p'Israẹl eden obina z'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 18:2" />Ode ch'iwa Mosẹs okkikken ọtọhm Zipọra kw'ode kwanọng bẹ́, od-obhing otte Jẹtro ábẹ̀. Jẹtro ọtọka kẹ <verse eid="EXO 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 18:3" />ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ afa. Ojinọngnwa wanẹ okpen Gẹrshọm<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Gẹrshọm </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ode z'itọhng mach'okikennọng.</char></note>, okurọ bẹ́, wa Mosẹs kw'ode otte obenẹ bẹ́, “Kaam n'nde okikennọng k'anọng k'izek.” <verse eid="EXO 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 18:4" />Oyok nwoza okpena Eliyeza<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eliyeza </char><char style="ft" closed="false">oyinẹ bẹ́, Ibinọkpaabyi ode ọkkaan kwaam.</char></note>, okurọ bẹ́, Mosẹs kw'ode otte obir oben bẹ́, “Ibinọkpaabyi kw'atte kwaam wọ ọkkaan-m nnaanga k'ọkkangkkang kw'Phero.”<verse eid="EXO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 18:5" />Jẹtro kw'ode ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs, otima ajinọngva mbo p'Mosẹs ọttara kwanọng kwẹ obina okwu okebha Mosẹs za ch'obhingẹ z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, za ch'ọnyọm egbe ch'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 18:6" />Ode ch'Jẹtro okkikken ọtọhm ẹkkaabha ọnang Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam ọnyẹ kwọ ntim kwanọng kwọ, ọttara ajinọngva pọ afa nkwuma z'eden e.”<verse eid="EXO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 18:7" />Mosẹs obina, okwubh ọnyẹ kwẹ k'eden. Okebh-ẹ nya o, ọraka eso ọnang-ẹ k'ekpikpobha-maana, ọbaak-ẹ <char style="it">bẹ́ baam</char>. Mazima ayok, pira nnadimẹ z'ikkira ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 18:8" />Mosẹs otek Jẹtro ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ozeng Israẹl ábẹ̀ osi Phero, ọmaana anọng p'Ijip. Obir otek-ẹ ose kw'akpen akọhnọ bẹ ch'iwa mazeng z'eden, ọttara ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ozeng ọkkaana bẹ.<verse eid="EXO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 18:9" />Wa ettem ẹdaamẹ Jẹtro mawuriji ch'ọbhaang idik ọkkọkka njo maphyir s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'ọsa ọnang anọng p'Israẹl, ch'ọrọbh bẹ k'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 18:10" />Jẹtro o, oben bẹ́, “Ẹtọhnga ede ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ọrọbh-ọ k'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip, ọmaana s'Phero, obira ọrọbha anọng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk s'anọng p'Ijip. <verse eid="EXO 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 18:11" />Kaam kk'nzonga k'odik ọkkọkka bẹ́, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọbarẹ ẹfa ọyọhnga ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'oyokinọng od-okpobha, okurọ ch'osi idik nja otima otor anọng p'atim ẹgaga asi anọng p'Israẹl ẹyaaka.” <verse eid="EXO 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 18:12" />Nya o, Jẹtro kw'ode ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs, ọtọka ẹnanga ch'ẹkwọmọ, ọttara nnanga ọdọk-ọdọk, otima ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnang Ibinọkpaabyi. Aarọn otima adidennọng p'Israẹl maphyir, makwu bẹ́, maninga ny'Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika machi ọttọhk amaana ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs.<verse eid="EXO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 18:13" />Ewu esobh nya, Mosẹs oninga ẹwọr bẹ́, ọttọhna aponga p'anọng. Anọng aninga akọbh-ẹ. Ọtọma k'ekpebha ọttọhna aponga pabẹ maa, opyirẹ k'ẹsọhka. <verse eid="EXO 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 18:14" />K'ogbe kw'ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs okwu oze ọttọhk f'Mosẹs od-osi nya, obenẹ bẹ́, “Bọng-ọttọhk f'ad-asi anang anọng mba ma o? Kayen kw'anọng mba maphyir mm'akkọbh-ọ ake k'ettem, aninga ẹwọr ma manchenẹ, attọhna aponga pabẹ, tọma k'ekpebha maa, opyirẹ k'ẹsọhka?”<verse eid="EXO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 18:15" />Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Anọng mba mad-akwu aror bẹ́, mazonga idik s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 18:16" />Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'mayen ẹkọhr, mad-atima akebh-m ma, nttọhna nnang nnam vọ ọfa, mbira ntek bẹ okpebhẹ ọmaana asana p'Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 18:17" />Ọnyẹ kw'Mosẹs ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ọttọhk f'ad-asi ma, kojibhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 18:18" />Ọtọhm f'ad-asi ma, m'ọkọhn-ọ ọkpan eden, ozeng k'anọng mba p'ad-akwu akebh-ọ ma. Ọtọhm mva ọbarẹ ọnọ-ọ ẹfa e. Kọ-kọ makpo asi. <verse eid="EXO 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 18:19" />Yonga itọhng k'ntọhna s'im'nnang-ọ. Tte Ibinọkpaabyi oninga ọmaan-ọ. Kọ min'ad-atera eso ch'anọng mba z'Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika, atọka idik sabẹ achen-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 18:20" />Kpebhẹ bẹ apaanga p'Ibinọkpaabyi, abira akpebhẹ bẹ ose kw'mm'azenga aruk, ọmaana idik s'mmin'ad-asi. <verse eid="EXO 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 18:21" />Okenaka, teka ajinọng p'makpo ọttọhk osisi ny'ikpakaana s'anọng mbo maphyir. Tte anọng mbo ade anọng p'ayen ojora f'Ibinọkpaabyi, ẹ́mmáaná chabẹ ebir ẹdaak anọng, mabira ade anọng p'nna anọng màtukọ. Si bẹ aso p'nkwurọ s'anọng nnọhna k'nnọhna, ọmaana p'nkwurọ s'anọng arọbh achen achen, ọmaana p'nkwurọ s'anọng arọbh afa okwuma ijobh, ọttara nkwurọ s'anọng ijobh-ijobh. <verse eid="EXO 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 18:22" />Tte bẹ mattọhna aponga p'anọng k'ogbe kpenamkpen. Okenaka, tte bẹ nd-atọka aponga kpenamkpen p'agaang-ọgaangẹ machen-ọ. Tte mazeng mmo attọhna aponga p'karẹ. Eden ch'ọtọhm fọ m'otima obhek-ọ dọ nya, okurọ bẹ́, mm'agbaka mbọhk masi. <verse eid="EXO 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 18:23" />Ó̱de asi minna, Ibinọkpaabyi obira ọnang-ọ ẹfa, kọ makpo ọtọhm mvo asosi, anọng mba maphyir mabira abhana ọttara ottemlebh bẹ́, nkk'idik sabẹ attọhna mawuriji.”<verse eid="EXO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 18:24" />Mosẹs oyonga ọnyẹ kwẹ itọhng, osi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ọtọhn-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 18:25" />Minna kw'Mosẹs otek ajinọng p'makpo ọttọhk osisi ny'Israẹl maphyir. Osi bẹ aso p'nkwurọ s'anọng nnọhna k'nnọhna, ọmaana p'nkwurọ s'anọng arọbh achen achen, ọmaana p'nkwurọ s'anọng arọbh afa okwuma ijobh, ọttara nkwurọ s'anọng ijobh-ijobh <verse eid="EXO 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 18:26" />Anọng mbo mattọhna aponga anang anọng k'ogbe kpenamkpen. Aponga p'agaang-ọgaangẹ, matọka achena Mosẹs. Mbo p'amọm-ọmọm, mazeng mmo attọhna.<verse eid="EXO 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 18:27" />Nya o, Mosẹs od-orik ọnyẹ kwẹ z'eden. Jẹtro o, ọbhana z'ikẹ k'obhon.<verse eid="EXO 18:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EXO 19" />
  <para style="s1">Odik kw'oyinẹ z'egbe ch'Sinai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 19:1" />K'echedenwu ch'ophe kw'ottong attaan, ch'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'abina z'Ijip, ny'ewu ndo wọ kw'mapyirẹ Sinai, z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 19:2" />Ch'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'abina z'Rẹphidim mapyirẹ z'Sinai, z'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ, mabhing ny'ititika kw'egbe ndo.<verse eid="EXO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 19:3" />Mosẹs ovura od-okebha Ibinọkpaabyi. Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oninga z'ogbeso oyer-ẹ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kirẹ idik s'im'ad-agbaak echimma ch'Jekọb, p'ade anọng p'Israẹl ma: <verse eid="EXO 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 19:4" />‘Bọnga oyenẹ nkk'aza ose kw'nsi anọng p'Ijip, mabir aze ose kw'ntọrọ bọnga mkpẹ k'kaam k'ifor, mach'etingẹ etinẹ iva pẹ k'mbubaang. <verse eid="EXO 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 19:5" />Nya o, óde bọnga mm'atima nttem sabọnga maphyir akpobh-m, mabira asok echekẹ chaam, bọnga mm'ade anọng paam p'nsok ettem. Zaabẹ́ iyagbin maphyir ide saam, <verse eid="EXO 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 19:6" />bọnga mm'ade obhon kw'afọhn-nja ọmaana ẹkọma ch'ewur-owur anang-m.’ Ma wọ ode idik s'im'agbaak anang anọng p'Israẹl.”<verse eid="EXO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 19:7" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọsaka ny'egbe ndo, od-oyerẹ adidennọng p'anọng mbo osok ibyi majanẹ, otek bẹ idik s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ ẹfa ọnanga bẹ́, ọgbaak bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 19:8" />Anọng mbo maphyir mapọhna bẹ́, “Mina mm'osi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ọgbaaka.” Minna kw'Mosẹs ọtọk ẹpọhna chabẹ ochena Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 19:9" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam m'nzenga k'ebonọ ch'epyi <char style="it">bẹ́ kaang</char> nkwu nkebh-ọ, mfha óde anọng mbo mabhaang-m ch'im'mgbaak odik mmaan-ọ, mad-achera odik kwọ k'ogbe kpenamkpen.” Mosẹs ọgbaak Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ose kw'anọng mbo mabenẹ.<verse eid="EXO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 19:10" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kpa nnam kebha anọng mbo, asi bẹ masok ifor sabẹ iwur-owur menda ọttara ophyinẹ. Tte magbobhọ ẹfọrakpo pyabẹ ọdọk, <verse eid="EXO 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 19:11" />màdo ifor ny'ewu ch'ettong ittaan, okurọ bẹ́, ny'ewu ndo wọ kw'ikaam Ibinọkpaabyi m'nsaka ny'egbe ch'Sinai, nya ch'anọng maphyir aning. <verse eid="EXO 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 19:12" />Ke enem kọbha egbe ndo, k'ose kw'anọng nna majeka. Tọr bẹ itọhng bẹ́, ‘Màkkerẹ bọnga ifor o, ọnọng oning egbe ndo ọnyọm o, oning igbemmo njo obira otwu o. Kirẹ ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'otwu egbe nda, mm'afhẹ-ẹ ọfhọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 19:13" />M'mbọhk màtima afhọ ọnọng kw'otwu egbe nda. Mm'atọhbh-ẹ ata, wanẹma, mattẹ-ẹ ayuk. Zaabẹ́ ode oyokinọng, obir ode eten, ọttọhk f'mm'atte ọbọhk oruk akpen kode.’ K'ogbe kw'mabhaang ẹmọng ch'enyisa <char style="it">bẹ́ pọọọh</char>, nya kw'mm'akwu anyọma egbe ndo.”<verse eid="EXO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 19:14" />Mosẹs ọsak ny'egbe ndo nya o, od-okebha anọng p'Israẹl, osi bẹ mawur k'ose kw'mm'abe Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika, mabira agbobhọ ẹfọrakpo pyabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 19:15" />Obira oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màdo ifor tik ewu ndo ch'ettong ittaan. Ọnọng oning kwanọng ábẹ̀ oyim.”<verse eid="EXO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 19:16" />Ny'ekpebha ch'ewu ch'ettong ittaan, ebonọ epyi <char style="it">bẹ́ kaang</char>, ẹbhaangkpon ẹman ẹwọr <char style="it">bẹ́ jaar</char>, ẹtta <char style="it">bẹ́ kpurr</char>, enyisa eje k'ẹrọng. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oning ny'ibhinga-byi, nọfọn-ọfọnọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 19:17" />Minna kw'Mosẹs otim anọng mbo eden, mabina z'ibhinga-byi bẹ́, mad-akebha Ibinọkpaabyi. Mapyirẹ ny'igbemmo, mabe nya. <verse eid="EXO 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 19:18" />Wa izizong ibhọrọ egbe ch'Sinai maphyir okurọ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim ekpon ọsaka nya. Izizong njo ivura ẹrọng-ẹrọng mach'izizong s'iyinẹ k'okponkkin. Egbe ndo kibungọ eninga k'ifufọnọ. <verse eid="EXO 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 19:19" />K'ose kw'ẹmọng ch'enyisa ndo egorọ k'ẹrọng, minna kw'Mosẹs ọd-ọgbaak odik, Ibinọkpaabyi otima ẹbhaangkpon ọpọhn-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 19:20" />Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọsak ny'ogbeso kw'Sinai, oyerẹ Mosẹs. Mosẹs ovur okebh-ẹ za. <verse eid="EXO 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 19:21" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kpa nnam zọhng tọr anọng mbo itọhng bẹ́, màning ẹfa atim bẹ́, maze Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mfha anọng saabhada aning ape. <verse eid="EXO 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 19:22" />Ozeng k'afọhn-nja p'mm'anyọma Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, tte mado ifor sabẹ iwur-owur, ini minna óde, kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'nsi bẹ itama.”<verse eid="EXO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 19:23" />Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Ttatta, anọng mbo m'egbe ch'Sinai màkwu e, okurọ bẹ́, atọr mina itọhng bẹ́, ‘Ke enem kọbha egbe ch'Sinai, abira asok-ẹ iwur-owur mach'ibyi s'Ibinọkpaabyi.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 19:24" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Saka, zọhng tọka Aarọn tima vura kebh-m ka. Ṉ́node afọhn-nja, ọttara anọng mboza, tte maning k'ẹfa avur akebha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ka, ọfha oning bẹ itama osi.”<verse eid="EXO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 19:25" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọsak okebha anọng mbo za, ọgbaak bẹ k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ.<verse eid="EXO 19:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EXO 20" />
  <para style="s1">Asana ijobh p'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 5:1-21">Deutẹrọnọmi 5.1-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 20:1" />Minna kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ọgbaakẹ idik nja maphyir, oben bẹ́:<verse eid="EXO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 20:2" />“Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, kw'otim bọnga obina z'Ijip, ọrọbha bọnga z'izek s'ebira.<verse eid="EXO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 20:3" />“M'ọttọhk ọdọk-ọdọk kakpobha kw'ọkpanẹ kaam.<verse eid="EXO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 20:4" />“M'okerim kw'ọttọhk kpenamkpen kasi, ode z'ẹrọng, obir ode m'izek, wanẹma z'asi p'aning z'izek ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 20:5" />M'nso kàraka anang bẹ, m'bẹ kàbira akpobha, okurọ bẹ́, kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, nde Ibinọkpaabyi kw'oyen ottemma. Kaam nd-nnang iva irem k'mpyibha s'ab'otte ọmaana s'ab'ọkka, k'epemaanitor ittaan, ọmaana epemaanitor nna s'anọng p'awun-m. <verse eid="EXO 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 20:6" />Okenaka, ayok p'ayen ọdaakẹ amaan-m, mabir akpobha asana paam, kaam nd-nkọhka ọdaakẹ kwaam nnang epemaanitor k'nnọhna-k'nnọhna<verse eid="EXO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 20:7" />“M'eche ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga kàtima k'elulukiden, okurọ bẹ́, ọnọng kw'otim eche chẹ k'elulukiden, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kẹ mòbina ọnang.<verse eid="EXO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 20:8" />“Màjima Ẹwọhngkwokawu, masok chẹ ẹwur-owur. <verse eid="EXO 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 20:9" />Màsi itọhm sabọnga maphyir k'iwu ichadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 20:10" />Ṉ́nòde ewu ndo ch'ettong ichenọmfa, ẹwọhngkwokawu ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga dọ nya. Ọnọng oning ọtọhm osi ny'ewu ndo, zaabẹ́ ode kọ, obir ode ojinọngnwa kwọ, wanẹma kwanọngnwa kwọ, wanẹma abira pọ k'ejinọng ọttara k'ẹpanọng, wanẹma etirakpo pyọ, wanẹma akikennọng p'arukọ ny'ẹkọma chọ. <verse eid="EXO 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 20:11" />Kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ntim iwu ichadanẹ nsi ẹrọng ọmaana izek, ọttara araangadim, ọmaana ekpo maphyir py'ening ny'ẹtaanga kwabẹ. Otum ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, nkwoka ọwọhng. Ofona nya, kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ndo ewu ndo, nsok chẹ bẹ́, ewur-owur.<verse eid="EXO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 20:12" />“Màkpobha ab'atte, ọttara ab'akka, mfha maruk akpen p'adum-odum ny'izek s'kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'nnang bọnga.<verse eid="EXO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 20:13" />“M'ọnọng kàfhọ.<verse eid="EXO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 20:14" />“M'kwanọng kw'oyok ábẹ̀ kàyima.<verse eid="EXO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 20:15" />“M'orubh kàfhu.<verse eid="EXO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 20:16" />“M'nttẹsẹ kw'oyok kàbe k'ẹfọra-den.<verse eid="EXO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 20:17" />“M'ọsọhm kw'oyok ichen kakkerẹ, ozeng k'kwanọng kwẹ, wanẹma abira pẹ k'ejinọng ọttara k'ẹpanọng, wanẹma etirakpo pyẹ, wanẹma ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'oyen k'akpen.”<verse eid="EXO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 20:18" />K'ogbe kw'anọng p'Israẹl maze ẹbhaangkpon ch'ẹd-ẹmanẹ ẹwọr, mabir abhaanga ẹmọng ch'enyisa, ọttara ose kw'egbe ndo nede izizong-izizong, ojora ọbọka bẹ, mafọnọ <char style="it">bẹ́ tikitikitiki</char>. Ofona nya, mabe z'ororo, <verse eid="EXO 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 20:19" />maben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kọ zeng mmo gbaak odik nang mina, mina mm'oyong-ọ itọhng oyonga. Kàchera bẹ́, Ibinọkpaabyi ozeng mmo ọgbaak odik ọnang mina, mfha moning ope.”<verse eid="EXO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 20:20" />Mosẹs ọpọhna bẹ bẹ́, “Oning bọnga ojor. Ibinọkpaabyi okenka okwu bẹ́, oyoma bọnga, mfha ojora f'Ibinọkpaabyi osi bọnga mabhum mpyibha osisi.”<verse eid="EXO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 20:21" />Anọng mbo mabe z'ororo mach'mabe nya. Mosẹs kẹ-kẹ ozenga ọnyọma orungibanga nwo kw'Ibinọkpaabyi oning.<verse eid="EXO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asana p'amaan akpata ọmaana ija-byi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 20:22" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Bọnga oyenẹ nkk'aza bẹ́, kaam nning z'ẹrọng mgbaak odik nnang bọnga. <verse eid="EXO 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 20:23" />M'kaam kakpobha ọmaana akpata p'matim silva, wanẹma gol, asi.<verse eid="EXO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 20:24" />“ ‘Bọnga mm'asi ija-byi s'ididọhbh manang-m. Nya kw'mafọhnọ nja sabọnga anang-m: nja s'ẹkwọmọ, ọmaana s'eforgbaka, ozeng k'arọkimaan, ọmaana avugboka, ttara adamogbodo. Ibyi kpenamkpen s'nsi bẹ́, anọng akpobha eche chaam, kaam m'nsaka, nkwu nsi bọnga ittabọhng nya. <verse eid="EXO 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 20:25" />Ó̱de matim ata asi ija-byi saam, m'ata p'madok-odoka katima, okurọ bẹ́, óde matim ata p'madok-odoka, mm'akibhẹ sẹ okibhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 20:26" />M'abhikakpa k'ija-byi saam kasi, mfha maning erinikwum chabọnga k'iyaan abharẹ.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 20:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EXO 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 21:1" />“Ma wọ ode apaanga p'm'anang anọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaanga p'amaan abira p'aHiburu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="DEU 15:12-18">Deutẹrọnọmi 15.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 21:2" />“Ó̱de adebh obira kw'ofon Israẹl, kẹ m'osi ọtọhm ọmaan-ọ k'icho ichadanẹ. Ópyirẹ icho ichenọmfa, kọ m'attẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ọbhana, ọttọhk kpenamkpen mọnang. <verse eid="EXO 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 21:3" />Ó̱de obira nwo okwu kẹ-kẹ, ttẹ-ẹ ọbọhk ofona kẹ-kẹ. Okenaka, óde otim kwanọng kwẹ okwu, tte kwanọng nwo otor-ẹ mafona. <verse eid="EXO 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 21:4" />Ó̱de otte kw'osi ọtọhm ọmaana ọnang-ẹ kwanọng bẹ́, ọba, óde ọmaan-ẹ ajinọngva, wanẹma, panọngva, kwanọng nwo ọttara iva pẹ, mm'ade p'atte nwo kw'odebh obira nwo, ojinọng kẹ-kẹ wọ im'ọsa k'ebira.<verse eid="EXO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 21:5" />“Okenaka, óde obira nwo oben bẹ́, ‘Atte kwaam, ọmaana kwanọng kwaam, ọttara iva paam madaak-m ọkpan, kinnorọ bẹ́, nsa k'ebira.’ <verse eid="EXO 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 21:6" />Ny'ogbese nwo, otte kwẹ m'otim-ẹ okebha akpaar-aponga za, obe ny'ọmma, wanẹma ny'ẹmmakwukchi, otima edum ọdwẹ-ẹ itọhng. Íkk'ọsa minna, kẹ m'ode obira kwẹ ttattampe.<verse eid="EXO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 21:7" />“Ó̱de ọnọng okpe ominanwa kwẹ ọnang k'ebira, kẹ ominanwa nwo k'ebira mọ̀sa, k'ose kw'ode ọmaana ajinọngva. <verse eid="EXO 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 21:8" />Ó̱de éttem ina otte nwo elebhẹ ọmaana obirakwanọng nwo kw'odebhẹ, m'ọttẹ-ẹ ọbọhk mabhek-ẹ. Otte nwo ẹfa koyen ch'im'ọkpẹ-ẹ ọnang okikennọng okurọ ch'ikk'echekẹ ch'mayen ọvọhka. <verse eid="EXO 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 21:9" />Okenaka, óde odebh obirakwanọng nwo osok ojinọngnwa kwẹ bẹ́, ọba, kẹ otte nwo m'ọtọk-ẹ mach'nnwa kwẹ kw'obhon-obhon. <verse eid="EXO 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 21:10" />Ó̱de ọtọk kwanọng ọdọk-ọdọk, kẹ m'ochina ororo okkerẹ ocheden-kwanọng, ọnang-ẹ ọchattọhk ọmaana ẹfọrakpo, obir od-otor-ẹ eyima. <verse eid="EXO 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 21:11" />Ó̱de ina kẹ ekpo mbyoma ẹttaan ọnangẹ, kwanọng nwo m'ọsa k'ebira, okpuka motima obhek ifor sẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Apaanga p'amaan k'ekpo omumuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 21:12" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ottem oyok ọttọhk f'ochin k'obo, kẹ mm'abira afhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 21:13" />Okenaka, óde ina odik nwo z'ettem ọkamẹ, pira oyin k'ose kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ophyikẹ, kẹ m'ọrọbh ochina z'ibyi s'im'nteka nnang-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 21:14" />Okenaka, óde ọnọng ọbọk oyok ọfhọ k'ẹyaaka, mm'atima ọnọng nwo abina ny'ija-byi saam, màfhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 21:15" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'obin otte ọttọhk, obir ode ọkka, mm'afhọ ọnọng nwo.<verse eid="EXO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 21:16" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'offu oyokinọng, ode bẹ́, kk'ẹ ọkpa, obira ode bẹ́, otim oning-ẹ ny'mbọhk, mm'afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 21:17" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ọnang otte ẹmma, obir ode ọkka, mm'afhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 21:18" />“Ó̱de anọng asi ẹtta, pira oyok wanẹ ọtọhbh oyok ẹta, wanẹma, ottem-ẹ ẹbọhkduk, óde oyok ina ope, okenaka oyima ọkọhmaana, <verse eid="EXO 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 21:19" />óde obin, otima ochikwura kwẹ ozenga oyin k'iyaan, oyok kw'ottem oyok ọttọhk, k'irem kọbaan. M'okenaka otuk ọnang oyok k'ogbe kwẹ kw'okibhẹ, obir okkerẹ oyok maa, obina k'ọkọhmaana mvo.<verse eid="EXO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 21:20" />“Ó̱de ọnọng otim echi ottema obira kwẹ kw'ejinọng, wanẹma, oyok kw'kwanọng maa, ọpẹ-ẹ ny'mbọhk, mm'anang ọnọng nwo irem. <verse eid="EXO 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 21:21" />Okenaka, óde ojek ewu madanẹ, wanẹma, iwu ifa, ọttọhk obira nwo kosi, m'kẹ irem mànang, ch'ode bẹ́, akpuka pẹ p'otim odebh obira nwo.<verse eid="EXO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 21:22" />“Ó̱de anọng asi erima, mattema kwanọng kw'otim ibhọr ọttọhk, ibhọr njo iyin, okenaka, m'kẹ ọttọhk kamum, ọnọng nwo kw'ọjẹ odik nwo, m'otuk ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'odim kwẹ ọkpaar bẹ otuk, esobh ebira echera ẹmaan-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 21:23" />Okenaka, óde mamum-ẹ ọttọhk fiden, mm'atima akpen atera akpen. <verse eid="EXO 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 21:24" />Ó̱de ọnọng odwu oyok ichen, mm'abira adwu kẹ ichen; ọ́rọbh-ẹ ẹsa, mm'abira arọbha kẹ ẹsa; ọ́kpaar-ẹ ọbọhk, mm'abira akpaara kẹ ọbọhk; ọ́phyak-ẹ obho, mm'abira aphyakẹ kẹ obho; <verse eid="EXO 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 21:25" />ọ́kwọm-ẹ ekpon, mm'abira akwọmọ kẹ ekpon; ómum-ẹ ọttọhk, mm'abira amuma kẹ ọttọhk; ọ́sẹ-ẹ oborọ, mm'abira asi kẹ oborọ.<verse eid="EXO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 21:26" />“Ó̱de ọnọng ottem obira kwẹ ọttọhk k'ichen, okibh-ẹ ichen, zaabẹ́ obira nwo ode ojinọng, wanẹma, kwanọng, oyen-obira nwo m'otte obira nwo ọbọhk ọbhana k'ajaaka okurọ ichen njo. <verse eid="EXO 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 21:27" />Ó̱de oyen-obira ọrọbh obira kwẹ ẹsa, zaabẹ́ obira nwo ode ojinọng, wanẹma, kwanọng, oyen-obira nwo m'otte obira nwo ọbọhk ọbhana k'ajaaka okurọ ẹsa ndo.<verse eid="EXO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 21:28" />“Ó̱de ọbhaamdim okwumọ ọnọng abhik maa ope, zaabẹ́ ọnọng nwo ode kwanọng, wanẹma, ojinọng, mm'atọhbh ọbhaamdim nwo ata maa ope. Ọnọng eten ch'ọbhaamdim nwo mòchi. Oyen-ọbhaamdim nwo k'otuka mòbir oninga. <verse eid="EXO 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 21:29" />Okenaka, óde ọbhaamdim nwo ọd-ọtọma za okwum anọng abhik, pira matek oyenẹ, oyenẹ nwo, kẹ kọbọk ọgbana. Ó̱de okwumọ ọnọng abhik, ọnọng nwo okwu ope, mm'atọhbh ọbhaamdim nwo ata maa, ope, m'abir afhọ oyen-ọbhaamdim nwo. <verse eid="EXO 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 21:30" />Okenaka, óde manang-ẹ otuka, kẹ m'ọnang ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'makpaar anang-ẹ, otima obhek eso chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 21:31" />Ọpaanga nwa obir ọbaabha ọbhaamdim kw'okwumọ ojinọngnwa, wanẹma, kwanọngnwa abhik. <verse eid="EXO 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 21:32" />Ó̱de ọbhaamdim okwumọ obira abhik, ode ojinọng, wanẹma, kwanọng, oyen-ọbhaamdim nwo m'otuk ashẹkẹl ẹrọbh okwuma ijobh p'silva ọnang otte kw'obira nwo. Mm'abira atọhbh ọbhaamdim nwo ata maa, ope.<verse eid="EXO 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 21:33" />“Ó̱de ọnọng owong epe otte eje, wanẹma, otum epe, kobubh, ọbhaamdim, wanẹma, ẹnyanya ekwu etto nya, <verse eid="EXO 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 21:34" />oyen-epe ndo m'otuk ọnang oyen-ẹbhaam ndo. Ọbhaambukọ nwo m'ode kw'oyen-epe.<verse eid="EXO 21:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 21:35" />“Ó̱de ọbhaamdim kw'ọnọng omum ẹbhaam ch'ọnọng ọdọk-ọdọk ọttọhk maa, epe. Nnam njo mfa m'ikpe ẹbhaam ndo ch'ening akpen, makebh akpuka mbo, pira makebh ọbhaambukọ nwo mbengana. <verse eid="EXO 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 21:36" />Okenaka, óde ọ́nọng okkikken ozonga bẹ́, minna kw'ẹbhaam ndo ed-ekwum ayok abhik, oyenẹ okkerẹ nya ẹbhaam ndo kọgban, oyenẹ nwo m'otima ẹbhaam otuk ẹbhaam ọnang oyok. Ẹbhaam ndo ch'epe-ope m'ede chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 21:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EXO 22" />
  <para style="s">Asana p'amaan k'oyena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 22:1" />“Ó̱de ọnọng offu ẹbhaam, wanẹma, ọrọkimaan, ọtọka ọfhọ, obir ode bẹ́, okpe-okpe, kẹ m'otuk abhaam achen k'ẹbhaam madanẹ, obir otuk arọkimaan anna k'ọrọkimaan mawanẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 22:2" />“Ó̱de mabọk orurubha ch'od-offu orubh k'erungọ, mattem-ẹ maa ope, ọnọng nwo kw'ọfhẹ-ẹ, k'ọsana kotto. <verse eid="EXO 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 22:3" />Okenaka, óde ọnọng ọfhẹ-ẹ k'ogbe kw'echekira ikk'eyina, nya kw'ọnọng kw'ọfhẹ-ẹ ikk'ọtta k'ọsana kw'inọng-fhufha.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:3">“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'offu orubh, m'otutuk. Ó̱de ina ọttọhk oyen, màkpẹ-ẹ tima tera ọttọhk mvo f'ofu. <verse eid="EXO 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 22:4" />Ó̱de eten ch'offu etim ening akpen ny'ikẹ k'mbọhk, zaabẹ́ ode ẹbhaam o, ode ẹnyanya o, obir ode ọrọkimaan o, m'otuk orubh mvo igbedim ifa.<verse eid="EXO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 22:5" />“Ó̱de ọnọng otte etirakpo pyẹ ọbọhk bẹ́, echi azizaarẹ z'owonọ kwẹ, pira otte pyẹ ọbọhk ettena, ed-echi ekpo k'owonọ kw'ọnọng ọdọk-ọdọk, oyen-etirakpo mbyo m'otima ekpo ọkkọkka py'owonọ kwẹ, wanẹma, owonọ kwẹ kw'grep, otera ekpo mbyo.<verse eid="EXO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 22:6" />“Ó̱de ọnọng oke ekpon z'ikẹ k'owonọ, ekpon ndo ẹnyaamẹ ẹd-ẹkwọmọ ekpo py'etim ebe-obe, wanẹma, ekpo py'nkk'apha matobha, wanẹma, owonọ kibungọ, ọnọng kw'oke ekpon ndo k'ẹtọma, m'otera ekpo mbyo py'ẹkwọm-ọkwọmọ.<verse eid="EXO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 22:7" />“Ó̱de ọnọng ọnang oyok asilva bẹ́, oye, obir ode ekpo mbyoka, pira makwu afu ekpo mbyo ny'ọsọhm kw'ọnọng nwo, óde m'abọk orurubha nwo, kẹ m'otuk ekpo mbyo igbedim ifa. <verse eid="EXO 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 22:8" />Okenaka, óde nna orurubha nwo abọk, kẹ oyen-ọsọhm, m'od-okkona ifor sẹ z'ititika s'akpaar-aponga. Akpaar-aponga m'adọn odik nwo azonga, óde oyen-ọsọhm nwo ikk'ekpo py'oyok ọtọka osok mach'ekpo pyẹ. <verse eid="EXO 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 22:9" />K'aponga maphyir p'amaan bẹ́, ọnọng offu ẹbhaam, wanẹma ẹnyanya, wanẹma ọrọkimaan, wanẹma ọfọrattọhk, wanẹma ekpo mbyoza py'ọnọng oyinẹ oben bẹ́, ‘Faam vọ,’ bẹ nnam njo mfa, mm'atima odik nwo akebha akpaar-aponga. Oyok kw'aponga apyibh-ẹ, m'otuk ọnang oyok igbedim ifa.<verse eid="EXO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 22:10" />“Ó̱de ọnọng otirẹ oyok ẹnyanya, wanẹma, ẹbhaam, wanẹma, ọrọkimaan, obir ode otirattọhk kpenamkpen, óde ope, wanẹma, mamum-ẹ ọttọhk ch'ọnọng ina otum oke, <verse eid="EXO 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 22:11" />bẹ nnam njo mfa, mm'achekẹ k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, ọnọng kw'otwu ọttọhk f'oyok ọbọhk kode. Oyen-ọttọhk mvo m'ochera ọmaana echekẹ ndo. Ọnọng kw'im'otuk ọnang oyok kode. <verse eid="EXO 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 22:12" />Okenaka, óde ọnọng offu otirattọhk mvo z'mbọhk s'ikẹ kw'matirẹ, kẹ m'otuk ọnang oyenẹ. <verse eid="EXO 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 22:13" />Ó̱de ẹgbaten ch'ẹkkaam-ọkkaam ẹyaakẹ eten ndo k'akpa-k'akpa, kẹ kw'matirẹ eten ndo m'otima ayaara p'eten ndo okwu ọkọhka. Kẹ k'otuka kw'eten ndo moninga.<verse eid="EXO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 22:14" />“Ó̱de ọnọng ọyaamẹ otirattọhk f'oyok, ọttọhk omum-ẹ, obir ode bẹ́, ope-ope k'ogbe kw'oyenẹ ina ode, kẹ nwo kw'ọyaamẹ otirattọhk mvo, m'otuk ọttọhk f'ode mbengana mach'mvo f'okibh-okibhẹ. <verse eid="EXO 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 22:15" />Okenaka, óde oyenẹ nwo oning k'eninga ch'odik nwo oyinẹ, oyok kw'ọyaamẹ otirattọhk mvo, ọttọhk mòtuk k'ose kw'otirattọhk mvo ope akpuka. Ó̱de oyok kw'ọyaamẹ otirattọhk mvo k'akpuka ikk'oyenẹ akpuka ọnanga, akpuka mbo bọ mmin'abe k'eso ch'eten ndo ch'ikk'ẹ edima.<verse eid="EXO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asana p'amaan oruk kw'ayokinọng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 22:16" />“Ó̱de ojinọng ọdaabh ominanwa kw'ina ojinọng otima ozonga maa, oyim-ẹ ábẹ̀, ch'ina kẹ omina ọrọkọ, kẹ m'ọnang abakpuka k'ikẹ k'eso, ọtọk-ẹ k'ọbada. <verse eid="EXO 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 22:17" />Ó̱de otte kw'ominanwa nwo obhumọ ọbada nwo obhum, ojinọng nwo m'ọnang abakpuka mbengana k'ose kw'mad-anang k'ominanwa kw'nna ntaak atima aphaaka.<verse eid="EXO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 22:18" />“M'kwanọng kw'osi ẹbọhk ọbọhk kàtte bẹ́, oruk akpen.<verse eid="EXO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 22:19" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oyim eten ábẹ̀, ọbaan bẹ́, mafhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 22:20" />“Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ọgbaarẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọjẹ, otera ọfọhnọ ẹja ọnang ọka, ọbaan bẹ́, mafhẹ-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 22:21" />“M'okikennọng itama kàsi, m'kẹ kabir attukọ, okurọ bẹ́, wa bọnga made akikennọng z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 22:22" />“M'opokwa kàttukọ. M'offunwa kàbira attukọ. <verse eid="EXO 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 22:23" />Ó̱de m'asi bẹ tama-tama, pira bẹ mabhom akpẹk-m, kaam m'mbhaanga ẹmọng chabẹ k'odik ọkkọkka. <verse eid="EXO 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 22:24" />Ottempyibha kwaam m'ọphyabha, kaam m'ntima ọkkangkkang mfhọ bọnga. Panọng pabọnga m'ade apokwa, iva pabọnga abir ade affuva.<verse eid="EXO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 22:25" />“Ó̱de abhor ogbugbora wanẹ kwaam kw'orukọ ọmaan-ọ akpuka, kẹ kàtima azenga ẹphya, inana ny'akpuka mbo p'abhor-ẹ kabir atọka. <verse eid="EXO 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 22:26" />Ó̱de atọk ibara s'oyok k'nwọhngọ s'osi, rik jẹ pira opyirẹ k'ẹsọhka, <verse eid="EXO 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 22:27" />okurọ bẹ́, ibara bung-bungọ s'oyen jọ nya. Ó̱de ina arikẹ, mbọng f'im'obubha otima oyima? Ó̱de obhomọ oyer-m, kaam m'mmaanga ẹmọng chẹ, okurọ bẹ́, kaam nyen ikwosisi.<verse eid="EXO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 22:28" />“M'eche ch'Ibinọkpaabyi kàkibhẹ. M'ọnọng kw'ọbaabh bọnga ẹmma kàbir anang.<verse eid="EXO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 22:29" />“M'kaam nnanga ọkkọkka s'ibin z'abọnga k'iwonọ karam, ozeng k'atuk p'achiduk p'abira abina nya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 22:29">“Bọnga mm'atte achedenva pabọnga k'ejinọng ọbọhk, manang-m.<verse eid="EXO 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 22:30" />“Minna kw'mm'abir asi amaana abhaam, ọmaana arọkimaan pabọnga. Tte iva p'nten njo ininga imaana ab'ọkka k'iwu ichenọmfa. Ó̱ttong iwu ochenọnttaan, màtọka jẹ nang-m.<verse eid="EXO 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 22:31" />“Bọnga mm'ade anọng paam p'awur-owur. Ó̱de ẹgbaten ch'ẹkkaam-ọkkaam ẹyaakẹ eten k'akpa-k'akpa, m'eten ndo kàchi. Màtọka nang mfa.<verse eid="EXO 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EXO 23" />
  <para style="s1">Asana p'epongakpaara ch'etor-otor ọmaana p'ikwosisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 23:1" />“Idik s'ide afọra kàkpaanga agbaak. Obyibyanọng kàkkaana abẹ-ẹ nttẹsẹ k'ẹfọraden.<verse eid="EXO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 23:2" />“Ọsaabh kàtor masi itama. Ó̱de abe nttẹsẹ z'esobh, afọra kàgbaak ator ọsaabh atima akibhẹ aponga. <verse eid="EXO 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 23:3" />Ogbugbora k'odik katorọ z'esobh k'ẹfọraden.<verse eid="EXO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 23:4" />“Ó̱de akebh adamogbodo, obir ode ẹnyanya ch'ọwawunanọng kwọ ch'etten-ottena, bọka chena oyenẹ. <verse eid="EXO 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 23:5" />Ó̱de aze ẹnyanya ch'ọwawunanọng kwọ ch'ẹtọhka chẹ etto ẹkpẹk-ẹ, kkaan-ẹ, atin-ẹ. Ẹnyanya ndo nya kàfona arik.<verse eid="EXO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 23:6" />“M'agbugbora pabọnga aponga p'ator-otor karam k'ogbe kw'mabe esobh. <verse eid="EXO 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 23:7" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen odik kàbọhma. Ọnọng kw'mbọhk sẹ iwur-owur, ọttara nwo kw'od-osi idik s'itor-otor, kàfhọ, kirẹ kaam ọnọng kw'opinẹ ny'eden ndo mìmbina nnang.<verse eid="EXO 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 23:8" />“Kọ ngwu kàchi, okurọ bẹ́, ngwu ọd-ọkpa ọnọng ichen, obir ọwọhkọ ọnọng kw'otor-otor ọbhakẹ ẹdaak.<verse eid="EXO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 23:9" />“Bọnga m'okikennọng irem kànang. Bọnga nkk'azonga ose kw'ekkikken ede k'ogbe kw'uwa maning ekkikken z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asana p'Ẹwọhngkwokagbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 23:10" />“K'icho ichadanẹ, bọnga mm'atubh iwonọ, mabira asi ipha s'ekpo mbyo. <verse eid="EXO 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 23:11" />Okenaka, ny'icho s'ittong ichenọmfa, mm'asok izek njo ikwur ẹgba. M'ọttọhk nya kabir asi, mfha agbugbora p'arukọ amaana bọnga mayena ọchattọhk nya, nten s'ẹgba ibir iyena ọchattọhk ọdọk.<verse eid="EXO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 23:12" />“K'iwu ichadanẹ jọ s'mm'asi itọhm sabọnga. Ó̱ttong iwu ichenọmfa, m'ọtọhm kàsi, mfha adamogbodo ọmaana nnyanya sabọnga, iyena ẹwọhngkwoka, abira p'mamaanẹ ny'abọnga k'ẹsọhmbhọr ọmaana akikennọng, mabir anemẹ ifor.<verse eid="EXO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 23:13" />“Màtọka ogbe si idik nja maphyir s'ikk'bọnga mgbaaka ma. M'eche ch'ọka kpenamkpen kàyerẹ, tte ọnọng oning eche ch'ọka ny'ẹmma chabọnga ọbhaang.<verse eid="EXO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Adidaamakira attaan p'icho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 23:14" />“K'icho kpenamkpen, bọnga mmàd-asi odidaama igbedim ittaan anang-m.<verse eid="EXO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 23:15" />“Màsi Odidaama kw'Brẹd kw'nna yist ake<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lẹvitikus 23.5-8</ref></char></note>. K'iwu ichenọmfa, màchi brẹd kw'nna yist ake, k'ose kw'mbenẹ bọnga. Màsi odidaama nwa k'ogbe kwẹ, ny'ophe kw'Abib, kirẹ ny'ophe nwo wọ kw'bọnga mabin z'Ijip.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:15">“Ọnọng oning abọhk-kpakpa otim okwu obe-m k'ititika.<verse eid="EXO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 23:16" />“Màsi Odidaama kw'Ipha s'acheden-chiduk py'ekpo py'matubhọ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:16">“K'ẹkpọka ch'icho, k'ogbe kw'nkk'ipha maphyir asa, màsi Odidaama kw'Ipha Otitobha.<verse eid="EXO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 23:17" />“K'igbedim ittaaan k'icho, ajinọng pọ maphyir mm'ad-akwu abe k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 23:18" />“M'izẹ s'matim afọhnọ ẹja anang-m kàgbaka ọmaana ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'make yist.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:18">“M'iyaak s'nnanga s'edidaamawu chaam kàbir asok maa, opyirẹ k'ekpebha.<verse eid="EXO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 23:19" />“Achiduk p'ajibh ọtam p'machi eden apha ny'abọnga k'izek, bẹ p'mm'atima akwu z'ọsọhm kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 23:19">“M'ovunwa k'abasi p'ọkka kawọhn.<verse eid="EXO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ozeng-eden kw'Ibinọkpaabyi m'ochi bọnga eden</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 23:20" />“Kirẹ e, kaam m'ntọhm ozeng-eden kwaam ochi bọnga eden, ọfha okkerẹ bọnga ch'mazenga ny'eden maa, mapyirẹ z'ibyi s'ikk'nda. <verse eid="EXO 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 23:21" />Màyong-ẹ itọhng, màbhaanga odik kw'ọgbaakẹ. M'kẹ odik kàkaanga; kirẹ, bọnga mòbina ọnang ny'edikkaanga chabọnga, okurọ bẹ́, eche chaam ening ẹmaan-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 23:22" />Ó̱de mayong-ẹ itọhng mawuriji k'odik kw'ọgbaakẹ, mabir asi okpenamkpen f'mbenẹ, kaam m'nde ọwawunanọng kw'awawunanọng pabọnga; anọng p'ake bọnga ẹkọhr, m'nke bẹ ẹkọhr. <verse eid="EXO 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 23:23" />Ozeng-eden kwaam m'ochi bọnga eden, otima bọnga ozeng z'izek s'anọng p'Amọr, ọmaana s'anọng p'Het, ọmaana s'anọng p'Periz, ọmaana s'anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana s'anọng p'Hiv, ọttara s'anọng p'Jebus. Kaam m'ndimẹ nkọma njo maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 23:24" />M'eso kàraka akpobha aka pabẹ. M'osisi kwabẹ kàbira ator. Màvọhkọ bẹ maphyir, màbir avọhkọ ata p'aka mbo <char style="it">ma tukutuku</char>. <verse eid="EXO 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 23:25" />Màkpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga, ọfha odo ọchattọhk ọmaana asi pabọnga. Kaam m'nrọbha ọkọhmaana ny'abọnga k'ikpakaana mbharẹ, <verse eid="EXO 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 23:26" />ibhọr kwanọng miyin, ọnọng mòbir ọkpaana. Kaam m'nnang bọnga akpen p'adum-odum.<verse eid="EXO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 23:27" />“Kaam m'ntọhm ojora faam fiden ochi bọnga eden. Ẹkọma kpenamkpen ch'mm'akebha, kaam m'nke chẹ k'damadama. Kaam m'nsi awawunanọng pabọnga maphyir makpa nnam arọbh. <verse eid="EXO 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 23:28" />Kaam m'ntọhm abhonso machi bọnga eden mad-akwubh anọng p'Hiv ọmaana anọng p'Kenaan, ọttara anọng p'Het bẹ́, mabina arik bọnga eden. <verse eid="EXO 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 23:29" />Okenaka, kaam icho mawanẹ mìntima nkwubh bẹ, ọfha izek njo ining ẹgba ikwurọ, mgbaten ining ibira isaabh ina bọnga ẹfa. <verse eid="EXO 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 23:30" />Kaam m'nkwubh bẹ <char style="it">ma kẹrẹm-kẹrẹm</char> maa, ọsaabh fabọnga opyirẹ k'ose kw'mm'atọka izek njo.<verse eid="EXO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 23:31" />“Kaam m'nke enem chabọnga, tọma z'Ẹraanga-kora maa, pyirẹ z'Ọraanga kw'Meditereniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.31 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ọraanga kw'Meditereniya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mabira ayerẹ ọraanga nwa bẹ́, Ọraanga kw'Philistiya.</char></note>, mbir tọma ny'ibyi s'anọng nna arukọ maa, mpyirẹ z'ọraanga kw'Yuphrates. Kaam m'nke anọng mbo p'arukọ ny'izek njo k'abọnga k'mbọhk, mabir akwubh bẹ kibungọ-kibungọ. <verse eid="EXO 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 23:32" />M'echekẹ kàsi amaana bẹ, ọttara aka pabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 23:33" />M'bẹ ọbọhk katte maruk ny'abọnga k'izek, kirẹ bẹ mm'asi bọnga makpobha aka pabẹ, ofona nya, mapinẹ amaan-m.”<verse eid="EXO 23:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EXO 24" />
  <para style="s1">Echera ch'echekẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 24:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tima Aarọn, ọmaana Nadab, ọmaana Abihu, ọttara asonọng arọbh attaan okwuma ijobh p'Israẹl, vura kebh-m ka. Bọnga màninga z'ororo kpobh-m. <verse eid="EXO 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 24:2" />Mosẹs kẹ-kẹ wọ im'ọnyọma Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi; ayok mboza aning Ibinọkpaabyi anyọm. Anọng mboza maning-ẹ abir ator mavura.”<verse eid="EXO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 24:3" />Mosẹs okwu otek anọng p'Israẹl idik njo maphyir, obira otek bẹ apaanga p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Idik njo igba bẹ maphyir ẹmma, maben bẹ́, “Mina mm'osi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ.” <verse eid="EXO 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 24:4" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọkkẹr odik kpenamkpen kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 24:4">Ewu esobh nya, k'ekpikpebha, obina od-osi ija-byi ny'igbemmo, obira omin ata ijobh kkamfa, p'ater mfonamma ijobh kkamfa s'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 24:5" />Nya o, ọtọhm adikkobhva p'Israẹl bẹ́, matima abhaamva afọhnọ nja s'ẹkwọmọ, ọttara nnanga s'ẹgbaka manang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 24:6" />Mosẹs ọtọka ẹzẹkwum oke k'agbangbang, obira ọtọka ekwum ndoza ọchakẹ ny'ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 24:7" />Pira nọtọk Nnwẹr kw'Echekẹ, oyerẹ k'ẹrọng ọnang anọng p'Israẹl. Bẹ maphyir mapọhna bẹ́, “Mina mm'okpobha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, mm'obir osi okpenamkpen f'obenẹ mina.”<verse eid="EXO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 24:8" />Pira Mosẹs ọtọka izẹ njo s'agbangbang ọchakẹ anọng mbo, oben bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode izẹ s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otim osi echekẹ ọnang bọnga, otor m'igbaakadik nja maphyir.”<verse eid="EXO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 24:9" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn, ọmaana Nadab, ọmaana Abihu, ọttara asonọng mbo arọbh attaan okwuma ijobh p'Israẹl, mavura z'egbe, <verse eid="EXO 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 24:10" />mad-aze Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl. Ny'izek-izek kw'mmokpatọkọ sẹ, ode mach'obhukakpa kw'matim ata p'saphira asi, ọttaanẹ mach'ọrọngkpakpa ọyenẹ. <verse eid="EXO 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 24:11" />Asonọng mbo p'Israẹl maze Ibinọkpaabyi k'ichen, machi ọttọhk, mabira agwo. Okenaka, Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ ọttọhk kosi.<verse eid="EXO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 24:12" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Vura kebh-m k'ogbeso aninga amaan-m. Kaam m'nnang-ọ ata p'ikk'apaanga ọttara asana nkkẹra p'm'akpebhẹ bẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 24:13" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọttara Joshua kw'ode otumọ kwẹ, mado ifor. Mosẹs ovura z'egbe ch'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 24:14" />Oben asonọng p'anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Bọnga màninga ma tik mina maa, m'ọkpa nnam. Aarọn ọmaana Hur maning ma amaana bọnga. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oyen odik, tte otima okebha bẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 24:15" />K'ose kw'Mosẹs ovur ny'egbe ndo, ebonọ ebubha nya <char style="it">bẹ́ buubh</char> <verse eid="EXO 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 24:16" />abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mabir asaka ny'egbe ch'Sinai. Ebonọ ndo ebubha ny'egbe ndo k'iwu ichadanẹ. Ttong iwu ichenọmfa, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oyerẹ Mosẹs ny'ebonọ ndo ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 24:17" />Abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi z'ogbeso nwo, makerẹ anọng p'Israẹl mach'ekpon ch'ẹd-ẹkwọmọ ọttọhk. <verse eid="EXO 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 24:18" />Minna kw'Mosẹs odimẹ ny'ebonọ ndo, ovura od-oninga ny'ogbeso nwo k'iyawu arọbh afa, ọmaana irungiwu arọbh afa.<verse eid="EXO 24:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EXO 25" />
  <para style="s1">Nnanga s'anọng anangẹ k'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi osisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 25:1" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 25:2" />“Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ọnọng-ọnọng ochen-m ẹnanga. Kọ zeng mmo tọka ẹnanga z'ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ofon-ẹ z'ettem bẹ́, ọnang-m. <verse eid="EXO 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 25:3" />Nnanga s'im'atọka z'abẹ k'mbọhk ide gol, ọmaana silva, ọttara opo, <verse eid="EXO 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 25:4" />ọmaana ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọmaana ibara ọkkọkka, ọmaana avu-phyabha, <verse eid="EXO 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 25:5" />ọmaana ntenkpa s'arọkimaandim s'mafok asikora, ọmaana ntenkpa ọkkọkka s'ichọr-ọchọrọ, ọttara agbaaka p'akasiya, <verse eid="EXO 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 25:6" />ọmaana ana p'oliv p'ekpon oyiyenẹ, ọmaana ekpo py'mad-atima asi ana p'mad-abyenga anọng k'eso, ọmaana insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 25:7" />ọmaana ata p'oniks, ọmaana ata ọkkọkka mboza p'im'ẹgbana <char style="w" lemma="ẹphọd">k'ẹphọd</char>†, ọttara k'ibara s'ittemmọma s'ọfọhn-nja.<verse eid="EXO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 25:8" />“Tte masi iruk-byi s'iwur-owur anang-m, ọfha nruk mmaana bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 25:9" />Tte masi iruk-byi nja, madoka sẹ mbengana k'ose kw'im'nkọhk-ọ.<verse eid="EXO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 25:10" />“Tte matima agbaaka p'akasiya masi ẹkkọhbhọ ch'mm'ayoma adum pẹ ntọkọ nttaan ọmaana akaana osowanẹ, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan, agoriji pẹ m'ade ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 25:11" />Màtima gol ọkkọkka bhọrọ ẹkkọhbhọ ndo maphyir z'ẹtaanga, ọttara k'iyaan, màbir atima gol adoka jẹ akọbha. <verse eid="EXO 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 25:12" />Màtima gol rabha aringẹ anna, make ny'mmo sẹ nna. Aringẹ afa maninga k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ, mboza afa maninga z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 25:13" />Màtima nchi s'akasiya si achiva p'adum-odum, matima gol abhọrọ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 25:14" />Màyika nchi njo ny'aringẹ p'abem p'ẹkkọhbhọ ndo, ọfha mad-atima atinẹ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 25:15" />Achiva mbo p'adum-odum m'ayika ny'aringẹ p'ẹkkọhbhọ ndo mach'mayik nya, mmàrọbha. <verse eid="EXO 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 25:16" />Ó̱de ikk'asa minna, tọka ata p'apaanga p'im'nnang-ọ, yika ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ndo ch'Echekẹ.<verse eid="EXO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 25:17" />“Màtima gol ọkkọkka rabha ẹkkọhbhọkpa ch'efokọ. Adum pẹ m'ade ntọkọ nttaan ọmaana akaana osowanẹ, ẹkpa chẹ m'ede ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 25:18" />Màbira tima gol kw'nkk'aduka si acherubim afa, mammin ny'aso p'ẹkkọbhọkpa ndo. <verse eid="EXO 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 25:19" />Cherub wanẹ m'oninga k'eso danẹ, nwoza oninga z'eso ndoza. Màsi acherubim mbo gbaka ny'ẹkkọhbhọkpa ndo, ny'aso mbo afa. <verse eid="EXO 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 25:20" />Mbubaang s'acherubim mbo m'imaama ichina ẹrọng-ẹrọng, ibubha ẹkkọhbhọkpa ndo ch'efokọ. Acherubim mbo maninga akkerẹ ayok ititika, marọn ny'ẹkkọhbhọkpa ndo. <verse eid="EXO 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 25:21" />Màtọka ẹkkọhbhọkpa ndo nana ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, màbir atọka atakpa p'apaanga p'm'nnang bọnga, mayika ny'ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 25:22" />Ny'ẹrọng kw'ọkpa nwo, ny'njeka kw'acherubim mbo afa p'abubh Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, nya wọ kw'im'nkebh-ọ, nnang-ọ asana paam maphyir anang anọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ose kw'mm'asi okpokkoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 25:23" />“Màtima echi ch'akasiya si okpokkoro. Adum pẹ m'ade ntọkọ nttaan, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtọkọ madanẹ ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, agoriji pẹ ade ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 25:24" />Màtima gol ọkkọkka bhọr-ẹ, màbir atima gol adok-ẹ akọbha. <verse eid="EXO 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 25:25" />Màbir tima gol si edoka ch'ebeng ẹkpa mach'ẹbọhkkpattem akọbha abem pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 25:26" />Màtima gol si aringẹ anna p'okpokkoro nwo m'agbaka ny'abongọ p'mmo sẹ nna. <verse eid="EXO 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 25:27" />Aringẹ mbo m'aninga anyọma akonga mbo mfha mabọka nchi njo s'idum-odum s'mad-atima atinẹ okpokkoro nwo. <verse eid="EXO 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 25:28" />Màtima nchi s'akasiya si nchi s'idum-odum s'mm'atima atinẹ okpokkoro nwo. Màtima gol bhọrọ nchi njo. <verse eid="EXO 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 25:29" />Màbir tima gol ọkkọkka si agbangbang, ọmaana agbangbang p'insẹns, ọmaana akọbh, ọttara agbangbangva p'mm'ad-atima abyenga atuk p'ẹja. <verse eid="EXO 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 25:30" />Sok brẹd kw'awuriji m'okpokkoro nwoma, ọfha od-oning-m m'ititika k'ogbe kpenamkpen.<verse eid="EXO 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Etorongkkang-nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 25:31" />“Màduk gol ọkkọkka tima si etorongkkang-nana. Màtima gol nwo si ẹwọr ọmaana nchi sẹ, ọmaana akọbh pẹ p'akerẹ agbok, ọttara agbok p'nkk'amaama. <verse eid="EXO 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 25:32" />Abọhnga achadanẹ mabọka ny'etorongkkang-nana ndo, attaan k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ, attaan z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 25:33" />Akọbh attaan p'akerẹ agbok p'almọn p'nkk'amaama, m'aninga k'ẹbọhnga danẹ, attaan z'ẹbọhnga ndoza. Minna kw'im'ode z'abọhnga mbo achadanẹ maphyir p'abọk ny'etorongkkang-nana ndo. <verse eid="EXO 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 25:34" />Akọbh anna p'akerẹ agbok p'almọn p'nkk'amaama, m'abira anana ny'etorongkkang-nana ndo. <verse eid="EXO 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 25:35" />Ogbok mawanẹ m'oninga k'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'achi eden ny'etorongkkang-nana. Ogbok ttonga afa oninga k'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'attong afa. Ogbok ttong attaan obir oninga k'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'attong attaan. Kibung-kibungọ, m'ode abọhnga achadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 25:36" />Agbok ọmaana abọhnga mbo m'ade ọttọhk mavanẹ amaana etorongkkang-nana ndo. Gol ọkkọkka kw'nkk'aduka, kẹ kw'mm'atima asi.<verse eid="EXO 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 25:37" />“Màbir si pẹ achenọmfa manana nya, ọfha ẹd-ẹnna ny'ititika sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 25:38" />Màtima gol ọkkọkka si itorongkkang-nọm ọmaana akkoriya pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 25:39" />Adọhbhiji p'gol kw'mm'atima asi etorongkkang-nana ndo, ọmaana itorongkkang-nọm ekpo pyẹ maphyir m'ade talẹnt<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25.39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adọhbhiji p'talẹnt mawanẹ made arọbh attaan obhirẹ ichi. To be revisited.</char></note> mawanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 25:40" />Zonga bẹ́, mm'asi ọttọhk kpenamkpen mbengana k'ose kw'nkọhk bọnga ny'egbe.<verse eid="EXO 25:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EXO 26" />
  <para style="s">Iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 26:1" />“Tima nso ijobh s'ọbara ọkkọkka f'matim ndik s'ide blu ayok, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọttara s'ikorọ izizẹ, si iruk-byi saam. Tte omengkkanọng oyok acherubim nya. <verse eid="EXO 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 26:2" />Ọbara mvo f'ọmma maphyir m'ode mbengana. Adum pabẹ m'ade ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ afa, ẹkpa chabẹ m'ede ntọkọ ichadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 26:3" />Màkọma nso s'ọbara mvo ochen k'ibyi majanẹ, mabir akọma mvoza ochen k'ibyi majanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 26:4" />Màtima ibara s'ide blu si aringẹ, magbana ny'aso p'ọbara f'ọmma p'ẹkpa danẹ, mabir asi minna z'aso mboza. <verse eid="EXO 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 26:5" />Màsi aringẹ arọbh afa okwuma ijobh magbana k'ibara s'ọmma mawanẹ, mabir asi aringẹ arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh, magbana k'ẹbaramma ch'ẹkpa ndoza. Tte aringẹ mbo akkerẹ ayok ititika. <verse eid="EXO 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 26:6" />Màtima gol si mgbaka arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh, s'mm'atima abọka ọbara mvo agbak-ọgbaka, ọfha iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi ide ibyi majanẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 26:7" />“Màtima avu-phyabha si ọbara ijobh kawanẹ f'ọmma kw'ikkira s'im'ibubha iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 26:8" />Adum p'ọbara kpenamkpen m'ade ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ achen, ẹkpa chabẹ ede ntọkọ ichadanẹ. Ọbara mvo maphyir m'ode mbengana. <verse eid="EXO 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 26:9" />Màkọma ọbara mvo f'ọmma ochen k'ẹkpa madanẹ, makọma mvoza ọchadanẹ k'ẹkpa ndoza. Mànyọhngọ ibara njo s'ọmma s'ittong ichadanẹ k'ibyi ifa ny'ikkiramma. <verse eid="EXO 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 26:10" />Màsi aringẹ arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh magbana ny'ẹmma ch'ẹkpa danẹ ch'ọbara mvo f'ọmma, mabir asi minna z'ẹbaramma ch'ẹkpa ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 26:11" />Màbir tima opo si mgbaka arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh magbaka ny'aringẹ mbo, ọfha ẹbọka ikkira njo ibe k'ibyi majanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 26:12" />Ṉ́nòde z'adum p'attar-ọttara ny'ọbara f'ọmma f'ikkira njo, igboka s'ẹkpa ndo ch'ebek-obek, jẹ jọ im'ilẹbhẹ z'nnam-nnam kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 26:13" />Ọbara f'ọmma f'ikkira njo m'otima ntọkọ janẹ odum ọyọhnga ayok k'okwubha-k'okwubha; njo s'irikẹ m'ilẹbhẹ ny'abem p'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọfha ibubh-ẹ obubha. <verse eid="EXO 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 26:14" />Màtima ntenkpa s'arọkimaan s'mafok asikora bubha ikkira njo, mabir abubha ntenkpa s'ichọr-ọchọrọ z'ẹrọng.<verse eid="EXO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 26:15" />“Màbir tima agbaaka p'akasiya si mkpọmmachi s'ibe-obe s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 26:16" />Ẹkpọmmachi kpenamkpen m'ede ntọkọ ichi, ẹkpa ede ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan, <verse eid="EXO 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 26:17" />ọttara aso afa p'nna ayok agbaak. Màsi mkpọmmachi njo s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi maphyir ose mawanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 26:18" />Màsi mkpọmmachi ẹrọbh z'ẹwọn-ẹwọna kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 26:19" />mabir atima silva asi arin arọbh afa p'mkpọmmachi k'izek-izek, arin afa maninga k'ọmmakwuk kpenamkpen, erin madanẹ eninga izek-izek kw'eso danẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 26:20" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza ch'ebir-ebir kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, masi mkpọmmachi ẹrọbh; <verse eid="EXO 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 26:21" />mabir atima silva asi arin arọbh afa. Arin afa m'aninga k'izek-izek kw'ẹkpọmmachi kpenamkpen. <verse eid="EXO 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 26:22" />Z'okwubha kw'ewuchen ed-edimẹ kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, màsi mkpọmmachi nchadanẹ, <verse eid="EXO 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 26:23" />mabir asi mkpọmmachi mfa s'abongọ z'nnam-nnam kw'iruk-byi Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 26:24" />Ny'abongọ mbo afa, mkpọmmachi njo m'ide mfa-mfa tọma z'orin maa, id-iyika aso k'oringẹ mawanẹ z'ẹrọng. Mbo afa m'ade ose mawanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 26:25" />Nya o, mkpọmmachi njo m'ide ochenọnttaan, arin p'silva m'ade ichi kkawanẹ. Ẹkpọmmachi kpenamkpen m'etima arin afa.<verse eid="EXO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 26:26" />“Màbir tima agbaaka p'akasiya si nzemachi. Nchen m'ide s'mkpọmmachi k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 26:27" />nchen m'ininga z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza, nchen ibira ininga z'ekpongannam kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ. <verse eid="EXO 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 26:28" />Ezemachi ch'ettem m'ẹtọma k'eso danẹ, ẹbọka z'eso ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 26:29" />Màtima gol bhọrọ mkpọmmachi njo, mabir atima gol asi aringẹ p'mm'abọka nzemachi njo. Ozeng k'nzemachi njo, màtima gol bhọrọ.<verse eid="EXO 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 26:30" />“Màmin iruk-byi njo s'Ibinọkpaabyi tor k'okkira nwo kw'nkọhk-ọ z'egbe.<verse eid="EXO 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 26:31" />“Màtima ọbara ọkkọkka f'ode blu, ọmaana f'okorọ isiso, ọttara f'okorọ izizẹ, yok ibara s'ọmma. Omengkkanọng m'oyok acherubim ny'ọbara mvo. <verse eid="EXO 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 26:32" />Màrena sẹ ny'mgbaka nna s'mkpọmmachi s'akasiya, màtima gol abhọrọ sẹ, ibe k'arin nna p'silva. <verse eid="EXO 26:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 26:33" />Màrena ibara njo s'ọmma ny'mgbaka njo, màtọka Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ asok z'nnam-nnam kw'ibara njo. Ibara njo jọ im'ibhaangẹ Ibyi s'Awuriji z'Ibyi s'Iwurọ-Iyọhng-Ọyọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 26:34" />Màtọka ẹkkọhbhọkpa ch'efokọ nana ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, z'Ibyi s'Iwurọ-Iyọhng-ọyọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 26:35" />Màbera okpokkoro z'iyaan-iyaan kw'ibara njo s'ọmma, z'ebir-ebira kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, masok etorongkkang-nana makkerẹ ayok ititika z'ẹwọn-ẹwọna kwẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 26:36" />“Ṉ́nòde ny'ẹsọhmma ch'ikkira njo, omengkkanọng m'otima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ide isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara ọbara ọkkọkka, odoka ibara njo s'ọmma. <verse eid="EXO 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 26:37" />Màtima gol si ẹgbaka ch'ibara njo s'ọmma, mabir atima echi ch'akasiya, asi mkpọmmachi nchen, matima gol abhọrọ jẹ. Pira nnatim opo arabha arin achen pabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 26:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EXO 27" />
  <para style="s1">Ija-byi s'ẹnanga ch'ẹkwọmọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 27:1" />“Tima agbaaka p'akasiya si ija-byi; ebe chẹ m'ede ntọkọ nna ọmaan akaana achadanẹ; agoriji pẹ m'ede ntọkọ nchenọmfa ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, ẹkpa chẹ m'ebir ede ntọkọ nchenọmfa ọmaana akaana achadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 27:2" />M'asi obhik k'ibongọ kpenamkpen, ọfha abhik mbo ọmaana ija-byi njo efona k'ibyi majanẹ. M'atima opo abhọrọ ija-byi njo. <verse eid="EXO 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 27:3" />Màtima bronz asi ekpo pyẹ py'ẹttọhk-wọhna maphyir: ọzọhka f'ititọhng okpukpokọ, ọmaana sọvẹl, ọmaana agbobhmbọhk p'asi ochichakẹ, ọmaana agbindara p'atim asa, ọttara nzenga s'ekpo okkikkang. <verse eid="EXO 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 27:4" />Màtima bronz si ayok ọkkẹng, atima bronz asi aringẹ anna; obongọ kpenamkpen m'oyena oringẹ kwẹ. <verse eid="EXO 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 27:5" />M'ayika ọkkẹng nwo ny'izek-izek kw'ija-byi, ọfha oninga ny'ibhaang kw'ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 27:6" />M'atima echi ch'akasiya asi nchi s'idum-odum s'ija-byi, abir atima bronz abhọrọ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 27:7" />M'anọhma nchi njo s'idum-odum ny'aringẹ mbo, ọfha eninga ny'abem mbo afa p'ija-byi k'ogbe kw'mm'ad-atinẹ. <verse eid="EXO 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 27:8" />Tima agbaakakpa si ija-ibyi njo ide oje. Si jẹ mbengana k'ose kw'nkọhk-ọ z'egbe.<verse eid="EXO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eterttem ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 27:9" />“Si eterttem ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. Ẹwọn-ẹwọna kwẹ m'ode ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh, k'adum. Bira tima mmọradik ọkkọkka si ọbara f'ọmma, <verse eid="EXO 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 27:10" />ọmaana mfafachi ẹrọbh, ttara arin p'bronz ẹrọbh, ọttara mgbaka s'matim silva asi, ọttara mbarakpa s'im'igbana ny'mfafachi njo. <verse eid="EXO 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 27:11" />Ẹbhaakẹ ch'ebir-ebir m'ebira ede ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh k'adum, eyena ọbara f'ọmma, ọmaana mfafachi ẹrọbh, ọttara arin p'bronz ẹrọbh, ọmaana mgbaka s'matim silva asi, ọttara mbarakpa s'im'igbana ny'mfafachi njo.<verse eid="EXO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 27:12" />“Ẹbhaakẹ ch'eterttem ndo ch'ening z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ, m'ede ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ ichi k'ẹkpa, ebira eyena ọbara f'ọmma, ọmaana mfafachi ijobh, ọttara arin ijobh. <verse eid="EXO 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 27:13" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-eyin, eterttem ndo m'ebira ede ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ ichi k'ẹkpa. <verse eid="EXO 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 27:14" />Ọbara f'ọmma f'adum pabẹ m'ade ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ mfa ọmaana igboka, ọmaana mfafachi nttaan, ọttara arin attaan, m'oninga k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ ch'ẹmmakwukden. <verse eid="EXO 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 27:15" />Ọbara f'ọmma f'adum pabẹ m'ade ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ mfa ọmaana igboka, ọmaana mfafachi nttaan, ọttara arin attaan ebir eninga z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza.<verse eid="EXO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 27:16" />“Nya ch'mm'azenga adim ny'eterttem ndo, gbana ibara s'ọmma s'adum pẹ made ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ ijobh. Omengkkanọng m'otima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọmaana mmoradik ọkkọkka, oyok sẹ. Mfafachi nna, ọttara arin anna pabẹ mabir aninga nya. <verse eid="EXO 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 27:17" />Mfafachi njo maphyir s'ikọbh eterttem ndo, m'itima mbarakpa, ọmaana mgbaka s'ide silva, ọttara arin p'ade bronz. <verse eid="EXO 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 27:18" />Adum p'eterttem ndo m'ade ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntọkọ arọbh attaan obhirẹ ichi. Agoriji p'ọbara f'amma pẹ p'matim mmoradik ọkkọkka ayok, m'ade ntọkọ nchenọmfa ọmaana igboka, ọttara arin p'ade bronz. <verse eid="EXO 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 27:19" />Ẹtọhmkpo maphyir py'matim asi iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọttara abhuk pẹ maphyir, ọmaana abhuk p'eterttem ndo maphyir, mm'ade bronz.<verse eid="EXO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana p'otorongkkang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 27:20" />“Ben anọng p'Israẹl machen-ọ ana ọkkọkka p'mamyan z'achiduk p'oliv p'mm'atima ayenẹ ekpon, ọfha atorongkkang ad-ayenẹ nya k'ogbe kpenamkpen. <verse eid="EXO 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 27:21" />Ny'ikkira s'etobha, ny'ititika-ititika kw'ibara s'ibubh Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, nya wọ kw'Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ mm'ad-ayenẹ atorongkkang ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, tọma k'ẹsọhka maa, pyirẹ k'ekpebha. Ọsana nwa m'oninga ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl ọttara iva p'iva pabẹ p'ikwuna mm'ammaana.<verse eid="EXO 27:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EXO 28" />
  <para style="s1">Nnya s'afọhn-nja p'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 28:1" />“M'arọhbha agbaanakka Aarọn, ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ p'ade Nadab, ọmaana Abihu, ọmaana Eleaza, ọttara nkwurọr, z'ikpakaana s'anọng p'Israẹl, mfha makwu ade afọhn-nja paam. <verse eid="EXO 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 28:2" />M'akwum ẹnya ch'awuriji ch'afọhn-nja anang Aarọn kw'ode agbaanakka kwọ, ọfha ẹnang-ẹ abarada ọmaana ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 28:3" />Amengkkanọng maphyir p'ikk'ezonga nnanga, bẹ p'm'aben makwum nnya anang Aarọn s'mm'atima anan-ẹ ọbọhk k'eso, ọfha ode ọfọhn-nja kwaam. <verse eid="EXO 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 28:4" />Nnya s'mm'akwum m'ide ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, ọmaana <char style="w">ẹphọd</char>, ọmaana ọnọhma-baba, ọmaana ọkpaar-mbọhk kw'opyirẹ ny'ndudungọ, ọmaana ibara s'eso odidabh, ọttara odikpa. Nnya s'awuraji njoma jọ s'mm'akwum anang agbaanakka Aarọn, ọttara ajinọngva pẹ, ọfha bẹ masi ọtọhm mach'afọhn-nja paam. <verse eid="EXO 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 28:5" />Ndik s'ide gol, ọmaana blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mbaradik ọkkọkka, jẹ s'mm'atima akwum nnya njo.<verse eid="EXO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹphọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 28:6" />“Tte omengkkanọng otima ndik s'ide gol, ọmaana s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mbaradik ọkkọkka, oyok ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 28:7" />M'eyena abarakpava afa ny'mbubaang, p'im'ẹgbaka ayok ny'abongọ pẹ afa, ọfha ẹbọka ayok. <verse eid="EXO 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 28:8" />Odikpa kwẹ kw'matim emengkka ayok, m'ode ose mawanẹ, mabir akwum attara ny'ẹphọd, matima ndik s'ide gol yok, ọmaana ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mbaradik ọkkọkka.<verse eid="EXO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 28:9" />“Tọka ata afa p'oniks, akkẹr ache p'ajinọngva p'Israẹl nya. <verse eid="EXO 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 28:10" />Ache achadanẹ m'aninga k'ẹta danẹ, mboza achadanẹ aninga z'ẹta ndoza. Kkẹr ache mba tor k'ẹmaanawu chabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 28:11" />Kkẹr ache p'ajinọngva p'Israẹl ny'ata mbo afa, k'ose kw'omengkkanọng ọd-ọkkẹr ekpo k'ata. Pira nabẹ gol akọbha ny'abem p'ata mbo, <verse eid="EXO 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 28:12" />abir agbaka bẹ ny'mbarakpa s'mbubaang s'ẹphọd, mfha mad-atima ajima ajinọngva p'Israẹl. Aarọn mod-otima ache mbo ny'mbubaang sẹ mach'ejima ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 28:13" />Bẹ gol kọhbha ny'abem p'ata mbo afa, <verse eid="EXO 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 28:14" />ọmaana agbakkọhbhọva afa p'gol ọkkọkka p'mabhọhrọ mach'edik, magbaka bẹ ny'ata mbo.<verse eid="EXO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 28:15" />“Tte omengkkanọng otima ndik s'ide gol, ọmaana s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mbaradik ọkkọkka, okwum ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma ch'ochibhẹ kw'kaam Ibinọkpaabyi ozizonga, obir osi dẹ mach'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 28:16" />Adum ọmaana ẹkpa chẹ m'ede mbengana mach'ẹbọhkpattem, abir anyọhng-ẹ igbedim ifa. <verse eid="EXO 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 28:17" />Pira nake ata p'ajibh-ojibh nya, k'akaana anna. Ny'ocheden-kaana, m'ake ata p'ruby, ọmaana p'topaz, ọttara p'bẹril. <verse eid="EXO 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 28:18" />Ọkaana ttong afa, m'ake ata p'tọkwọis, ọmaana p'saphira, ọmaana p'ẹmẹral. <verse eid="EXO 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 28:19" />Ọkaana ttong attaan, m'ake ata p'jasint, ọmaana p'agate, ọttara p'amẹtist. <verse eid="EXO 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 28:20" />Ọkaana ttonga anna, m'ake ata p'krisolita, ọmaana p'oniks, ọttara p'jaspa. Ke ata mbo nya ch'matim gol adoka. <verse eid="EXO 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 28:21" />Ata mbo m'ade ijobh kkamfa. Ẹta kpenamkpen m'ebe k'eche ch'ojinọngnwa mawanẹ kw'Israẹl. Kkẹr eche madanẹ mach'ẹkọhka k'ẹta kpenamkpen ch'im'ebe k'eso ch'ẹnọmma kpenamkpen ny'nnọmma njo ijobh kkamfa.<verse eid="EXO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 28:22" />“Ṉ́nòde ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, bhọhr agbakkọhbhọva p'gol ọkkọkka mach'edik. <verse eid="EXO 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 28:23" />Tima gol si aringẹ afa pẹ, agbaka ny'abongọ mbo afa p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma. <verse eid="EXO 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 28:24" />Gbaka agbakkọhbhọva mbo afa p'gol ny'aringẹ p'aning ny'abongọ p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, <verse eid="EXO 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 28:25" />abir atọka aso mboza afa p'agbakkọhbhọva mbo agbaka ny'ititika-itititika kw'mbarakpa s'ebubaang s'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 28:26" />Màtima gol si aringẹ afa, magbaka ny'abongọ mboza afa p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, ny'okonga kw'ẹtaanga kw'ọnyọm ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 28:27" />Màbir tima gol si aringẹ afa magbaka ny'izek-izek kw'mbarakpa s'mbubaang, z'ititika-ititika kw'ẹphọd. Màsi chẹ ẹnyọma z'ẹbọhra ch'ẹrọng-ẹrọng kw'odikpa kw'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 28:28" />Màtima edik ch'ede blu makpa aringẹ p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma z'aringẹ p'ẹphọd, ẹbọka z'odikpa kw'erin, ọfha ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma ening owuwokọ d'ewokọ z'ẹphọd.<verse eid="EXO 28:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 28:29" />“Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'Aarọn odimẹ z'Ibyi njo s'Awuriji, kẹ mod-otima ache p'ajinọngva p'Israẹl ny'ittemmọma sẹ, ny'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma ch'ochibhẹ kw'kaam Ibinọkpaabyi ozizonga, ọfha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi od-otima ojima anọng pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 28:30" />Màbir yika Urim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Urim ọttara Tumim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ode mach'ọsẹ kw'uwa afọhn-nja ad-atima azonga ochibhẹ kw'Ibinọkpaabyi.</char></note> ọttara Tumim ny'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, ọfha Aarọn od-otima ny'ittemmọma k'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'obe Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika. Minna kw'Aarọn min'od-otima ekpo mbya ny'ittemmọma sẹ, k'ogbe kw'obe k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, osi achibhẹ p'amaan anọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 28:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnya njoza s'afọhn-nja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 28:31" />“Màtima ibara s'ide blu kẹ-kẹ, kwum ọnọhma-baba kw'ẹphọd <verse eid="EXO 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 28:32" />kw'oyen ọmma ny'ottem, kw'eso im'edim. Màbir tọhbh ọmma nwo ọtọhbh mach'ẹnọhmadọngọ, ọfha oning ọyaakẹ. <verse eid="EXO 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 28:33" />Màtima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, yok aduk p'pomegrenet ọmaana akkaningkka p'gol, p'mm'arena k'njeka kw'ayok, ny'ammabọhra p'ọnọhma-baba nwo. <verse eid="EXO 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 28:34" />Màsi akkaningkka p'gol, ọmaana pomegrenet py'ed-ejeka ayok ny'ammabọhra p'ọnọhma-baba nwo maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 28:35" />Aarọn m'ọd-ọfọra ẹnya nda k'ogbe kw'oning k'ọtọhm. Mmin'abhaanga akkaningkka mbo k'ogbe kw'odimẹ z'Ibyi s'Awuriji s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oning, ọttara k'ogbe kw'oyinẹ k'iyaan, ọfha oning ope.<verse eid="EXO 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 28:36" />“Màtima gol ọkkọkka, si ẹchangkpa, akkẹr nya mach'ẹkọhka bẹ́, AWURIJI AYEN ỌVAAR IBINỌKPAABYI. <verse eid="EXO 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 28:37" />Màkpa edik ch'ede blu ẹbọka z'ibara s'eso, eninga ny'ititika-ititika kw'ibara njo s'eso. <verse eid="EXO 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 28:38" />M'ẹd-ẹnana Aarọn ny'ititika, obir ọwọhka mpinẹ s'anọng p'Israẹl k'nnanga s'awuriji, zaa wura nnanga sabẹ ide yen. M'ẹnana Aarọn ny'eso k'ogbe kpenamkpen, ọfha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọdaam ettem ọtọka nnanga s'anọng p'Israẹl.<verse eid="EXO 28:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 28:39" />“Màtima ọbara ọkkọkka yok ọkpaar-mbọhk kw'opyirẹ ny'ndudungọ, mabir atima ayok ibara s'eso odidabh. Odikpa m'obir ode ọtọhmbọhk f'okwum-ẹnya ikk'odoka. <verse eid="EXO 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 28:40" />Màkwum akpaar-mbọhk p'apyirẹ ny'ndudungọ, ọmaana adikpa, ọttara okpo manang ajinọngva p'Aarọn, ọfha ẹnang bẹ abarada ọmaana ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 28:41" />Ó̱de íkk'agbaanakka Aarọn, ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ nnya njoma afọra, byenga bẹ ana k'eso, abir anana bẹ mbọhk k'eso. Si bẹ mawur, mfha masi ọtọhm mach'afọhn-nja anang-m.<verse eid="EXO 28:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 28:42" />“Màtima ọbara ọkkọkka kwum mkpin kw'ẹtaanga kw'obubh ifor, tọma ny'erin pyirẹ z'ntaak. <verse eid="EXO 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 28:43" />Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ mmad-afọra nnya nja k'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'mm'adim z'ikkira s'etobha, wanẹma, manyọma ija-byi bẹ́, masi ọtọhm z'Ibyi s'Awuriji, mfha maning apinẹ, mape.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 28:43">“Ọsana nwa m'ọbaabha Aarọn ọmaana iva p'iva pẹ, ttattampe.<verse eid="EXO 28:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EXO 29" />
  <para style="s1">Ẹbọhk-nana ch'afọhn-nja p'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 29:1" />“Ma wọ ode ọttọhk f'masi ch'im'anana bẹ ọbọhk, mfha masi ọtọhm anang-m mach'afọhn-nja: tọka ọbhaamnwa kw'ode odim, ọmaana arọkimaandim afa p'nna ekebh ayen. <verse eid="EXO 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 29:2" />Tọka abuma ọkkọkka p'wit, tima si brẹd kw'nna yist ake: brẹd wanẹ m'abanga amaana ana p'oliv. Brẹd ọdọk-ọdọk m'ode mach'ayokpa p'mabọhr ana p'oliv. <verse eid="EXO 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 29:3" />Yika ekpo mbyo k'ikariba, pira natim pyẹ, azenga eden madanẹ ọmaana ẹbhaam ndo, ọttara arọkimaandim mbo afa, achen-m. <verse eid="EXO 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 29:4" />Tima Aarọn ọttara ajinọngva pẹ kwu ny'ẹsọhmma ch'ikkira s'etobha, atima asi agbobhọ bẹ ifor. <verse eid="EXO 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 29:5" />Tọka eforakpo mbyo py'ede ọkpaar-mbọhk kw'opyirẹ ny'ndudungọ, ọmaana ọnọhma-baba <char style="w" lemma="ẹphọd">kw'ẹphọd</char>, ọmaana ẹphọd oyenẹ, ọttara ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, afọra Aarọn. Tima odikpa kw'omengkkanọng ikk'oyoka, akpẹ-ẹ ẹphọd ny'ifor. <verse eid="EXO 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 29:6" />Nan-ẹ ibara s'eso odidabh ny'eso, adabh-ẹ ibara njo s'eso amaana ny'ivaarkpo s'iwur-owur. <verse eid="EXO 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 29:7" />Tọka ana p'mad-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, abyeng-ẹ ny'eso. <verse eid="EXO 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 29:8" />Tima ajinọngva pẹ kwu, fọra bẹ akpaar-mbọhk p'apyirẹ ny'ndudungọ, <verse eid="EXO 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 29:9" />abir akpa bẹ mbarakpa s'eso. Pira nakpa Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ adikpa. Ẹja ofufọhnọ m'ede ọsana kwabẹ, ttattampe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 29:9">“Ny'eden ndo ch'im'atima anana Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ ọbọhk k'eso.<verse eid="EXO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 29:10" />“Tima ẹbhaam kwu ny'ititika s'ikkira s'etobha; Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ m'anana ẹbhaam ndo mbọhk ny'eso <verse eid="EXO 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 29:11" />Yẹkẹ ẹbhaam ndo ẹdọngọ ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ny'ẹsọhmma ch'ikkira s'etobha. <verse eid="EXO 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 29:12" />Tima ẹnọhna chọ gberẹ izẹ s'ẹbhaam ndo ake ny'abhik p'ija-byi njo, abyenga njoza s'irikẹ ny'orin kw'ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 29:13" />Arọbha iyaak maphyir s'ẹtaanga s'ẹbhaam ndo, ọmaana s'ibubh attemnang, ọmaana adọhrọ mbo afa, akwọmọ jẹ ny'ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 29:14" />Okenaka, kwọmọ anang, ọmaana ẹkpakpa, ọttara abhọrọ p'ẹbhaam ndo z'mbọr-mbọr kw'ibhinga-byi. Dẹ dọ ede ẹnanga ch'egbobhọ epyibha.<verse eid="EXO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 29:15" />“Tọka ọrọkimaandim wanẹ ny'ambo afa, Aarọn ọttara ajinọngva pẹ m'anan-ẹ mbọhk ny'eso. <verse eid="EXO 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 29:16" />Yẹk-ẹ ẹdọngọ, atọka izẹ njo akponọ akọbha ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 29:17" />Jọhkọ ọrọkimaandim nwo <char style="it">ma sẹkẹ-sẹkẹ</char>, agbobhọ ẹtaangakpo, ọmaana mmo sẹ, ayika attara eso chẹ, ọttara akwuma mboza. <verse eid="EXO 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 29:18" />Kwọmọ ọrọkimaandim nwo k'ibungọ ny'ija-byi. Nya wọ ode ẹnanga ch'ẹkwọmọ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, ch'elebhẹ eruk, ebir ede ẹnanga ch'ọchattọhk f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 29:19" />“Kọ m'atọka ọrọkimaandim nwoza, pira Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ manan-ẹ mbọhk ny'eso. <verse eid="EXO 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 29:20" />Yẹk-ẹ ẹdọngọ, asi izẹ sẹ afoka Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ ny'itọhng s'odimbọhk-kwabẹ, ọmaana ny'nnọhnadim s'adimbọhk pabẹ, ọttara ny'nnọhnadim sabẹ s'odimbọhkbho. Íkk'asa minna, chakẹ izẹ kọbha ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 29:21" />Abir asi izẹ, ọmaana ana p'ẹbọhk-nana ny'ija-byi, achakẹ Aarọn ọmaana ẹnya chẹ. Abir achakẹ ajinọngva pẹ, ọttara nnya sabẹ. M'ofona nya, kẹ ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ, ọttara nnya sabẹ mawur.<verse eid="EXO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 29:22" />“M'atọka iyaak s'ẹsara ch'ọrọkimaandim nwa, ọmaana s'ẹtaanga, ọmaana s'attemnang, ọmaana adọhrọ pẹ afa, ttara iyaak sabẹ, ọttara odimbọhk-taak kwẹ. Ma wọ ode ọrọkimaandim kw'ẹbọhk-nana. <verse eid="EXO 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 29:23" />Ny'abrẹd mbo p'nna yist ake p'aning ny'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika, rọbha brẹd kw'ode, ọmaana wanẹ kw'odin-odinẹ kw'make ana, ọttara wanẹ kw'obhek-obhekẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 29:24" />Tọka ekpo mbya maphyir, ke Aarọn ọttara ajinọngva pẹ ny'mbọhk, mawokọ ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'ẹnanga ch'ewokọ. <verse eid="EXO 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 29:25" />Pira atọka byẹ ny'abẹ k'mbọhk akwọmọ ny'ija-byi, ttara z'nnanga s'ẹkwọmọ s'im'ilebh Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi eruk, ibir ide ẹnanga ch'ọttọhk f'manang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 29:26" />K'ogbe kw'ikk'ẹba ch'ọrọkimaandim kw'matim anana Aarọn ọbọhk atọka, wokọ chẹ ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'ẹnanga ch'ewokọ. Dẹ dọ im'ede okebh fọ.<verse eid="EXO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 29:27" />“Tọka ẹba, ọmaana ọtaak kw'oyen Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ ny'ẹrọkimaandim ndo ch'atim anana bẹ ọbọhk k'eso, akọm asok. Mbyo nya byọ ede ẹnanga ch'ewokọ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 29:28" />Ma wọ ode okebh f'anọng p'Israẹl mm'ad-anang Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ k'ogbe kpenamkpen. Vẹ vọ ode ọtabha kw'anọng p'Israẹl mmad-asi anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'nnanga sabẹ s'ẹgbaka.<verse eid="EXO 29:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 29:29" />“Nnya s'Aarọn s'awuriji m'ide nnya s'iva p'iva. Jẹ s'ikwuna mm'afọra k'ogbe kw'mm'abyeng bẹ ana k'eso, ọmaana ch'mm'anana bẹ ọbọhk k'eso. <verse eid="EXO 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 29:30" />Ojinọngnwa nwo kw'im'ọtọka eninga ch'Aarọn mach'ọfọhn-nja kw'Ibinọkpaabyi, m'ọfọra ẹnya ndo k'iwu ichenọmfa otima osi ọtọhm ny'ikkira s'etobha s'ide Ibyi s'Awuriji.<verse eid="EXO 29:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 29:31" />“Tọka ọrọkimaandim nwo kw'ẹbọhk-nana, wọhn eten chẹ k'Ibyi s'Awuriji. <verse eid="EXO 29:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 29:32" />Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ m'aninga ny'ikkiramma s'etobha achi eten ch'ẹrọkimaandim ndo, ọmaana brẹd nwo kw'oyik k'ikariba. <verse eid="EXO 29:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 29:33" />Bẹ mm'achi nnanga nja s'efohkọ ch'ẹbọhk-nana, ọmaana efor-da chabẹ. Okenaka, tte ọnọng ọdọk-ọdọk oning ochi, okurọ bẹ́, ezeng ọmaana awuriji. <verse eid="EXO 29:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 29:34" />Ó̱de eten kpenamkpen ch'ọrọkimaandim nwo kw'ẹbọhk-nana orikẹ maa, opyirẹ k'ekpebha, obir ode brẹd o, màkwọmọ pyẹ. Tte ọnọng oning ochi, okurọ bẹ́, ezeng ọmaana awuriji.<verse eid="EXO 29:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 29:35" />“Si ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ikk'ọ mbena anang Aarọn ọttara ajinọngva pẹ, atima iwu ichenọmfa asi ẹbọhk-nana chabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 29:36" />K'ewu kpenamkpen, tima ọbhaamdim fọhnọ ẹja ch'efokọ ch'epyibha. Si efokọ tima do ija-byi njo, abir abyenga ana nya, ọfha izeng ọmaana awuriji. <verse eid="EXO 29:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 29:37" />Tima iwu ichenọmfa si efokọ ch'ija-byi, ọfha izeng ọmaana awuriji. M'ofona nya, ija-byi njo m'iwur iyọhng-ọyọhnga. Ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ọtwẹ-ẹ, m'obir owur-owur.<verse eid="EXO 29:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 29:38" />“Ma wọ ode ẹnanga ch'mad-anang m'ija-byi k'ogbe k'ogbe, k'ewu kpenamkpen: arọkimaanva afa p'atim ade icho mawanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 29:39" />Tima mawanẹ fọhnọ ẹja k'ekpebha, atima nwoza afọhnọ ẹja k'ẹsọhka. <verse eid="EXO 29:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 29:40" />K'ogbe kw'm'atọka ocheden kw'ọrọkimaannwa nwo anang Ibinọkpaabyi, m'abir ayoma abuma p'wit k'ogbobhmbọhk, p'malọbhọ amaana ana p'oliv p'afu nkkang, ọttara atuk k'ẹkkang-gbomma, mach'ẹnanga ch'atuk. <verse eid="EXO 29:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 29:41" />Tima ọrọkimaannwa nwoza fọhnọ ẹja k'ẹsọhka, ttara ẹnanga ch'abuma ọmaana ch'atuk mach'iwura asi k'ekpebha. Eruk ọkkọkka ch'ẹnanga nda, m'elebh Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ettem.<verse eid="EXO 29:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 29:42" />“Mm'ad-asi ẹnanga nda ch'ẹkwọmọ k'ogbe k'ogbe, ny'ikkiramma s'etobha, ny'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika epemaanitor. Nya wọ kw'kaam m'nkebh bọnga, mgbaak odik nnang bọnga. <verse eid="EXO 29:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 29:43" />Nya wọ kw'im'mbira nttema mmaana anọng p'Israẹl, ntima abarada paam nsi ibyi njo iwur.<verse eid="EXO 29:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EXO 29:44" />“Minna kw'im'nsi ikkira s'etobha, ọmaana ija-byi iyena awuriji, mbira nsi Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ mayena awuriji, mfha masi ọtọhm mach'afọhn-nja paam. <verse eid="EXO 29:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EXO 29:45" />Nya kw'kaam m'nruk mmaana anọng p'Israẹl, mbira nde Ibinọkpaabyi kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 29:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EXO 29:46" />Bẹ mm'azonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kwabẹ, kw'uwa otim bẹ eden mabina z'Ijip, ọfha nruk mmaana bẹ. Kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 29:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EXO 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ija-byi s'insẹns</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 37:25-28">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga 37.25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 30:1" />“Màtima echi ch'akasiya si ija-byi s'mmad-akwọmọ insẹns. <verse eid="EXO 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 30:2" />M'iyena akonga anna; adum pẹ ọmaana ẹkpa chẹ m'ade mbengana, mm'ade ẹtọkọ madanẹ, ọmaana igboka. Ebe chẹ m'ede ntọkọ nttaan; abhik pẹ m'abir afona ny'echi ndo madanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 30:3" />Tima gol ọkkọkka bubha z'ẹrọng, ọmaana z'abem maphyir, ọttara z'abhik, abir atima gol adoka akọbha. <verse eid="EXO 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 30:4" />Tima gol si aringẹ afa ny'izek-izek kw'edoka ndo ch'ija-byi: afa k'okwubha k'okwubha, ọfha ẹbọka nchi njo s'idum-odum s'nd-atima atinẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 30:5" />Màtima echi ch'akasiya si nchi s'idum-odum, mabir atima gol abhọrọ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 30:6" />Sok ija-byi njo ny'ititika kw'ibara s'ọmma s'ibubh Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ ch'apaanga, ny'ititika-ititika kw'efokọkpa ch'ebubh Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ. Nya wọ kw'kaam m'nttema mmaan-ọ.<verse eid="EXO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 30:7" />“Aarọn m'ọkwọmọ insẹns kw'olebh eruk ny'ija-byi njo k'okpebhawu kpenamkpen k'ogbe kw'ọd-ọbaana atorongkkang mbo. <verse eid="EXO 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 30:8" />Kẹ m'obira ọkwọmọ insẹns k'ogbe kw'oyenẹ atorongkkang k'ẹsọhka, ọfha insẹns ọd-ọkwọmọ nya ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oning epemaanitor. <verse eid="EXO 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 30:9" />M'insẹns ọdọk-ọdọk m'ija-byi nja kàtima akwu, ozeng k'ẹnanga ch'ẹkwọmọ, obir ode ẹnanga ch'agwu. M'atuk nya kàbir abyenga. <verse eid="EXO 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 30:10" />Aarọn min'osi efokọ ny'abhik pẹ ogbe mawanẹ k'icho. Mm'atima izẹ s'ẹnanga ndo ch'epyibha asi efokọ nda anang epemaanitor. Ija-byi nja iwurọ mawuriji inang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.”<verse eid="EXO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ọtabha kw'efokọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 30:11" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 30:12" />“K'ogbe kw'atọk obhik f'anọng p'Israẹl, ọnọng-ọnọng m'ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi akpuka p'otim obhek akpen pẹ ny'ogbe kw'abhik-ẹ. M'ofona nya, itama iraar bẹ k'ogbe kw'abhik bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 30:13" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'nkk'abhika, m'ọnang ibhaka s'shẹkẹl, otor k'shẹkẹl kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'adọhbhiji pẹ ade agẹra ẹrọbh. Shẹkẹl-bhaaka nja ide ẹnanga ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 30:14" />Anọng maphyir p'nkk'abhika p'nkk'icho ẹrọbh apyira, wanẹma makpan, bẹ bọ mm'anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ẹnanga nda. <verse eid="EXO 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 30:15" />K'ogbe kw'masi ẹnanga ch'efokọ ch'akpen pabọnga anang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, tte ajibhadanọng aning anangẹ ayọhnga ibhaaka s'shẹkẹl, agbugbora aning abir anang machamẹ ayọhnga ibhaaka s'shẹkẹl. <verse eid="EXO 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 30:16" />Tọka akpuka p'efokọ z'anọng p'Israẹl k'mbọhk, atima akkerẹ ọtọhm f'ikkira s'etobha. Dẹ dọ im'ede ejima ch'anọng p'Israẹl z'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ititika ch'matim abhek akpen pabọnga.”<verse eid="EXO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ọgbangbang kw'mbọhk ọttara mmo ogbugbobhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 30:17" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 30:18" />“Tima bronz si ọgbangbang kw'ẹttọhkgbobhọ, abir atima bronz asi ẹnana chẹ. M'ake asi ny'ọgbangbang nwo asok ny'njeka kw'ikkira s'etobha, ọmaana ija-byi njo. <verse eid="EXO 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 30:19" />Ny'asi mbo, nya kw'Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ mm'ad-agbobhọ mbọhk, ọmaana mmo. <verse eid="EXO 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 30:20" />K'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'madimẹ ny'ikkira s'etobha, bẹ mm'agbobh mbọhk ọmaana mmo, mfha maning ape. Minna kw'mm'abir asi k'ogbe kw'mazeng anyọma ija-byi bẹ́, manang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ẹnanga ch'ọchattọhk. <verse eid="EXO 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 30:21" />Bẹ mm'agbobhọ mbọhk, ọmaana mmo sabẹ, mfha maning ape. Ọsana nwa m'ode kw'Aarọn ọmaana iva p'iva pẹ epemaanitor.”<verse eid="EXO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ana p'ẹbọhk-nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 30:22" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 30:23" />“Tọka ekpo py'elebh eruk k'ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna okwuma arọbh achen p'myrrh kw'ode asi-asi, ọmaana k'ashẹkẹl arọbh ijobh kkamfa obhirẹ ijobh p'sinamọn, ọttara k'ashẹkẹl arọbh ijobh kkamfa okwuma ijobh p'Kalamus, <verse eid="EXO 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 30:24" />ọmaana k'shẹkẹl ẹnọhna okwum arọbh achen p'akasiya, byẹ maphyir etor k'shẹkẹl kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọttara k'nkkang kw'ana p'oliv. <verse eid="EXO 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 30:25" />Tte ọnọng kw'od-osi ana p'elebh eruk, ọbanga ina nja ọbanga, otima osi ana p'awuriji p'ẹbọhk-nana. Bẹ bọ mm'ade ana p'ẹbọhk-nana. <verse eid="EXO 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 30:26" />Byenga ana mbo ny'ikkira s'etobha ọmaana ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, <verse eid="EXO 30:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 30:27" />ọmaana ny'okpokkoro, ttara ekpo py'ẹnan nya maphyir, ọmaana ny'etorongkkang-nana, ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọttara ny'ija-byi s'insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 30:28" />ọmaana ny'ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ, ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọmaana ny'ọgbangbang, ọttara ẹnana chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 30:29" />M'asi byẹ ewur-owur mawuriji, ọfha ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'otwu byẹ, obir owur-owur.<verse eid="EXO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 30:30" />“Byenga Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ ana, abir asi bẹ mawur, mfha, masi ọtọhm anang-m mach'afọhn-nja. <verse eid="EXO 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 30:31" />Gbaak anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Ana mba bọ mm'ade ana paam p'awur-owur p'ẹbọhk-nana epemaanitor. <verse eid="EXO 30:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 30:32" />Ọnọng nwoka ana mbo k'ifor kàbyenga. M'anakira ọdọk-ọdok kasi m'eden ndoma. Ana mbo m'ade ana p'awuriji. Màtọka mach'ana p'awuriji. <verse eid="EXO 30:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 30:33" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'osi ana p'alebh eruk mach'mboma, obir obyenga ọnọng kw'ina ọfọhn-nja ode, mm'akpaar-ẹ z'ẹkaan ch'anọng pẹ.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 30:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insẹns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 30:34" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Tọka ekpo py'elebhẹ eruk mach'onicha, ọmaana galbanum, ọttara frankinsens ọkkọkka, yoma pyẹ maphyir mbengana. <verse eid="EXO 30:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 30:35" />Tte ọnọng kw'od-osi ana p'alebhẹ eruk, ọbanga ekpo py'ed-esi ekpo elebh eruk, otima osi insẹns, ọtọka onung owingẹ nya, oning ọbangẹ, obir owur-owur mawuriji. <verse eid="EXO 30:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 30:36" />Màkok byanẹ maa, ẹpẹra, masok ny'ititika kw'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, z'ikkira s'etobha. Nya kw'kaam m'nkebh bọnga. M'ode awuriji piden ọnang bọnga. <verse eid="EXO 30:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 30:37" />M'insẹns ọdọk-ọdok kasi m'eden ndoma anang ifor sabọnga. Màtọka mach'ọttọhk f'oyen awuriji p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 30:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 30:38" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'osi insẹnskira nwoma bẹ́, otima osi ifor sẹ ilebh eruk, mm'akpaar-ẹ z'ẹkaan ch'anọng pẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 30:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EXO 31" />
  <para style="s1">Bẹzalẹl ọmaana Oholiyab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga 31.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 31:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 31:2" />“Kirẹ, kaam kk'Bẹzalẹl nteka, kw'ode nnwa kw'Uri, nnwa kw'Hur. Ofon ẹkọma ch'Juda. <verse eid="EXO 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 31:3" />Kaam kk'ẹ Egwugwuma ch'Ibinọkpaabyi nnanga, ọmaana ezonga, ọmaana ọyaanttaana, ọmaana edikzonga, ọttara akona p'emengkkakira kpenamkpen, <verse eid="EXO 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 31:4" />ọfha od-otima gol, ọmaana silva, ọttara bronz, osi ekpo py'ejibh-ojibh, <verse eid="EXO 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 31:5" />obir ọd-ọkkẹbh ata otima osi ekpo, ọgwa nchi, obira osi mmengkkakira kpenamkpen. <verse eid="EXO 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 31:6" />Kaam kk'Oholiyab mbira nteka, kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Ahisamak, kw'ofon k'efona ch'Dan bẹ́, ọkẹ-ẹ ọbọhk. Kaam kk'amengkkanọng maphyir ezonga ch'emengkka mbira nnanga bẹ́, matima asi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'ikk'bọnga mbena bẹ́, masi. <verse eid="EXO 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 31:7" />Mm'asi ikkira s'etobha, ọmaana Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, ttara efokọkpa ch'mm'anana ny'ẹrọng, ọttara ekpo mbyoza maphyir py'ezeng ẹmaana edoka chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 31:8" />Masi okpokkoro, ọttara ekpo maphyir py'ezeng ẹmaan-ẹ, ọmaana etorongkkang-nana ch'matim gol ọkkọkka asi, ttara ekpo maphyir py'ezeng ẹmaan-ẹ, ọmaana ija-byi s'insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 31:9" />ọmaana ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ, ttara ekpo maphyir py'ezeng ẹmaan-ẹ, ọmaana ọgbangbang kwiden, ttara ẹnana chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 31:10" />ọmaana nnya s'awuriji s'mayok-oyok, s'Aarọn min'ọd-ọfọra mach'ọfọhn-nja, ọttara nnya s'ajinọngva pẹ mmin'ad-afọra k'ogbe kw'masi ọtọhm mach'afọhn-nja, <verse eid="EXO 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 31:11" />ọmaana ana p'ẹbọhk-nana, ọttara insẹns kw'Ibyi s'Awuriji. Tte masi ekpo mbyo mbengana k'ose kw'ikk'ọ mbena.”<verse eid="EXO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ẹwọhngkwokawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 31:12" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 31:13" />“Ben anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Bọnga mm'akpobha Iwọhngkwokawu saam. Nya wọ im'ode ẹkọhka ch'kaam ọttara bọnga epemaanitor, mfha mazonga bẹ́, kaam wọ nde Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'od-osi bọnga mawur.<verse eid="EXO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 31:14" />“ ‘Màkpobha Ẹwọhngkwokawu, okurọ bẹ́, ede ewu ch'ewur-owur ẹnang bọnga. Ọnọng kw'olukọ ewu ndo, mm'afhẹ-ẹ. Ọnọng kw'obir osi ọtọhm ny'ewu ndo, mm'akpaar-ẹ z'ẹkaan ch'anọng pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 31:15" />Bọnga mmin'asi ọtọhm k'iwu ichadanẹ. Ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, mm'akwoka ọwọhng, okurọ bẹ́, ewu ndo ede Ẹwọhngkwokawu ch'ewur-owur ẹnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'osi ọtọhm ny'ewu ndo, mm'afhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 31:16" />Anọng p'Israẹl m'akpobha Ẹwọhngkwokawu nda epemaanitor, mach'echekẹ ch'ttattampe. <verse eid="EXO 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 31:17" />Ewu ndo m'ede ẹkọhka ch'kaam ọttara anọng p'Israẹl ttattampe, okurọ bẹ́, wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ẹrọng ọmaana izek k'iwu ichadanẹ, ch'ottong iwu ichenọmfa, okwoka ọwọhng.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 31:18" />K'ogbe kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'idik njo ọgbaaka ny'egbe ch'Sinai maphyir ọnang Mosẹs, ọtọka ata afa p'asana p'ikẹ Ibinọkpaabyi ozeng mmo ọkkẹr, ọnang Mosẹs.<verse eid="EXO 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EXO 32" />
  <para style="s1">Ọbhaamnwa kw'matim gol asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 32:1" />K'ogbe kw'anọng p'Israẹl makwu aze bẹ́, Mosẹs kk'okponga ọkpan z'ogbeso, makọbha Aarọn ake k'ettem, maben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kwu si akpata nang mina p'mm'atima mina eden. Ṉ́nòde Mosẹs nwa kw'otim mina obina z'Ijip, m'odik kw'ikk'oyina ọmaan-ẹ za, kozong.”<verse eid="EXO 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 32:2" />Nya o, Aarọn oben bẹ bẹ́, “Màwọra ekpo py'itọhng py'panọng pabọnga py'matim gol asi, ọmaana py'ajinọngva pabọnga, ọttara py'aminava pabọnga, chen-m.” <verse eid="EXO 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 32:3" />Minna kw'anọng mbo maphyir mawọr ekpo py'itọhng pyabẹ, machena Aarọn. <verse eid="EXO 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 32:4" />Aarọn otima ekpo mbyo py'nkk'ẹ ananga, osi ọkpata kw'okerẹ ọbhaamnwa. Nya o, maben bẹ́, “O Israẹl, ma wọ ode akpata pabọnga, p'atim bọnga eden abina z'Ijip.”<verse eid="EXO 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 32:5" />Aarọn oze odik nwa nya o, ottima ija-byi ny'ititika s'ọkpata nwo. Owon ẹmọng oben bẹ́, “Ophyinẹ mm'osi odidaama ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi.” <verse eid="EXO 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 32:6" />Minna kw'anọng mbo mapọm-ọpọm aphyabha ny'owusobha, mad-afọhnọ ẹja ch'nnanga okwukwọmọ, mabir anang nnanga s'ẹgbaka. Macher nya o, maninga ẹwor achi ọttọhk, mabir agwo atuk, pira nnabin atọma izazadik osisi.<verse eid="EXO 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 32:7" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Saka z'izek, kirẹ anọng pọ p'atim eden abina z'Ijip, maning za asi adiktama. <verse eid="EXO 32:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 32:8" />Bẹ nkk'aduka maa, makpa nnam abọra ose kw'mbenẹ bẹ bẹ́, masi. Mabir arabha ọkpata kw'okerẹ ọbhaamnwa anang ifor sabẹ. Nkk'nso araka anang-ẹ, mabir afọhnọ ẹja anang-ẹ, mabir aben bẹ́, ‘O Israẹl, ma wọ ode akpata pabọnga, p'atim bọnga eden abina z'Ijip.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 32:9" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obira oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam kk'nza bẹ́, anọng mba agaangẹ nso. <verse eid="EXO 32:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 32:10" />Tte-m ọbọhk, ọfha nkọhka bẹ ottemkọma kwaam, mbira ndimẹ bẹ. Pira nsọ-ọ ẹkọma chiden.”<verse eid="EXO 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 32:11" />Mosẹs okwukọ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwẹ, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, kayen kw'im'ọdọkọ minna ọmaana anọng pọ p'ikk'ẹfa chiden, ọttara ọbọhk kwọ kw'ẹfa atima abina z'Ijip o? <verse eid="EXO 32:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 32:12" />Kayen kw'm'atte anọng p'Ijip maben bẹ́, ‘Wa ọkamẹ bẹ́, osi bẹ itama, kẹ wọ osi ọtọka bẹ bẹ́, ọd-ọfhọ z'agbe, obir odimẹ bẹ kibungọ m'iyagbin’? Ototo, kpa nnam bọra ottempyibha kwọ. Tọr ifor, anọng pọ itama kàsi. <verse eid="EXO 32:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 32:13" />Jima atọhmnọng pọ Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb, p'uwa achekẹ k'ikọ k'ifor anang bẹ́, ‘Kaam m'nsi iva p'iva pabọnga masaabh mach'ndidorọ s'ọrọngkpakpa, m'mbira nnang bẹ izek nja maphyir s'ikk'ncheka bẹ, m'ibira ide ebocha chabẹ ttattampe.’ ”<verse eid="EXO 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 32:14" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtọr ifor, ọdọk anọng pẹ itama njo s'iwa ọkamẹ kosi.<verse eid="EXO 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 32:15" />Mosẹs otima ata mbo afa p'makkẹrẹ asana ny'mbọhk, ọbhakẹ nnam, ọsaka ny'egbe ndo. Wa makkẹrẹ asana mbo ny'ẹbhọr, ọmaana ny'nnam s'ata mbo. <verse eid="EXO 32:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 32:16" />Wa ata mbo p'makkẹrẹ asana, ọmaana ọkkẹra ọyenẹ, ede ọtọhmbọhk f'Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 32:17" />K'ogbe kw'Joshua ọbhaang izozo s'anọng mbo mad-achona k'ẹrọng, oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Agbong-mọng atto z'ibhinga-byi.”<verse eid="EXO 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 32:18" />Mosẹs ọpọhna bẹ́,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EXO 32:18">“Ẹmọng ch'ekema azang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">ebomọng azang ọdọk;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EXO 32:18">ẹmọng ch'ọkkọhna ch'nter mmaanga e.”<verse eid="EXO 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 32:19" />Ch'Mosẹs ikk'ibhinga-byi ọnyọma, oze ọkpata nwo kw'okerẹ ọbhaamnwa, ọttara otubha kw'mad-atubh. Ettem epyibh-ẹ maa, ọtọka ata mbo p'makkerẹ asana p'otim ny'mbọhk, ọbharẹ, ọvọhkọ pẹ<char style="it">ma tukutuku </char>ny'igbemmo. <verse eid="EXO 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 32:20" />Obira ọtọka ọkpata nwo kw'anọng mbo nkk'asa, ọkwọmọ k'ekpon; pira nokkokọ wẹ maa, ọpẹra. Ọtọka ọlọhbh k'asi, ọnang anọng p'Israẹl, magwo.<verse eid="EXO 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 32:21" />Mosẹs oben Aarọn bẹ́, “Anọng mba asọ-ọ mbọng kw'atim bẹ asi epyibha-dimse nda?”<verse eid="EXO 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 32:22" />Aarọn ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Ttatta kwaam, tte oning-ọ ọdọkọ. Kọ azong ose kw'itama osisi id-idaak anọng mba ma. <verse eid="EXO 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 32:23" />Bẹ maben-m bẹ́, ‘Si akpata nang mina p'mm'atim mina eden. Ṉ́nòde Mosẹs nwa kw'otim mina obina z'Ijip, m'odik kozong kw'ikk'oyina ọmaan-ẹ za.’ <verse eid="EXO 32:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 32:24" />Ofona nya, mben bẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oyen ọttọhk f'ẹdọngọ f'matim gol asi, ọwọra ọnang-m.’ Mawọr anang-m nya o, ntọka nke k'ekpon. Nya kw'ọkpata nwoma, ofon!”<verse eid="EXO 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 32:25" />Mosẹs okwu oze bẹ́, anọng mba nasi dingidingẹ, obir oze bẹ́, Aarọn kk'bẹ ọbọhk ọtta mattena eden, nnakwu ade ọsammattọhk z'achen p'awawunanọng pabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 32:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 32:26" />Ofona nya, Mosẹs obe ny'ebhumma ch'ibhinga-byi oben bẹ́, “Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ochẹr k'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, tte okwu obe ma ọmaan-m.” ALẹvi maphyir mabina, mad-abe amaan-ẹ.<verse eid="EXO 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 32:27" />Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl obenẹ bẹ́, ‘Ọnọng-ọnọng ọkpa ọkkangkkang kwẹ z'erin, ozenga ochina nnam-nnam, obir ozenga ichina ititika m'ibhinga-byi, tọma k'eso danẹ, pyirẹ z'eso ndoza. Tte ọnọng-ọnọng ọfhọ ọgbaanotte kwẹ, ọmaana oyok-ẹkaan, ọttara oyok-oter.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 32:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 32:28" />ALẹvi mbo masi k'ose kw'Mosẹs obenẹ bẹ. Ny'ewu ndo, anọng p'apyirẹ nnọhna ichenọmfa obhirẹ arọbh ijobh, mape. <verse eid="EXO 32:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 32:29" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben bẹ́, “Menda nkk'bọnga arọbha asok nkọmẹ mach'anọng p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, okurọ ch'bọnga nna ajinọngva ọttara ivotte pabọnga oyenẹ, ajọhkọ. Ofona nya, kẹ kk'bọnga ọda m'ewu ch'menda.”<verse eid="EXO 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 32:30" />Ewu esobh nya, Mosẹs oben anọng mbo bẹ́, “Bọnga nkk'epyibha chiden asa. Okenaka, kaam m'nd-nkebha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ṉ́nòsi, m'mkpo-okpo nsi efokọ chabọnga k'mpyibha.”<verse eid="EXO 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 32:31" />Nya o, Mosẹs ọkpa nnam z'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, od-oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Epyibha ch'anọng mba asi kk'ẹbara e! Bẹ nkk'gol atima asi akpata anang ifor sabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 32:32" />Ototo, bina nang bẹ k'mpyibha sabẹ. Okenaka, ini bẹ mabina anang, rọbha eche chaam z'nnwẹr nwo kw'akkẹrẹ ache pabẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 32:33" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọpọhna Mosẹs bẹ́, “Eche ch'ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ikk'epyibha ọsa ọmaan-m dọ ch'im'nrọbha z'nnwẹr kwaam. <verse eid="EXO 32:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 32:34" />Zọhng madidanma, atima anọng mbo eden achina z'ibyi njo s'mgbaak odik mmaana. Ozeng-eden kwaam m'ọchọ-ọ eden. Okenaka, óde ogbe kk'obenga kw'im'nnang bẹ irem, kaam m'nnang bẹ irem k'mpyibha sabẹ.”<verse eid="EXO 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 32:35" />Minna kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọtọhm itama ọnang anọng mbo okurọ osisi kwabẹ ọmaana ọkpata nwo kw'okerẹ ọbhaamnwa kw'Aarọn osi.<verse eid="EXO 32:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EXO 33" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 33:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kọ ọttara anọng p'atim eden abina z'Ijip, màbina rik ibyi nja. Màchina z'izek s'nkk'ncheka nnang Abraham, ọmaana Isaak, ọttara Jekọb bẹ́, ‘M'nnang iva p'iva pabọnga.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 33:2" />Kaam m'ntọhm ozeng-eden kwaam otim bọnga eden, makwubh anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana anọng p'Amọr, ọmaana anọng p'Het, ọmaana anọng p'Periz, ọmaana anọng p'Hiv, ọttara anọng p'Jebus. <verse eid="EXO 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 33:3" />Màchina z'izek s'abasi ọmaana ọkọhn malor-olorọ. Okenaka, kaam bọnga mìntor mochina za, okurọ bẹ́, bọnga magaangẹ nso ọkpan. Ó̱de ntorọ bọnga, m'mkpo-kpo mfhọ bọnga z'eden.”<verse eid="EXO 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 33:4" />K'ogbe kw'anọng mbo mabhaang ẹkkaabhatama ndo, ifor ipe bẹ maa, ọnọng kw'obir ọfọra ẹfangkpo kode. <verse eid="EXO 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 33:5" />Ode ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'Mosẹs obena bẹ́, “Tek anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, ‘Bọnga made anọng p'agaangẹ nso. Ó̱de mbenẹ bẹ́ m'ntor bọnga, zaabẹ́ ode k'ogbe biribirẹ, mkpo-okpo mfhọ bọnga. Màwọra ẹfangkpo pyabọnga madidaanma, ọfha nzonga ọttọhk f'im'nsi mmaana bọnga.’ ” <verse eid="EXO 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 33:6" />Minna kw'anọng mbo p'Israẹl mawọr ẹfangkpo pyabẹ ny'egbe ch'Horẹb.<verse eid="EXO 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikkira s'etobha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 33:7" />K'ibhinga-byi kpenamkpen s'anọng p'Israẹl, wa Mosẹs od-ottima ikkira z'ororo kw'ibhinga-byi njo, oyerẹ jẹ bẹ́, “Ikkira s'etobha.” Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ororọ bẹ́, ọbọbh Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi odik, m'obina orik ibhinga-byi ochina z'ikkira njo s'etobha s'ining z'ororo. <verse eid="EXO 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 33:8" />Ogbe kpenamkpen kw'Mosẹs ochin z'ikkira njo, anọng maphyir mad-abina abe-obe ny'okkiramma fabẹ, makker-ẹ maa, odim z'ikkira njo ẹtaanga. <verse eid="EXO 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 33:9" />Ó̱de Mosẹs ikk'odima z'ikkira njo ẹtaanga, ebonọ m'ebina z'ẹrọng ẹsaka, ebe odudum ny'ikkiramma, nya ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi im'ọgbaak odik ọmaana Mosẹs. <verse eid="EXO 33:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 33:10" />K'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'anọng mbo maze ebonọ ndo ch'ebe odudum ny'ikkiramma njo, ọnọng-ọnọng m'obina obe-obe ny'ikkiramma sẹ k'ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 33:11" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obe Mosẹs ny'ititika, ọgbaak odik ọmaan-ẹ mach'ọnọng ọd-ọgbaak odik ọnang oyok-odikkobh. Minna kw'Mosẹs m'ọkpa nnam z'ibhinga-byi. Okenaka Joshua, kw'ode nwa kw'Nun, odikkobhnwa kw'od-otor Mosẹs masi ọtọhm, od-oninga ny'ikkira njo mach'oning nya.<verse eid="EXO 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosẹs oze abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 33:12" />Mosẹs oben Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, “Kọ ad-aben-m bẹ́, ntima anọng mboma eden. Okenaka, kaam ọnọng atima ateka kw'mm'ọtọn. Kọ kk'abena bẹ́, ‘Kaam nzong eche chọ, kọ kk'owujibh kwaam ayena.’ <verse eid="EXO 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 33:13" />Ó̱de ayen ottemdaam amaan-m k'odik ọkkọkka, tibh-m nden sọ, ọfha nzong-ọ, mbir nchina ororo nyena owujibh kwọ. Jima bẹ́, ẹkọma nda ede anọng pọ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 33:14" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọpọhn-ẹ bẹ́, “Kaam oyenẹ m'nzenga mmaan-ọ, mbir nnang-ọ ẹwọhngkwoka.” <verse eid="EXO 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 33:15" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ó̱de ina mina mazenga amaana, mina ọbọhk katte mobina m'ibyi nja. <verse eid="EXO 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 33:16" />Yen wọ kw'ọnọng motima ozonga bẹ́, kọ ayen ottemdaam amaana kaam ọttara anọng pọ, kw'ọkpanẹ bẹ́ m'azenga amaana mina o? Bọng-ọttọhk vọ im'ọkọhka bẹ́, kaam ọttara anọng pọ, m'ode nkọmẹ z'anọng mboza p'iyagbin?”<verse eid="EXO 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 33:17" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kaam m'nsi ọttọhk mvo f'ikk'aam aphyema, okurọ bẹ́, kaam nyen ottemdaam mmaan-ọ, mbira nzong-ọ k'eche.”<verse eid="EXO 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 33:18" />Mosẹs o, oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Ototo, kọhk-m abarada pọ.”<verse eid="EXO 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 33:19" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Kaam m'nsọ-ọ aze ajibhada paam maphyir, mbir nsi ẹyaakẹ ch'eche chaam, ch'ede Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, nnang-ọ. Kaam m'nyena ikwosisi mmaana ọnọng kw'ọbaan ikwosisi, ọnọng kw'ọbaana bẹ́, nzẹ-ẹ okwo, kaam m'mbir nzẹ-ẹ okwo.” <verse eid="EXO 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 33:20" />Okenaka, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben-ẹ bẹ́, “Kọ ititika saam màkpo aze, okurọ bẹ́, ọnọng kode kw'im'oze ititika saam, oninga akpen.”<verse eid="EXO 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 33:21" />Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obir oben bẹ́, “Ibyi ining ma s'inyọm-m s'im'abe k'ẹtakpa. <verse eid="EXO 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 33:22" />K'ogbe kw'abarada paam m'akpan, kaam m'nsok-ọ z'ọtakpamma, mbir ntima ọbọhk kwaam mbubh-ọ maa, mkpan. <verse eid="EXO 33:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 33:23" />Ch'im'ntinẹ ọbọhk kwaam, kọ m'aze nnam saam jẹ-jẹ, okenaka, ititika saam màze.”<verse eid="EXO 33:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EXO 34" />
  <para style="s1">Ata abhapẹ p'makkẹrẹ asana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 34:1" />Wa Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹbh ata afa p'ade mach'mboza p'echeden. Nya kw'im'nkkẹr idik njo s'iwa ining z'achedenta mbo p'avọhkọ. <verse eid="EXO 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 34:2" />Do ifor k'ekpebha, avura akebh-m z'ogbeso kw'Sinai. Kebh-m z'ogbeso nwo. <verse eid="EXO 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 34:3" />Tte ọnọng oning-ọ otorọ mavura egbe ndo o. Tte maning ọnọng aze ọnyọma egbe ndo. Ozeng k'otirattọhk, oning ọchattọhk ny'ititika s'egbe ndo, ochi.” <verse eid="EXO 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 34:4" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọkkẹbh ata afa p'made mach'mboza p'echeden. K'ekpikpebha, otima ata mbo afa ny'mbọhk, ovura egbe ch'Sinai k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena. <verse eid="EXO 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 34:5" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otima ebonọ ọsaka okwu obe ọmaan-ẹ nya, osi ẹyaakẹ ch'eche chẹ. <verse eid="EXO 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 34:6" />Okwu ọkpan Mosẹs ny'ititika, osi ẹyaakẹ bẹ́, “Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ikwosisi, ọmaana kw'ọphyaam, kw'ọd-ọtọka ogbe pira ọdọk-ẹ, kw'oyen ọdaakẹ kw'ọsaabh-ọsaabh, obir od-obe ọmaana ọgbaakadik kwẹ, <verse eid="EXO 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 34:7" />ọd-ọkọhka anọng k'nnọhna k'nnọhna ọdaakẹ kwẹ, od-obina ọnang anọng p'avọhkọ ọsana kwẹ, ọmaana ayok p'asi itama ọttara mpyibha. Okenaka, anọng p'aponga apyibhẹ ọbọhk kod-otte, ọd-ọnang iva pabẹ, ọttara iva p'iva, irem k'ipemaanitor nttaan ọmaana nna.”<verse eid="EXO 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 34:8" />Mosẹs ogbe kokibhẹ, ọraka eso ọnang-ẹ ikpukpobha. <verse eid="EXO 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 34:9" />Oben bẹ́, “O Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, óde ikk'ọdaam fọ nza, tte Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi otor mina k'ozenga. Zaabẹ́ anọng mboma made aso-gaangẹnọng, bina nang mina k'itama ọttara mpyibha s'mosi, abir atọka mina mach'anọng pọ.”<verse eid="EXO 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Echekẹ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi osi ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 34:10" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben bẹ́, “Kaam nsi echekẹ mmaan-ọ. Anọng pọ maphyir m'aze ch'im'nsi ikkonọ-kkonọdik s'ina ntima nd-nsa k'ẹkọma kpenamkpen m'iyagbin. Anọng mba p'aruk amaana, mm'aze ikkonọ-kkonọdik s'kaam Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi m'nsi nnang bọnga. <verse eid="EXO 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 34:11" />Màkpobha asana mba p'nnang bọnga menda. Kaam m'nkwubh anọng p'Amọr p'aning bọnga z'ititika mmarẹ k'iyaan, ọmaana anọng p'Kenaan, ọmaana p'Het, ọmaana p'Periz, ọmaana p'Hiv, ọttara p'Jebus. <verse eid="EXO 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 34:12" />Màkkerẹ bọnga ifor o, m'echekẹ kpenamkpen kàsi amaana anọng p'marukọ ny'izek njo s'nd-achina nya, mfha màning k'ọmma atto. <verse eid="EXO 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 34:13" />Màvọhkọ ọja-byi fabẹ, manyunọ ata pabẹ p'ekpobha, mabir akpaara mkpọmmachi s'ọka f'Ashẹra abharẹ za. <verse eid="EXO 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 34:14" />M'ọttọhk ọdọk-ọdọk kàkpobha, kirẹ Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'eche chẹ ede Ẹjọhmọ, ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ẹjọhmọ.<verse eid="EXO 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 34:15" />“Màkkerẹ bọnga ifor o, m'nttọhna kpenamkpen kàsi amaana anọng mbo p'arukọ ny'izek njo o, mfha k'ogbe kw'mm'asi ẹzazamaana amaana aka pabẹ, mabir afọhnọ nja anang aka mbo, maning bọnga ayerẹ matọn achi ẹchakpo pyabẹ py'matim afọhnọ nja. <verse eid="EXO 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 34:16" />Ó̱de ajinọngva pabọnga matọk aminava pabẹ k'ọbada, ch'aminava mbo mm'asi ẹzazamaana amaana aka pabẹ, m'ọwọhkọ ajinọngva pabọnga m'ator bẹ masi ẹmmaana chabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 34:17" />“M'ọkpata kpenamkpen kasi.<verse eid="EXO 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 34:18" />“Bọnga mmad-asi Odidaama kw'Brẹd kw'ina obibir obirẹ. Màchi brẹd kw'nna yist ake k'iwu ichenọmfa k'ose kw'ikk'bọnga mbena. Mm'ad-asi minna k'ogbe kwẹ ny'ophe kw'Abib, okurọ bẹ́, ny'ophe nwo wọ kw'bọnga mabin z'Ijip.<verse eid="EXO 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 34:19" />“Iva p'ichedenbhọr kpenamkpen m'ade paam, ozeng k'acheden-dimpe p'etirakpo pyabọnga: zaa ode arọkimaan, obir ode abhaam. <verse eid="EXO 34:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 34:20" />Tima ọrọkimaanwa bhek ichedenbhọr s'ẹnyanya, okenaka, ini wẹ màbhek, phyak-ẹ ẹdọngọ. Màbhek acheden-jinọngva pabọnga maphyir.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:20">“Tte ọnọng oning mbọhk-mbọhk otim okwu obe-m k'ititika.<verse eid="EXO 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 34:21" />“Bọnga mm'ad-asi ọtọhm k'iwu ichadanẹ. Okenaka, ny'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, màkwoka ọwọhng; zaabẹ́ ode k'ọyaabhagbe, obir ode k'ẹphawu.<verse eid="EXO 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 34:22" />“Màsi Odidaama kw'Ipha s'acheden-chiduk p'ekpo py'matubhọ z'abọnga k'iwonọ, ọmaana Odidaama kw'Ipha s'wit, ọttara Odidaama kw'Ekpo otitobha k'ẹkpọka ch'icho. <verse eid="EXO 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 34:23" />Igbedim ittaan k'icho, ajinọng maphyir mm'ad-akwu k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Ẹfa maphyir, kw'ode Ibinọkpaabyi kw'Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 34:24" />Kaam m'nkwubh nkọma s'ining bọnga k'ititika, mbir nsi ibhon sabọnga imaama ikpan nnem sabọnga. K'ogbe kw'mm'akwu k'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga ny'igbedim njo ittaan s'icho, ọnọng kode kw'im'okkerẹ izek sabọnga ichen.<verse eid="EXO 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 34:25" />“M'ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'make yist kàttara k'izẹ s'mm'atima afọhnọ ẹja anang-m. Nkàtte eten ch'matim afọhnọ ẹja ch'Odidaama kw'Pasova eninga maa, ewu esobha.<verse eid="EXO 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 34:26" />“Acheden-chiduk p'ajibh ọtam ny'abọnga k'izek, bẹ p'mm'atima akwu z'ọsọhm kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kwabọnga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EXO 34:26">“M'ovunwa k'abasi p'ọkka kawọhn.”<verse eid="EXO 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 34:27" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Kkẹr idik njoma ọkkẹr, kirẹ idik nja jọ s'ntim nsi echekẹ nnang kọ ọttara anọng p'Israẹl.” <verse eid="EXO 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 34:28" />Wa Mosẹs oning nya ọmaana Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'iyawu arọbh afa ọmaana irungiwu arọbh afa, ọttọhk kochi, asi kobir ogwo. Ny'ata mbo bọ p'uwa ọkkẹrẹ igbaakadik njo s'echekẹ, kw'ode asana mbo ijobh p'Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ititika s'Mosẹs inna-ọnna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 34:29" />K'ogbe kw'Mosẹs kk'ọsaka z'egbe ch'Sinai ttara ata mbo afa ny'ikẹ k'mbọhk p'ọkkẹr asana, kozong bẹ́, ititika sẹ ninna <char style="it">mawere-were</char>, okurọ ch'ikẹ ọmaana Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi nkk'ayok odik agbaaka. <verse eid="EXO 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 34:30" />Ch'Aarọn ọmaana anọng p'Israẹl maphyir nnaze Mosẹs, ititika sẹ ninna <char style="it">mawere-were</char>. Ofona nya o, ojor bẹ bẹ́, manyọm-ẹ z'ifor. <verse eid="EXO 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 34:31" />Okenaka, Mosẹs oyerẹ bẹ. Minna kw'Aarọn ọttara asogbọhkọnọng p'obhon nwo maphyir makpa nnam akebh-ẹ. Ọgbaak odik ọnang bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 34:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 34:32" />Ọgbaak bẹ nya o, anọng p'Israẹl maphyir mazenga anyọm-ẹ. Mosẹs o, ọnang bẹ asana maphyir p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ọnang-ẹ z'egbe ch'Sinai.<verse eid="EXO 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 34:33" />Ch'Mosẹs kk'bẹ idik nja ọgbaaka maphyir o, otima ẹbarakpa obubha ititika sẹ. <verse eid="EXO 34:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 34:34" />K'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'odimẹ okebh Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi bẹ́, magbaak odik, od-owonga ẹbarakpa ndo z'ititika. Íkk'oyina k'iyaan, otek anọng p'Israẹl asana maphyir p'Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena, <verse eid="EXO 34:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 34:35" />maze bẹ́, ititika sẹ ninna<char style="it">mawere-were</char>. Minna kw'Mosẹs m'obir obubha ẹbarakpa ndo z'ikẹ k'ititika maa, opyirẹ k'ogbe kw'im'obir ochina za ch'ikẹ ọmaana Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mm'agbaak odik.<verse eid="EXO 34:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EXO 35" />
  <para style="s1">Apaanga p'amaan Ẹwọhngkwokawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 35:1" />Mosẹs oyerẹ anọng p'Israẹl maphyir mattonga. Oben bẹ bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode idik s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena bẹ́, masi: <verse eid="EXO 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 35:2" />K'iwu ichadanẹ, mm'ad-asi ọtọhm, okenaka, k'ewu ch'ettong ichenọmfa, màkwoka ọwọhng, mabir asok chẹ mach'Ẹwọhngkwokawu ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ch'ewur-owur. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'osi ọtọhm ny'ewu ndo, mm'afhẹ-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 35:3" />M'ekpon kayenẹ k'ibyi kpenamkpen s'marukọ ny'Ẹwọhngkwokawu ndo.”<verse eid="EXO 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nnanga s'anọng anangẹ k'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi osisi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 25:1-9">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga 25.1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 35:4" />Mosẹs oben obhon kw'Israẹl maphyir bẹ́, “Ma wọ ode odik kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, masi: <verse eid="EXO 35:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 35:5" />Màrọbha ẹnanga ny'ekpo py'mayen, nang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'ofon-ẹ z'ettem, tte otima gol, ọmaana silva, ọmaana bronz, okwu ọnang Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 35:6" />Tte obir otima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọmaana mbaradik ọkkọkka, ọmaana avu-phyabha, <verse eid="EXO 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 35:7" />ọmaana ntenkpa s'arọkimaandim s'mafok asikora, ọmaana ntenkpa s'ichọr-ọchọro, ọttara nchi s'akasiya. <verse eid="EXO 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 35:8" />Tte obir otima ana p'oliv p'ekpon oyiyenẹ, ọmaana ekpo py'mad-atima asi ana p'mad-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, ọmaana insẹns, <verse eid="EXO 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 35:9" />ọmaana ata p'oniks, ọmaana ata ọkkọkka mboza p'mm'agbana <char style="w" lemma="ẹphọd">ny'ẹphọd</char>, ọmaana ny'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma.<verse eid="EXO 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 35:10" />“Amengkkanọng maphyir p'aning ny'abọnga k'ikpakaana màkwu asi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena bẹ́, masi: <verse eid="EXO 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 35:11" />kw'ode iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọmaana ikkira sẹ, ọmaana ebubha chẹ, ọmaana mgbaka sẹ, ọmaana mkpọmmachi sẹ, ọmaana nzemachi sẹ, ọmaana achiva p'adum-odum pẹ, ọttara arin pẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 35:12" />ọmaana Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, ọmaana nchi s'idum-odum sẹ, ọmaana efokọkpa chẹ, ọttara ibara s'ọmma s'ibubh-ẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 35:13" />ọmaana okpokkoro, ọmaana nchi s'idum-odum sẹ, ọmaana ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọttara brẹd kw'awuriji kw'Ibinọkpaabyi; <verse eid="EXO 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 35:14" />ọmaana etorongkkang-nana ch'ekpon oyiyenẹ ttara ekpo pyẹ, ọmaana atorongkkang ttara ana pabẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 35:15" />ọmaana ija-byi s'insẹns, ttara nchi sẹ s'idum-odum, ọmaan ana p'mad-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, ọmaana insẹns kw'olebh eruk, ọttara ibara s'ọmma s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi; <verse eid="EXO 35:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 35:16" />ọmaana ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ s'matim bronz asi, ch'ezeng ẹmaana ọkkẹng kwẹ, ọmaana nchi sẹ s'idum-odum, ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir; ọmaana ọgbangbang kw'ode bronz, ttara ẹnana chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 35:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 35:17" />ọbara f'ọmma f'eterttem, ttara mkpọmmachi sẹ, ọmaana arin pabẹ, ọttara ibara s'ọmma kw'ẹmmakwukden ch'eterttem; <verse eid="EXO 35:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 35:18" />ọmaana abhing p'ikkira s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọmaana p'eterttem, ọttara ndik sabẹ; <verse eid="EXO 35:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 35:19" />ọmaana ẹnya ch'mayok-oyok ch'mmin'atima asi ọtọhm z'ibyi s'awuriji, ch'ede ẹnya ch'awuriji ch'Aarọn kw'ode ọfọhn-nja, ọmaana ch'ajinọngva pẹ mmad-afọra k'ogbe kw'masi ọtọhm f'ẹjafọhnọ.”<verse eid="EXO 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 35:20" />Nya o, anọng p'Israẹl maphyir mabina z'Mosẹs k'ititika. <verse eid="EXO 35:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 35:21" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen ọdaak-ẹ z'ettem, obir ofon-ẹ z'ettem, ọkpa nnam ochena Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ẹnanga k'ose kw'ọtọhm f'ikkira s'etobha ọmaana f'nnya s'awuriji im'ochina ororo. <verse eid="EXO 35:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 35:22" />Nya o, ajinọng ọmaana panọng maphyir p'ofon bẹ z'nttem, makwu. Ayok banẹ atima ẹfangkpo k'akira k'akira py'matim gol asi, py'ede abaangakpa, ọmaana ekpo py'itọhng, ọttara mbaanga s'ẹnọhna. Bẹ maphyir matima ekpo py'gol achena Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'ẹnanga ch'ewokọ. <verse eid="EXO 35:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 35:23" />Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'oyen ndik s'ide blu, wanẹma s'ikorọ isiso, wanẹma s'ikorọ izizẹ, wanẹma ndik ọkkọkka s'mayok-oyok, wanẹma avu-phyabha, wanẹma ntenkpa s'arọkimaandim s'mafok asikora, wanẹma ntenkpa njoza s'ichọhr-ọchọhrọ, otima jẹ okwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 35:24" />Ayok mbo p'anang ẹnanga ch'silva, wanẹma ch'bronz, matọk achena Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi mach'ẹnanga. Ọnọng kpenamkpen kw'obir oyena nchi s'akasiya p'itọhmgbaakẹ kpenamkpen, otima okwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 35:25" />Kwanọng kpenamkpen kw'oyen emengkka ch'ọttọhk oyiyok, otima mbọhk sẹ oyok ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara ndik ọkkọkka, otima okwu nya. <verse eid="EXO 35:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 35:26" />Panọng maphyir p'ofon bẹ z'nttem, matima emengkka chabẹ ayok avu-phyabha. <verse eid="EXO 35:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 35:27" />Ata p'oniks, ọmaana ata ọkkọkka mboza p'mm'agbana ny'ẹphọd, ọmaana ny'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, bẹ bọ p'asonọng atim akwu. <verse eid="EXO 35:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 35:28" />Ekpo py'mabir atima akwu, ede ekpo py'ed-esi ọttọhk olebh eruk, ọmaana ana p'oliv p'ekpon oyiyenẹ, ọmaana ana p'nd-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, ọttara insẹns. <verse eid="EXO 35:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 35:29" />Anọng p'Israẹl k'ejinọng ọttara k'ẹpanọng maphyir, matima nnanga sabẹ k'ose kw'ofon bẹ z'nttem, machena Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ọtọhm f'ikk'ozenga k'Mosẹs oben bẹ bẹ́, masi.<verse eid="EXO 35:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bẹzalẹl ọmaana Oholiyab</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="EXO 31:1-11">Nnwẹr kw'Ozenga 31.1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 35:30" />Nya o, Mosẹs oben anọng p'Israẹl bẹ́, “Màkirẹ e, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi kk'Bẹzalẹl kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Uri, nnwa kw'Hur, oteka. Kẹ ofon k'efona ch'Juda. <verse eid="EXO 35:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 35:31" />Ibinọkpaabyi kk'ẹ egwugwuma chẹ ọnanga, ọmaana ezonga, ọmaana ọyaanttaana, ọmaana edikzonga, ọttara mmengkkakira maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 35:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 35:32" />Kẹ m'od-otima gol, ọmaana silva, ọttara bronz odoka ekpo. <verse eid="EXO 35:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 35:33" />Kẹ m'ọd-ọkkẹbh ata otima osi ekpo, ọgwa nchi, obir osi mmengkkakira maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 35:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 35:34" />Ibinọkpaabyi kk'Bẹzalẹl ọmaana Oholiyab kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Ahisamak, kw'ofon k'efona ch'Dan ẹfa ọnanga bẹ́, m'akpebhẹ ayok mboza. <verse eid="EXO 35:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 35:35" />Kẹ kk'bẹ emengkka ọnanga ch'mm'atima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara ndik ọkkọkka, asi itọhmkira maphyir s'omengkkanọng od-osi, mach'ekpo okkikkẹr k'ata, ọmaana ekpo odidoka, ọmaana ekpo oyiyok. Bẹ maphyir m'ade amengkkanọng ọmaana adok-ekpo.<verse eid="EXO 35:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EXO 36" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 36:1" />“Nya o, wa itọhm maphyir s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi osisi, nining k'mbọhk s'Bẹzalẹl, ọmaana Oholiyab, ọttara omengkkanọng kpenamkpen kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'emengkka ọttara ẹfa ọnanga bẹ́, mazonga ose k'mm'asi ọtọhm mvo ator k'ose kw'Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'bẹ obena.”<verse eid="EXO 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 36:2" />Mosẹs o, oyerẹ Bẹzalẹl ọmaana Oholiyab, ọttara omengkkanọng kpenamkpen kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ ẹfa ọnanga, kw'obir ofon-ẹ z'ettem bẹ́, okwu osi ọtọhm mvo. <verse eid="EXO 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 36:3" />Matọka ẹtọhmkpo mbyo maphyir py'anọng p'Israẹl nkk'ananga z'Mosẹs k'mbọhk bẹ́, matima asi ọtọhm f'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. K'ekpebha kpenamkpen, anọng p'Israẹl achina ororo anang ẹtọhmkpo py'efon bẹ z'nttem. <verse eid="EXO 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 36:4" />Ofona nya, amengkkanọng mbo maphyir p'mad-asi ọtọhm mvo f'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, mabina arik itọhm sabẹ, <verse eid="EXO 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 36:5" />makwu aben Mosẹs bẹ́, “Ẹtọhmkpo py'anọng nkk'ananga ma, kk'ẹsaabha ẹyọhnga ọtọhm f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi obenẹ bẹ́, mosi.”<verse eid="EXO 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 36:6" />Minna kw'Mosẹs ọnang ẹfa, makpaanga awon ẹmọng z'ibhinga-byi maphyir bẹ́, “Tte ojinọng kpenamkpen, ozeng k'kwanọng, ọkpọka ẹnanga kpenamkpen oninang ch'echin k'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi osisi.” Nya o, wa makpọka anọng mbo bẹ́, maning ọdọk nnanga atim akwu, <verse eid="EXO 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 36:7" />okurọ bẹ́, ẹtọhmkpo py'nkk'ayena, kk'ẹsaabha ẹyọhnga itọhm maphyir s'mm'asi.<verse eid="EXO 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matọm iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi osisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 36:8" />Amengkkanọng maphyir p'uwa aning ny'ikpakaana s'atọhmnọng, masi ọbara f'ọmma ijobh. Wa matim mmọradik ọkkọkka, ọmaana ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọttara s'ikorọ izizẹ, mayok ọbara mvo f'ọmma. Omengkkanọng oyok acherubim nya. <verse eid="EXO 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 36:9" />Ọbara mvo f'ọmma maphyir ode mbengana. Adum pabẹ ade ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ afa, ẹkpa chabẹ ede ntọkọ nchadanẹ <verse eid="EXO 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 36:10" />Wa makọma ọbara mvo ochen f'ọmma k'ẹkpa madanẹ, mabir asi mvoza ochen minna. <verse eid="EXO 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 36:11" />Masi adik-pe p'ade blu ny'ẹbaramma ch'ibara s'ọmma s'ikpa nso k'ẹkpa danẹ, mabir asi minna z'ibara s'ọmma s'ikpa nso z'ẹkpa ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 36:12" />Mabir asi adik-pe arọbh afa okwuma ijobh k'ibara majanẹ, ọmaana adik-pe arọbh afa okwuma ijobh z'ikpongannam-bara s'ẹkpa ndoza. Adik-pe mbo aninga akkerẹ ayok ititika. <verse eid="EXO 36:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 36:13" />Mabir atima gol asi mgbaka arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh, matima abọka mkpa njo mfa s'ọbara f'ọmma k'ibyi majanẹ, ọfha iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi ide ibyi majanẹ.<verse eid="EXO 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 36:14" />Matima avu-phyabha asi ọbara f'ọmma ijobh kawanẹ, mabubha z'ẹrọng-ẹrọng kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 36:15" />Wa ọbara mvo ijobh kawanẹ f'ọmma maphyir, ode mbengana. Adum pabẹ ade ntọkọ arọbh afa obhirẹ achen, ẹkpa chabẹ ede ntọkọ nchadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 36:16" />Makọma ọbara mvo ochen f'ọmma k'ẹkpa madanẹ, mabir akọma mvoza ochadanẹ k'ẹkpa ọdọk-ọdọk. <verse eid="EXO 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 36:17" />Masi adik-pe arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh ny'ammabọhra p'ibara s'ọmma s'ikpa nso k'ẹkpa danẹ, mabir asi minna z'ammabọhra p'ibara s'ọmma s'ikpa nso z'ẹkpa ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 36:18" />Matima bronz asi adik-pe arọbh afa obhirẹ ijobh, matima abọka ikkira njo k'ibyi majanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 36:19" />Matima ntenkpa s'arọkimaandim s'nkk'asi-kora afoka, mabubha ikkira njo, pira nnatim ntenkpa ọdọk-ọdọk s'ichọhr-ọchọhrọ mado abubha z'ẹrọng.<verse eid="EXO 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 36:20" />Matima echi ch'akasiya masi mmakwukchi s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 36:21" />Adum p'ẹmmakwukchi kpenamkpen nya, ede ntọkọ ichi, ẹkpa ede ntọkọ mfa obhirẹ akaana attaan, <verse eid="EXO 36:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 36:22" />ọmaana aso afa pabẹ p'masokọ mbengana, mage akkerẹ ayok. Minna wọ kw'uwa masi mmakwukchi njo maphyir s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 36:23" />Wa masi mmakwukchi ẹrọbh z'ẹwọn-ẹwọna kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 36:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 36:24" />mabir atima silva asi arin arọbh afa ny'izek-izek kwabẹ, arin afa k'ẹmmakwukchi, ọmaana orin mawanẹ k'izek-izek kw'ẹmmakwukchi kpenamkpen ch'ege-oge. <verse eid="EXO 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 36:25" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza ch'ebir-ebir kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, masi mmakwukchi ẹrọbh, <verse eid="EXO 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 36:26" />ọmaana arin arọbh afa p'matim silva asi, arin afa k'izek-izek kw'ẹmmakwukchi kpenamkpen. <verse eid="EXO 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 36:27" />Mabir asi mmakwukchi ichadanẹ z'nnam-nnam kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ, <verse eid="EXO 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 36:28" />ọmaana mmakwukchi mfa s'abongọ p'nnam-nnam kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi. <verse eid="EXO 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 36:29" />M'abongọ mba afa, mmakwukchi njo mfa s'ikkerẹ ayok, itọm z'ẹwọr maa, id-iyika aso k'oringẹ mawanẹ z'ẹrọng. <verse eid="EXO 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 36:30" />Nya o, wa mmakwukchi ide ochenọntaan, ọmaana arin ichi kkawanẹ p'matim silva asi, arin afa k'ẹmmakwukchi kpenamkpen.<verse eid="EXO 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 36:31" />Matima agbaaka p'akasiya masi nzemachi, matima agbaaka achen masi mmakwukchi s'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 36:32" />nzemachi nchen ininga k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ ch'mmakwukchi njoza, njoza nchen ininga z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza ch'nzemachi s'nnam-nnam kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ. <verse eid="EXO 36:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 36:33" />Masi ezemachi ch'ettem, ọfha ẹtọhnga ọmaana nzemachi ny'njeka, k'okwubha k'okwubha. <verse eid="EXO 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 36:34" />Matima gol abhọrọ nzemachi njo, mabir atima gol asi aringẹ p'mm'atima abọka jẹ. Pira nnatim gol abhọrọ jẹ maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 36:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 36:35" />Matima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka, makwum ibara s'ọmma s'omengkkanọng ikk'acherubim oyoka nya. <verse eid="EXO 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 36:36" />Matima echi ch'akasiya masi mkpọmmachi nna s'ibara s'ọmma, matima gol abhọrọ jẹ. Mabir atima gol asi mgbaka sabẹ, pira nnatim silva arabha arin pabẹ anna. <verse eid="EXO 36:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 36:37" />Ny'ikkiramma njo, matima ndik s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka, makwum ibara s'ọmma s'omengkkanọng ikk'odoka. <verse eid="EXO 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 36:38" />Mabir asi mkpọmmachi nchen ttara mgbaka sabẹ. Matima gol abhọrọ aso p'mkpọmmachi njo ttara mbarakpa sabẹ, pira nnatim bronz asi arin nna pabẹ.<verse eid="EXO 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EXO 37" />
  <para style="s">Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 37:1" />Wa Bẹzalẹl otim echi ch'akasiya osi Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ. Adum pẹ ade ntọkọ nttaan ọmaana akaana attaan, ẹkpa ọmaana agoriji pẹ made ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 37:2" />Otima gol ọkkọkka ọbhọrọ z'ẹtaanga, ọttara k'iyaan. Obir otima gol odoka ọkọbha. <verse eid="EXO 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 37:3" />Otima gol ọrabha aringẹ anna, ọgbaka ny'mmo sẹ nna, aringẹ afa k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ, mboza afa z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza. <verse eid="EXO 37:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 37:4" />Otima echi ch'akasiya osi nchi s'idum-odum, otima gol ọbhọrọ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 37:5" />Oke nchi njo s'idum-odum ny'aringẹ p'abem p'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, mfha mad-abọka nya atinẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 37:6" />Obir otima gol ọkkọkka osi efokọkpa ch'adum pẹ made ntọkọ nttaan ọmaana akaana osowanẹ, ẹkpa ede ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 37:7" />Oduk gol otima osi acherubim afa z'ẹkpọka ch'ọkpa nwo. <verse eid="EXO 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 37:8" />Osi cherub mawanẹ k'eso danẹ, osi nwoza z'eso ndoza; osi pyẹ ọgbaka ny'ọkpa nwo. <verse eid="EXO 37:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 37:9" />Wa acherubim mbo amaam mbubaang sabẹ k'ẹrọng, matima abubha ọkpa nwo kw'efokọ. Acherubim mbo makkerẹ ayok ititika, marọn ny'ọkpa nwo.<verse eid="EXO 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masi okpokkoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 37:10" />Wa matim echi ch'akasiya asi okpokkoro kw'adum pẹ ade ntọkọ nttaan, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtọkọ madanẹ ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, agoriji pẹ made ntọkọ mfa ọmaana akaana attaan. <verse eid="EXO 37:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 37:11" />Otima gol ọkkọkka ọbhọrọ, obir otima gol odoka abem pẹ ọkọbha. <verse eid="EXO 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 37:12" />Mabir asi oringẹ kw'obeng ẹkpa mach'ẹbọhkkpattem, matima gol adok-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 37:13" />Matima gol arabha aringẹ anna p'okpokkoro nwo, magbaka ny'abongọ pẹ anna, nya ch'mmo sẹ nna ining. <verse eid="EXO 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 37:14" />Aringẹ mbo aning anyọma ope nwo, ọfha ẹbọka nchi njo s'idum-odum s'nd-atima atinẹ okpokkoro nwo. <verse eid="EXO 37:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 37:15" />Wa matima echi ch'akasiya asi nchi s'idum-odum s'nd-atima atinẹ okpokkoro nwo, matima gol abhọrọ jẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 37:16" />Wa mabir atima gol ọkkọkka asi ekpokira py'im'eninga ny'okpokkoro nwo, mach'agbangbang p'ọchattọhk, ọmaana agbẹrkpa, ọmaana agbobhmbọhk, ọttara akkọbh p'mm'ad-atima asi nnanga s'atuk obyibyenga.<verse eid="EXO 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Etorongkkang-nana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 37:17" />Matima gol ọkkọkka asi etorongkkang-nana. Maduk orin ọmaana ochi kwẹ oduk, mabir asi akọbh pẹ p'akerẹ agbok, ọmaana agbok p'nkk'amaama magbaka k'ibyi majanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 37:18" />Abọhnga achadanẹ matọhnga ny'abem p'etorongkkang-nana ndo, attaan aninga k'obem wanẹ, attaan aninga z'okwubha nwoza. <verse eid="EXO 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 37:19" />Akkọbh attaan p'akerẹ agbok p'almọn p'nkk'amaama, maninga k'ẹbọhnga madanẹ, attaan aninga z'ẹbọhnga ndoza ch'ẹnyọm-ẹ. Minna kw'obir ode z'abọhnga mbo achadanẹ maphyir p'afon ny'etorongkkang-nana ndo. <verse eid="EXO 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 37:20" />Etorongkkang-nana ndo wa eyen akkọbh anna p'akerẹ agbok p'almọn, ọmaana agbok p'nkk'amaama. <verse eid="EXO 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 37:21" />Ogbok mawanẹ oninga ny'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'achi eden ny'etorongkkang-nana ndo. Ogbok ttonga afa oninga ny'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'attong afa. Ogbok ttong attaan oninga ny'izek-izek kw'abọhnga afa p'attong attaan. K'ibungọ-k'ibungọ, nokwu ode abọhnga achadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 37:22" />Agbok ọmaana abọhnga mbo maphyir nekwu ede ọttọhk mavanẹ ọmaana etorongkkang-nana ndo ch'madukọ gol ọkkọkka atima asi.<verse eid="EXO 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 37:23" />Matima gol ọkkọkka asi atorongkkang achenọmfa pẹ, ọmaana itorongkkang-nọm, ọttara akkoriya pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 37:24" />Mabir atima talẹnt mawanẹ kw'gol ọkkọkka, masi etorongkkang-nana ndo, ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir.<verse eid="EXO 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ija-byi s'insẹns</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 37:25" />Wa matim nchi s'akasiya asi ija-byi s'insẹns. Ẹkpa ọttara adum pẹ made mbengana. Adum pẹ made ẹtọkọ madanẹ ọmaana ibhaaka, ẹkpa chẹ ede ẹtọkọ madanẹ ọmaana ibhaaka, agoriji pẹ made ntọkọ nttaan. Abhik pẹ mabir agbaka nya amaan-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 37:26" />Matima gol ọkkọkka abhọrọ jẹ z'ẹrọng, ọmaana z'akongọ pẹ, ọttara z'abhik pẹ, pira nnatim gol adoka jẹ akọbha. <verse eid="EXO 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 37:27" />Wa matima gol asi aringẹ afa, ny'izek-izek kw'edoka ndo, afa-afa k'okwubha k'okwubha, mfha ẹbọka achiva mbo p'adum-odum s'nd-atima atinẹ. <verse eid="EXO 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 37:28" />Matima echi ch'akasiya masi achiva p'adum-odum, pira matima gol abhọrọ jẹ maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 37:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 37:29" />Mabir asi ana p'awuriji p'nd-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, ọttara insẹns ọkkọkka kw'omengkkanọng kw'od-osi ana p'alebh eruk, osi.<verse eid="EXO 37:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EXO 38" />
  <para style="s">Ija-byi s'nnanga s'ẹkwọmọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 38:1" />Wa matim agbaaka p'akasiya asi ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ. Agoriji pẹ made ntọkọ ichenọmfa ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, ẹkpa chẹ ede ntọkọ ichadanẹ ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, masẹ-ẹ mbengana k'ẹkpa. <verse eid="EXO 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 38:2" />Masi abhik anna ny'abongọ mbo, k'ose kw'abhik ọmaana ija-byi njo nnakwu ade ọttọhk mavanẹ, matima bronz abhọrọ ija-byi njo maphyir. <verse eid="EXO 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 38:3" />Matima bronz asi ekpo py'ija-byi mach'ọzọhka, ọmaana asọvẹl, ọmaana agbangbang, ọmaana agbindara p'ayen asa, ọttara ezengakpa. <verse eid="EXO 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 38:4" />Matima bronz ayok ọkkẹng asok ny'ibhaang kw'izek-izek kw'ija-byi njo. <verse eid="EXO 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 38:5" />Matima bronz asi aringẹ p'mabọk mkpọmmachi ny'abongọ anna p'ọkkẹng nwo. <verse eid="EXO 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 38:6" />Matima akasiya asi mkpọmmachi, matima bronz abubha. <verse eid="EXO 38:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 38:7" />Manọhma nchi njo s'idum-odum ny'aringẹ mbo p'aning ny'abongọ p'ija-byi, mfha nd-atima atinẹ jẹ. Matima agbaaka p'awer-owerẹ asi ija-byi njo itte eje ny'ettem.<verse eid="EXO 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ọgbangbang kw'ẹttọhkgbobhọ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 38:8" />Wa matim abazẹkwubh p'panọng p'ad-asi ọtọhm ny'ebhumma ch'ikkiramma s'etobha, asi ọgbangbang kw'bronz, ọmaana ẹnana chẹ.<verse eid="EXO 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eterttem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 38:9" />Wa mabira asi eterttem. Z'ẹwọn-ẹwọna, adum pẹ ade ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh, ebir eyena ọbara f'ọmma f'matim mmọradik ọkkọkka ayok. <verse eid="EXO 38:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 38:10" />Matima bronz ayok mkpọmmachi ẹrọbh, ọmaana arin pabẹ ẹrọbh. Mabir atima silva asi ager, ọttara mbarakpa ny'mkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 38:11" />Z'ebir-ebir, wa adum ade ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh; mkpọmmachi ẹrọbh ibe za, ọmaana arin pabẹ p'bronz. Matima mgbaka ottara ager p'silva arena mbarakpa ny'mkpọmmachi.<verse eid="EXO 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 38:12" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-edimẹ, ọbara f'ọmma obir ode ntọkọ arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh; mkpọmmachi ẹrọbh ibe za, ọmaana arin pabẹ p'bronz. Matima mgbaka ottara ager p'silva arena mbarakpa ny'mkpọmmachi. <verse eid="EXO 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 38:13" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ch'ewuchen ed-eyin, ẹkpa ch'eterttem ede ntọkọ arọbh attaan obhirẹ ichi. <verse eid="EXO 38:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 38:14" />Adum p'ọbara f'ọmma f'oren k'ẹbhaakẹ danẹ ch'ebhumma ede ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ afa, ọmaana akaana achadanẹ. Mkpọmmachi nttaan ibe za, ọttara arin pabẹ attaan. <verse eid="EXO 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 38:15" />Z'ẹbhaakẹ ndoza ch'ebhumma, adum p'ọbara f'ọmma obir ode ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ afa, ọmaana akaana achadanẹ. Mkpọmmachi nttaan, ọttara arin pabẹ attaan mabir abe za. <verse eid="EXO 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 38:16" />Ọbara f'ọmma maphyir f'ọkọm eterttem ndo, wa matim ọbara ọkkọkka f'mayok-oyok, asi. <verse eid="EXO 38:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 38:17" />Wa matim bronz asi arin p'mkpọmmachi njo. Matima silva asi mgbaka ọmaana ager p'mkpọmmachi, mabir atima silva abubha ẹrọng-ẹrọng kwabẹ, mfha mkpọmmachi njo maphyir s'eterttem ndo, eyena mbarakpa s'silva.<verse eid="EXO 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 38:18" />Ibara s'maren ny'ebhumma ch'eterttem ndo iyen ase p'ade blu, ọmaana p'akorọ isiso, ọttara p'akorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka s'okwum-ekpo ikk'oyoka maa, ijibh. Wa adum pẹ ade ntọkọ ẹrọbh obhirẹ ijobh, agoriji pẹ mabir ade ntọkọ ichenọmfa ọmaana akaana achadanẹ, mach'ọbara f'eterttem ndo, <verse eid="EXO 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 38:19" />ọmaana mkpọmmachi nna s'bronz, ọttara arin pabẹ anna p'bronz. Matima silva asi mgbaka ọmaana ager pabẹ, mabir atima silva abubha ẹrọng-ẹrọng kwabẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 38:20" />Wa matim bronz asi abhing p'ikkira s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi maphyir, ọttara eterttem.<verse eid="EXO 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹtọhmkpo py'matim asi iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 38:21" />Ma wọ ode obhik f'ẹtọhmkpo py'iwa matim asi iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode iruk-byi s'Asana, k'ose kw'uwa Mosẹs obenẹ anọng p'Lẹvi bẹ́, makkẹr. Itamar, kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Aarọn, obir ode ọfọhn-nja, ọd-ọtọhn bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 38:22" />Bẹzalẹl kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Uri, kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Hur, kw'ofon k'efona ch'Juda, wọ osi ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena bẹ́, osi. <verse eid="EXO 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 38:23" />Wa otim Oholiyab kw'ode ojinọngnwa kw'Ahisamak kw'ofon k'efona ch'Dan, obir ode omengkkanọng kw'ọd-ọkkẹr ekpo k'ata, obir od-oduka ekpo, obir od-otima ndik oyok ekpo py'ede blu, ọmaana py'ede isiso, ọmaana py'ekorọ izizẹ, ọttara ọbara ọkkọkka. <verse eid="EXO 38:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 38:24" />Kibung-kibungọ, agol p'uwa mabin k'nnanga s'ewokọ p'matim k'ọtọhm f'ibyi s'awuriji maphyir ode atalẹnt ẹrọbh obhirẹ osowanẹ, ọmaana ashẹkẹl ẹnọhna obhirẹ arọbh ichi obhirẹ wanẹ obhirẹ ijobh, atorọ k'shẹkẹl kw'ibyi s'awuriji.<verse eid="EXO 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 38:25" />Asilva p'uwa matọk k'mbọhk s'anọng p'nkk'abhika p'aning ny'obhon k'ogbe kw'ẹnọngbhika, made atalẹnt arọbh achen, ọmaana ashẹkẹl nnọhna nna okwuma arọbh ochenọnttaan obhirẹ ichi, atorọ k'shẹkẹl kw'ibyi s'awuriji, <verse eid="EXO 38:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 38:26" />bẹka mawanẹ, kw'ode igboka s'shẹkẹl k'ọnọng-ọnọng, atorọ k'shẹkẹl kw'ibyi s'awuriji. Ajinọng maphyir p'uwa nkk'abhika, p'apyirẹ icho ẹrọbh makpan, wa made nnọhna arọbh achenọmfa obhirẹ ijobh. <verse eid="EXO 38:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 38:27" />Wa matim atalẹnt p'silva arọbh achen arabha arin p'ibyi s'awuriji, mabir atima atalẹnt arọbh achen asi nnana s'ọbara f'ọmma, talẹnt mawanẹ k'ẹnana madanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 38:28" />Wa matim ashẹkẹl nnọhna nna okwuma arọbh ochenọnttaan obhirẹ ichi, asi mgbaka s'mkpọmmachi, ọfha ebubha aso p'mkpọmmachi njo, mabir atima asi mbarakpa.<verse eid="EXO 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 38:29" />Bronz p'uwa abin z'nnanga s'ewokọ made atalẹnt arọbh attaan obhirẹ ijobh, ọttara ashẹkẹl nnọhna ichadanẹ. <verse eid="EXO 38:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 38:30" />Mabir atima bronz nwo asi nnana s'ẹsọhmma s'ikkira s'etobha, ọmaana ija-byi, ọmaana otergba, ttara ekpo py'etor-ẹ, <verse eid="EXO 38:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 38:31" />ọmaana nnana s'oterttem, ọmaana nsọhmma, ọttara abhing maphyir p'ikkira s'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ttara mbyo py'ening ẹkọbha eterttem ndo.<verse eid="EXO 38:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EXO 39" />
  <para style="s1">Nnya s'afọhn-nja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 39:1" />Wa matim ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọttara s'ikorọ izizẹ, mayok nnya s'ẹja ofufọhnọ z'ọsọhm kw'awuriji. Wa mabir ayok ẹnya ch'awuriji anang Aarọn k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹphọd</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 39:2" />Matima ndik s'ide gol, ọmaana s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka, asi <char style="w">ẹphọd</char>. <verse eid="EXO 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 39:3" />Maduk gol kw'ower-owerẹ, makpaara k'anaanga-k'anaanga, matima asi ndoka ny'ndik njo s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ide isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka s'nkk'emengkka atima ayok. <verse eid="EXO 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 39:4" />Masi mbarakpa magbana ny'mbubaang mfa s'ẹphọd, ọfha ẹkpẹ-ẹ ẹbọka. <verse eid="EXO 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 39:5" />Omengkkanọng otima ndik s'ide gol, ọmaana s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka, osi odikpa kw'erin ọgbaka ny'ẹphọd, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 39:6" />Mabẹ ata p'oniks nya ch'nkk'gol atima adoka, makkẹr ache p'ajinọngva p'Israẹl nya, mach'ẹkọhka. <verse eid="EXO 39:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 39:7" />Matọka ata mbo agbana ny'mbarakpa s'mbubaang s'ẹphọd, ọfha Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi od-otima ojima ajinọngva p'Israẹl, k'ose kw'ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 39:8" />Wa omengkkanọng oyok ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma. Wa mayokọ chẹ mach'ẹphọd kw'matim ndik s'ide gol ayok, ọmaana s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka. <verse eid="EXO 39:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 39:9" />Adum pẹ ọmaana ẹkpa chẹ made mbengana mach'ẹbọhkpattem, mabir anyọng-ẹ igbedim ifa.<verse eid="EXO 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 39:10" />Mabẹ ata p'ajibh-ojibh nya, k'akaana anna. Ny'ocheden-kaana, mabẹ ata p'ruby, ọmaana p'topaz, ọttara p'bẹril. <verse eid="EXO 39:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 39:11" />K'ọkaana ttong afa, mabẹ ata p'tọkwọis, ọmaana p'saphira, ọttara p'ẹmẹral. <verse eid="EXO 39:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 39:12" />K'ọkaana ttong attaan, mabẹ ata p'jasint, ọmaana p'agate, ọttara p'amẹtist. <verse eid="EXO 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 39:13" />K'ọkaana ttonga anna, mabẹ ata p'krisolita, ọmaana p'oniks, ọttara p'jaspa. Wa mabẹ ata mbo nya ch'nkk'gol atima adoka. <verse eid="EXO 39:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 39:14" />Wa ata mbo ade ijobh kkamfa. Ekpenamkpen eter eso ch'ojinọngnwa mawanẹ kw'Israẹl, ebir etima eche ch'ọnọng-ọnọng mach'ẹkọhka ny'nnọmma njo ijobh kkamfa s'isi Israẹl. <verse eid="EXO 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 39:15" />Matima gol ọkkọkka asi agbakkọhbhọva mach'edik ch'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma. <verse eid="EXO 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 39:16" />Matima gol asi ndoka mfa, mabir atima gol asi aringẹ afa. Pira nnagbak aringẹ mbo afa ny'aso afa p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma. <verse eid="EXO 39:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 39:17" />Mabir akpa agbakkọhbhọva mbo afa p'gol ny'aringẹ p'aso mbo p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, <verse eid="EXO 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 39:18" />makpa aso mboza p'agbakkọhbhọva mbo z'ndoka njo mfa, magbaka bẹ ny'mbarakpa s'ebubaang s'ining ny'ititika s'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 39:19" />Matima gol asi aringẹ afa magbana z'aso mboza afa p'ẹtaanga kw'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma, ch'ẹnyọm ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 39:20" />Mabir atima gol asi aringẹ afa ọdọk-ọdọk, magbaka ny'izek-izek kw'mbarakpa s'mbubaang, z'ititika-ititika kw'ẹphọd, ẹnyọma ẹbọhra ch'ẹrọng-ẹrọng kw'odikpa kw'ẹphọd. <verse eid="EXO 39:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 39:21" />Matima edik ch'ede blu akpa aringẹ p'ẹbarakpa ch'ittemmọma amaana z'aringẹ p'ẹphọd, ẹbọka z'odikpa kw'erin, ọfha ẹbarakpa ndo ch'ittemmọma ed-eninga <char style="it">ma sẹẹbh</char> ny'ẹphọd, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 39:22" />Omengkkanọng otima ibara s'ide blu jẹ-jẹ oyok ọnọhma-baba kw'ẹphọd, <verse eid="EXO 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 39:23" />oyena ọmma ny'ottem mach'ẹnọhmadọngọ kw'eso im'edim. Mabir atima ẹbarakpa ake ẹmma ny'ọmma nwo, ọfha oning ọyaakẹ. <verse eid="EXO 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 39:24" />Matima ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọmaana s'ikorọ izizẹ, ọttara mmọradik ọkkọkka, mayok apomegrenet akọbha ẹmmabọhra ch'ọnọhma-baba nwo. <verse eid="EXO 39:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 39:25" />Matima gol ọkkọkka asi akkaningkka magbana ny'njeka kw'pomegrenet akọbha ẹmmabọhra ch'ọnọhma-baba nwo. <verse eid="EXO 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 39:26" />Akkaningkka mbo ọmaana apomegrenet ajek ayok akọbha ny'ẹmmabọhra ch'ọnọhma-baba kw'Aarọn min'ọfọra k'ogbe kw'ọfọhn ẹja, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 39:27" />Omengkkanọng otima mbaradik ọkkọkka oyok akpaar-mbọhk p'apyirẹ ny'ndudungọ ọnang Aarọn ọmaana iva pẹ, <verse eid="EXO 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 39:28" />mabir atima mbaradik ọkkọkka ayok ibara s'eso odidabh, ọmaana okpo, ọttara ẹfọrakpo py'ẹtaanga py'matim mmọradik ọkkọkka ayok. <verse eid="EXO 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 39:29" />Omengkkanọng otima mmọradik ọkkọkka, ọmaana ndik s'ide blu, ọmaana s'ikorọ isiso, ọttara s'ikorọ izizẹ, osi odikpa, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 39:30" />Matima gol ọkkọkka asi ẹgbangbangkpa ch'awuriji, makkẹr nya mach'ẹkọhka bẹ́, AWURIJI AYEN ỌVAAR IBINỌKPAABYI. <verse eid="EXO 39:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 39:31" />Madabh edik ch'ede blu nya, ọfha ẹbọka z'ibara s'eso, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 39:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mosẹs ọbaan ọtọhm f'iruk-byi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 39:32" />Nya o, ọtọhm mvo maphyir f'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi kw'ode ikkira s'etobha osisi, okwu ọsa. Wa anọng p'Israẹl masi vẹ maphyir ator k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena. <verse eid="EXO 39:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 39:33" />Ofona nya, wa matinẹ iruk-byi njo achena Mosẹs: ikkira njo ọttara ekpo py'eyik z'ẹtaanga maphyir, py'ede mgbaka sẹ, ọmaana mmakwukchi, ọmaana nzemachi, ọmaana achiva p'adum-odum, ọttara arin pabẹ, <verse eid="EXO 39:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 39:34" />ọmaana etenkpa ch'ọrọkimaandim ch'mafok asi-kora, ọmaana etenkpa ọdọk-ọdọk ch'ẹchọr-ọchọrọ, ọttara ibara s'ọmma, <verse eid="EXO 39:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 39:35" />ọmaana Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ ttara mkpọmmachi sẹ, ọttara efokọkpa, <verse eid="EXO 39:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 39:36" />ọmaana okpokkoro ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọmaana brẹd kw'awuriji, <verse eid="EXO 39:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 39:37" />ọmaana etorongkkang-nana ch'matim gol ọkkọkka asi, ttara ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọttara ana p'oliv p'ekpon oyiyenẹ, <verse eid="EXO 39:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 39:38" />ọmaana ija-byi s'matim gol asi, ọmaana ana p'mad-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, ọmaana insẹns, ọttara ibara s'ọmma s'ẹmmakwukden s'ikkira njo, <verse eid="EXO 39:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EXO 39:39" />ọmaana ija-byi s'matim bronz asi, ttara ọkkẹng kwẹ kw'mabir atima bronz ayok, ọmaana nchi sẹ s'idum-odum, ọmaana ekpo pyẹ maphyir, ọmaana ọgbangbang ttara ẹnana chẹ, <verse eid="EXO 39:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EXO 39:40" />ọmaana ọbara f'ọmma f'eterttem, ttara nchi sẹ s'idum-odum, ọmaana arin pẹ, ọmaana ibara s'ọmma s'ẹmmakwukden ch'eterttem ndo, ọmaana ndik sẹ, ọttara abhik p'ikkira s'eterttem ndo, ọmaana ekpo py'eyik z'ẹtaanga kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode ikkira s'etobha, <verse eid="EXO 39:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EXO 39:41" />ọmaana nnya s'mayok-oyok s'Aarọn ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ mmad-afọra z'ibyi s'awuriji, k'ogbe kw'masi ọtọhm f'ẹja ofufọhnọ.<verse eid="EXO 39:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EXO 39:42" />Wa anọng p'Israẹl asi ọtọhm mvo maphyir ator k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena. <verse eid="EXO 39:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EXO 39:43" />Mosẹs o, ọbaana ọtọhm mvo maphyir, oze bẹ́, nkk'asa k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'obena. Ofona nya o, osi bẹ ittabọhng.<verse eid="EXO 39:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EXO 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ettima ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EXO 40:1" />Nya o, Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi oben Mosẹs bẹ́, <verse eid="EXO 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EXO 40:2" />“K'echedenwu ch'ochedenphe, ttima iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, kw'ode ikkira s'etobha. <verse eid="EXO 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EXO 40:3" />Sok Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ z'ẹtaanga, abir atima ibara s'ọmma abubh-ẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EXO 40:4" />Tima okpokkoro dim z'ẹtaanga, anana ekpo pyẹ nya. Atima etorongkkang-nana akwu, ayenẹ atorongkkang pẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EXO 40:5" />Sok ija-byi s'insẹns s'matim gol asi ny'ititika s'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ, agbana ọbara f'ọmma ny'ẹsọhmma ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EXO 40:6" />“Sok ija-byi s'nnanga okwukwọmọ ny'ititika kw'ẹsọhmma ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, z'ikkira s'etobha. <verse eid="EXO 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EXO 40:7" />Abir ake asi k'ogbobhmbọhk asok ny'njeka kw'ikkira s'etobha, ọmaana ija-byi. <verse eid="EXO 40:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EXO 40:8" />Si eterttem tima kọbh-ẹ ọkọbha, agbana ọbara f'ọmma ny'ẹmmakwukden ch'eterttem ndo.<verse eid="EXO 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EXO 40:9" />“Tọka ana p'mad-abyenga ọnọng k'eso, byenga ny'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọttara k'ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'oning nya. M'akọm-ẹ asok, ọmaana ekpo py'ndoka sẹ maphyir. Minna kw'im'izenga iwur. <verse eid="EXO 40:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EXO 40:10" />M'abir abyenga ana ny'ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ, ọmaana k'ọttọhk kpenamkpen f'oning nya. M'asi jẹ iwur, ibir iwur iyọhng-ọyọhnga. <verse eid="EXO 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EXO 40:11" />M'abir abyenga ana ny'ogbobhmbọhk, ọttara ny'ẹnana chẹ, asi pyẹ ewur.<verse eid="EXO 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EXO 40:12" />“Tima Aarọn, ọmaana ajinọngva pẹ kwu z'ẹsọhmma ch'ikkira s'etobha, atima asi agbobhọ bẹ. <verse eid="EXO 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EXO 40:13" />Fọra Aarọn ẹnya ch'awuriji, abyeng-ẹ ana k'eso, abir asẹ-ẹ owur, ọfha osi ọtọhm mach'ọfọhn-nja kwaam. <verse eid="EXO 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EXO 40:14" />M'abir atima ajinọngva pẹ akwu, afọra bẹ akpaar-mbọhk p'apyirẹ ny'ndudungọ. <verse eid="EXO 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EXO 40:15" />Byenga bẹ ana k'eso k'ose kw'uwa abyeng otte kwabẹ, mfha masi ọtọhm mach'afọhn-nja paam. Ana p'im'abyenga bẹ m'asi bẹ made afọhn-nja k'epemaanitor.” <verse eid="EXO 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EXO 40:16" />Mosẹs osi ọttọhk kpenamkpen k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EXO 40:17" />Nya wọ osi, wa mattima iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi ny'echedenwu ch'ochedenphe kw'icho ttong afa. <verse eid="EXO 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EXO 40:18" />K'ogbe kw'Mosẹs ottim iruk-byi njo s'Ibinọkpaabyi, wa ochi eden osi arin pabẹ, ofu mkpọmmachi, ọnọhma nzemachi nya, pira noffu achiva p'adum-odum. <verse eid="EXO 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EXO 40:19" />Okwu ọmmaama ikkira njo obubha z'ẹrọng kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, pira nodo jẹ obubha z'ẹrọng k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EXO 40:20" />Ọtọka ata p'makkẹrẹ Asana, oyika ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Echekẹ. Ọtọka achiva p'adum-odum, ọnọhma ny'Ẹkkọhbhọ ndo, pira ọtọka efokọkpa obubha nya. <verse eid="EXO 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EXO 40:21" />Minna kw'ọtọk Ẹkkọhbhọ ndo ch'Echekẹ, osok z'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọgbana ibara s'ọmma s'ikpa Ẹkkọhbhọ ch'Asana ayik, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EXO 40:22" />Mosẹs obera okpokkoro nwo z'ẹtaanga kw'ikkira s'etobha, k'iyaan-iyaan kw'ibara s'ọmma s'ining z'ebir-ebir kw'iruk-byi njo. <verse eid="EXO 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EXO 40:23" />Ọtọka brẹd ọnana ny'okpokkoro nwo kw'oning ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EXO 40:24" />Osok etorongkkang-nana ny'ikkira s'etobha, ekkerẹ okpokkoro ititika z'ẹwọn-ẹwọna kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, <verse eid="EXO 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EXO 40:25" />obir obera atorongkkang ny'ititika s'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EXO 40:26" />Mosẹs ọnana ija-byi njo s'matim gol asi z'ẹtaanga kw'ikkira s'etobha, ny'ititika s'ibara s'ọmma, <verse eid="EXO 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EXO 40:27" />ọkwọmọ insẹns nya k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena. <verse eid="EXO 40:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EXO 40:28" />Ọgbana ibara s'ọmma ny'ẹsọhmma ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi.<verse eid="EXO 40:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EXO 40:29" />Osi ija-byi s'ẹnanga okwukwọmọ inyọma ẹsọhmma ch'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, s'ide ikkira s'etobha. Otima nnanga s'ẹkwọmọ, ọttara nnanga s'agwu, ọfọhnọ ẹja nya, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'ẹ obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EXO 40:30" />Oke asi p'ẹttọhkgbobhọ k'ọgbangbang, obera ny'njeka kw'ikkira s'etobha ọmaana ija-byi njo. <verse eid="EXO 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EXO 40:31" />Mosẹs ọmaana Aarọn, ọttara ajinọngva p'Aarọn magbobhọ mbọhk ọttara mmokpatọkọ sabẹ nya. <verse eid="EXO 40:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EXO 40:32" />Wa magbobhọ mbọhk ọmaana mmokpatọkọ sabẹ k'ogbe kpenamkpen kw'madimẹ z'ikkira s'etobha, wanẹma, k'ogbe kw'mazeng anyọma ija-byi, k'ose kw'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ikk'Mosẹs obena.<verse eid="EXO 40:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EXO 40:33" />Nya o, Mosẹs ottima eterttem ọkọbha iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, ọmaana ija-byi, ọgbana ọbara f'ọmma ny'ẹsọhmma ch'eterttem ndo. Minna kw'uwa Mosẹs ocher ọtọhm mvo osisi.<verse eid="EXO 40:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EXO 40:34" />Nya o, ebonọ ebubha ikkira s'etobha, abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi maffu iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing.</char> <verse eid="EXO 40:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EXO 40:35" />Mosẹs ọdọk z'ikkira s'etobha kokpo odim, okurọ ch'ebonọ ikk'ẹsaka nya, abarada p'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi maffu iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi <char style="it">bẹ́ gbing.</char><verse eid="EXO 40:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EXO 40:36" />Ny'ozenga kw'uwa anọng p'Israẹl masi maphyir, ogbe kpenamkpen kw'ebonọ eyebhẹ ny'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi, mabina ozenga. <verse eid="EXO 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EXO 40:37" />Okenaka, óde ebonọ ndo ina eyebhẹ, m'ẹtọkọ masọbhọ, oye bẹ́, k'eyebha. <verse eid="EXO 40:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EXO 40:38" />K'ozenga maphyir kw'uwa anọng p'Israẹl masi, wa mad-aze ebonọ ch'Ọvaar Ibinọkpaabyi ch'ed-ebubha ny'ẹrọng kw'iruk-byi s'Ibinọkpaabyi k'ẹya; otum k'erungọ, maze ekpon ch'ẹd-ẹwọma nya.<verse eid="EXO 40:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EXO 40" />
</usx>